export const norwayCompanyCarTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"የኖርዌይ ኩባንያ የመኪና ታክስ ማስያ","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"የኖርዌይ ኩባንያ የመኪና ታክስ ማስያ 2026 - የሚታክስ ጥቅማ ጥቅም ግምት","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"ለመደበኛ ኩባንያ የመንገደኞች መኪና ለግል ጥቅም የኖርዌይን 2026 ታክስ የሚከፈል ጥቅም ይገምቱ። የዝርዝር ዋጋ፣ ብቁ ቅናሾች፣ ወራት እና የኅዳግ ታክስ ግምት ያስገቡ።","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"ከመደበኛ ኩባንያ የመንገደኞች መኪና የግል አጠቃቀም የኖርዌይ ታክስ የሚከፈልበትን የደመወዝ ጥቅማጥቅም ይገምቱ፣ ከዚያ በሚያስገቡት የኅዳግ መጠን የግል ታክስ ይገምቱ።","What does this estimate?":"ይህ ምን ይገመታል?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"ለኖርዌይ የ 2026 መደበኛ ደንቦች ጥቅሙ በመኪናው ዝርዝር ዋጋ ላይ የተመሰረተ ነው እንጂ የግዢ ዋጋ አይደለም. ካልኩሌተሩ የታተመውን ገደብ እና ተመኖች፣ ማንኛውም ብቁ የሆነ እድሜ ወይም የሰነድ የስራ-ማይሌጅ ቅነሳ እና የሚገኙትን የወራት ብዛት ይተገበራል።","How the estimate works":"ግምቱ እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"የ2026 መደበኛ ጥቅማጥቅም ከተቀነሰው የዝርዝር ዋጋ 30% እስከ 370,300 ክሮነር እና ከማንኛውም ትርፍ 20% ነው። የዝርዝር-ዋጋ መሠረት በመደበኛነት 100% ነው; መኪናው በጃንዋሪ 1 ከሶስት አመት በላይ ከሆነ ወይም በሰነድ የተረጋገጠ ስራ መንዳት ከ 40,000 ኪ.ሜ በላይ ከሆነ 75% እና ሁለቱም ሁኔታዎች ሲተገበሩ 56.25% ነው። ለአንድ ክፍል-ዓመት ሙሉ ወራትን አስገባ። የሚገመተው የግል ታክስ በራስዎ የኅዳግ መጠን ተባዝቶ የሚከፈል ጥቅማ ጥቅም ነው። ይህ ሙሉ የግብር ስሌት አይደለም።","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"ታክስ የሚከፈልበት ጥቅም እኔ ከምከፍለው ግብር ጋር እኩል ነው?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"ቁ. ጥቅማጥቅሙ በመደበኛ ደንቦች መሰረት ለግብር ደሞዝ ተጨምሯል. የተለየ የታክስ ግምት በሚያስገቡት የኅዳግ ተመን ያባዛዋል እና ሙሉ የኖርዌይ ታክስዎን አያሰላም።","Which car price should I enter?":"የትኛውን የመኪና ዋጋ ማስገባት አለብኝ?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"በኦፊሴላዊው ህግ መሰረት አግባብነት ያለው ፋብሪካ የተገጠመላቸው እና በአከፋፋይ የተጫኑ መሳሪያዎችን ጨምሮ የዝርዝሩን ዋጋ እንደ አዲስ ይጠቀሙ። የአሁኑን የገበያ ዋጋ ወይም ለአገልግሎት መኪና የከፈሉትን ዋጋ አይጠቀሙ።","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"የማይሌጅ ቅነሳን መቼ መጠቀም እችላለሁ?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"የስራ ማሽከርከር በብቃት ማይል መዝገብ ሲመዘገብ እና በዓመቱ ከ40,000 ኪሜ ሲበልጥ ብቻ ነው። በትክክል 40,000 ኪሜ ብቁ አይደለም. የግል ማሽከርከር የስራ ማይል ርቀት አይደለም።","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"ይህ እያንዳንዱን ተሽከርካሪ ወይም የድርጅት መኪና መያዣ ይሸፍናል?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"ቁ. የኖርዌይ መደበኛውን የመንገደኞች-የመኪና ህጎችን ብቻ ይሸፍናል። ልዩ ተሽከርካሪዎች, የቫኖች ክፍል 2, ነፃ እና የግለሰብ ልዩነቶች ከዚህ ግምት ውጭ ናቸው.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"የራስ-መኪና ንጽጽር-እንደ-መሰል ነው?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"ቁ. የገቡትን አመታዊ የመኪና ወጪ በኩባንያ-መኪና ጥቅማጥቅም ላይ ከሚገመተው የግል ታክስ ቀጥሎ ያስቀምጣል። እነዚያ የተለያዩ መለኪያዎች ናቸው; የአሰሪ ወጪዎችን፣ መልሶ ማካካሻዎችን፣ ፋይናንስን፣ ነዳጅን፣ የታክስ ቅነሳዎችን እና የግል ጥቅምን ሙሉ ዋጋ አያካትትም።","Norway scope and data date":"የኖርዌይ ስፋት እና የውሂብ ቀን","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"ይህ የ Skatteateten's 2026 መደበኛ ኩባንያ-የመኪና ዋጋዎችን በመጠቀም ኖርዌይ-ተኮር የእቅድ ግምት ነው, የ 16 October 2026. ደንቦቹ በዚህ ገጽ ላይ በተመረጠው ቋንቋ ላይ የተመካ አይደለም. ኦፊሴላዊ የግብር ተመላሽ, ሙሉ የታክስ ስሌት ወይም ህጋዊ ውሳኔ አይደለም. ልዩ ተሽከርካሪዎች እና ልዩ ሁኔታዎች አይካተቱም። በዚህ ግንባታ ውስጥ ተመኖች የማይለዋወጡ ናቸው እና ከበስተጀርባ አያድሱ; በእነሱ ላይ ከመታመንዎ በፊት ለአሁኑ ዓመት Skattetatenን ያረጋግጡ።","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"ስሌቶች በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይሰራሉ። የሚያስገቧቸው አሃዞች አልተሰቀሉም።","Estimate company-car benefit":"የኩባንያ-የመኪና ጥቅም ግምት","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ነጻ · በአሳሽዎ ውስጥ ይሰራል","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"የኖርዌይ 2026 መደበኛ ደንቦች ለተሳፋሪ መኪናዎች። ይህ ገጽ የግብር ሀገርዎን ከቋንቋዎ አይገምተውም።","Car list price when new, NOK":"የመኪና ዝርዝር ዋጋ አዲስ በሚሆንበት ጊዜ፣ NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"ሙሉ ወሩ መኪናው ነበር፣ 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"መኪናው ከ 3 ዓመታት በላይ በ 1 ጥር ላይ ነበር","Documented work driving during the year, km":"በዓመቱ ውስጥ በሰነድ የተደገፈ ሥራ መንዳት፣ ኪ.ሜ","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"ለሥራው ለማሽከርከር ብቁ የሆነ የርቀት መዝገብ አለኝ","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"የእርስዎ የሚገመተው የኅዳግ የታክስ መጠን፣ %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"የራስዎ መኪና አመታዊ ዋጋ፣ NOK (አማራጭ)","Calculate estimate":"ግምት አስላ","Reset inputs":"ግብዓቶችን ዳግም አስጀምር","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"የመጀመሪያውን የዝርዝር ዋጋ እና የሚገኙትን ወሮች ያስገቡ።","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"የዝርዝሩን ዋጋ፣ ወራት፣ ኪሎሜትሮች እና መቶኛ ያረጋግጡ። ልክ ያልሆኑ አሉታዊ እሴቶችን ያስገቡ።","2026 estimate":"2026 ግምት","List price as new":"የዝርዝር ዋጋ እንደ አዲስ","Taxable list-price base":"ታክስ የሚከፈልበት ዝርዝር-ዋጋ መሠረት","Reduced list-price base":"የተቀነሰ የዝርዝር-ዋጋ መሠረት","Average taxable benefit per month":"በወር አማካይ ታክስ የሚከፈል ጥቅማ ጥቅም","Taxable benefit for entered months":"ታክስ የሚከፈልበት ጥቅማ ጥቅም","Taxable benefit for a full year":"ታክስ የሚከፈልበት ለአንድ ዓመት ሙሉ ጥቅም","Marginal tax rate entered":"ህዳግ የግብር ተመን ገብቷል።","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"በዚህ ጥቅማጥቅም ላይ የሚገመተው የግል ታክስ","Own-car annual cost entered":"የራስ-መኪና አመታዊ ወጪ ገብቷል።","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"የራስ መኪና ወጪ የሚገመተው የኩባንያ-መኪና የግል ታክስ","Months included":"ወሮች ተካትተዋል።","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"ከ3 አመት በላይ የሆነው በ 1 ጥር ቅነሳ ተተግብሯል","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"የሰነድ የስራ-ማይሌጅ ቅነሳ ተተግብሯል።","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"የማይሌጅ ቅነሳ የምዝግብ ማስታወሻ ደብተር እና ከ 40,000 የስራ ኪ.ሜ በላይ ይፈልጋል።","Tax year":"የግብር ዓመት","Official rate checked":"ኦፊሴላዊ ዋጋ ተረጋግጧል","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 ኩባንያ-የመኪና ተመኖች","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · የኩባንያ መኪና የግል አጠቃቀም","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"አውድ ብቻ፡የራስ መኪና አመታዊ ዋጋ እና በኩባንያ-መኪና ጥቅማ ጥቅሞች ላይ የሚገመተው የግል ታክስ የተለያዩ መለኪያዎች ናቸው። ይህ አጠቃላይ ወጪ ንጽጽር አይደለም።","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"ጥቅሙ የሚታክስ ገቢ እንጂ የታክስ ክፍያ አይደለም። ሙሉ የገቢ ግብር፣ የአሰሪ-ወጪ፣ የገንዘብ ማካካሻ ወይም የፋይናንስ ስሌት አልተካተተም።","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ በአካባቢው ይሰራል። የግቤት ቁጥሮች ወደ አገልጋይ አይላኩም።"},"ar":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"حاسبة ضريبة السيارات الخاصة بالشركة في النرويج","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"حاسبة ضريبة السيارات الخاصة بالشركة في النرويج 2026 — تقدير المنفعة الخاضعة للضريبة","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"قدّر فائدة 2026 الخاضعة للضريبة في النرويج للاستخدام الخاص لسيارة ركاب قياسية تابعة للشركة. أدخل قائمة الأسعار والتخفيضات المؤهلة والأشهر وتقدير الضريبة الهامشية.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"قم بتقدير فائدة الراتب النرويجي الخاضع للضريبة من الاستخدام الخاص لسيارة ركاب قياسية تابعة للشركة، ثم قم بتقدير الضريبة الشخصية بمعدل هامشي تدخله.","What does this estimate?":"ماذا يقدر هذا؟","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"بالنسبة للقواعد القياسية 2026 في النرويج، تعتمد الميزة على قائمة أسعار السيارة باعتبارها جديدة، وليس سعر الشراء. تطبق الآلة الحاسبة الحد الأدنى والمعدلات المنشورة، وأي عمر مؤهل أو تخفيض موثق لعدد الأميال المقطوعة في العمل، وعدد الأشهر المتاحة.","How the estimate works":"كيفية عمل التقدير","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"الفائدة القياسية لـ 2026 هي 30% من قائمة الأسعار المخفضة حتى NOK 370,300، بالإضافة إلى 20% من أي فائض. عادةً ما تكون قاعدة أسعار القائمة هي 100%؛ تبلغ نسبة 75% إذا كان عمر السيارة أكثر من ثلاث سنوات في 1 يناير أو تجاوزت قيادة العمل الموثقة 40,000 كم، و56.25% عند تطبيق كلا الشرطين. أدخل أشهر كاملة لجزء من السنة. الضريبة الشخصية المقدرة هي المنفعة الخاضعة للضريبة مضروبة في المعدل الهامشي الخاص بك؛ هذا ليس حساب الضريبة الكامل.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"هل المنفعة الخاضعة للضريبة تساوي الضريبة التي أدفعها؟","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"لا. تضاف الميزة إلى الراتب الخاضع للضريبة بموجب القواعد الموحدة. يقوم تقدير الضريبة المنفصل بضربه بالمعدل الهامشي الذي تدخله ولا يحسب الضريبة النرويجية الكاملة.","Which car price should I enter?":"ما هو سعر السيارة الذي يجب أن أدخله؟","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"استخدم قائمة الأسعار باعتبارها جديدة، بما في ذلك المعدات ذات الصلة التي تم تركيبها في المصنع والتي قام الوكيل بتركيبها بموجب القواعد الرسمية. لا تستخدم القيمة السوقية الحالية أو السعر الذي دفعته مقابل سيارة مستعملة.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"متى يمكنني استخدام تخفيض الأميال؟","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"فقط عندما يتم توثيق القيادة أثناء العمل من خلال سجل عدد الكيلومترات المؤهلة وتتجاوز 40,000 كم في العام. بالضبط 40,000 كم غير مؤهل. القيادة الشخصية ليست مسافة عمل.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"هل يغطي هذا كل حالة مركبة أو سيارة شركة؟","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"رقم. وهو يغطي القواعد النرويجية القياسية لسيارات الركاب فقط. المركبات الخاصة، والشاحنات الصغيرة فئة 2، والإعفاءات والاستثناءات الفردية تقع خارج هذا التقدير.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"هل المقارنة بين السيارة الخاصة والمثل؟","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"رقم. فهو يضع التكلفة السنوية التي أدخلتها لسيارتك بجانب الضريبة الشخصية المقدرة على منفعة سيارة الشركة. هذه مقاييس مختلفة. فهو لا يشمل تكاليف صاحب العمل، والمبالغ المستردة، والتمويل، والوقود، والتخفيضات الضريبية، والقيمة الكاملة للاستخدام الخاص.","Norway scope and data date":"نطاق النرويج وتاريخ البيانات","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"هذا تقدير تخطيط خاص بالنرويج باستخدام أسعار سيارات الشركة القياسية 2026 في Skatteetaten، والتي تم التحقق منها في 16 لشهر أكتوبر 2026. لا تعتمد القواعد على اللغة المحددة في هذه الصفحة. إنه ليس إقرارًا ضريبيًا رسميًا أو حسابًا ضريبيًا كاملاً أو قرارًا قانونيًا. يتم استبعاد المركبات الخاصة والاستثناءات. الأسعار ثابتة في هذا الإصدار ولا يتم تحديثها في الخلفية؛ قم بفحص سكاتيتاتن للعام الحالي قبل الاعتماد عليها.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"يتم تشغيل العمليات الحسابية في هذا المتصفح. لا يتم تحميل الأرقام التي تدخلها.","Estimate company-car benefit":"تقدير فائدة السيارة للشركة","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"مجاني · يعمل في متصفحك","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"القواعد القياسية النرويجية 2026 لسيارات الركاب. لا تستنتج هذه الصفحة بلدك الضريبي من لغتك.","Car list price when new, NOK":"قائمة أسعار السيارات عندما تكون جديدة، كرونة نرويجية","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"كانت السيارة متاحة طوال الأشهر، 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"كان عمر السيارة أكثر من 3 سنة في 1 يناير","Documented work driving during the year, km":"قيادة العمل الموثقة خلال العام، كم","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"لدي سجل عدد الكيلومترات المؤهلة لقيادة العمل","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"معدل الضريبة الهامشية المقدر، %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"التكلفة السنوية لسيارتك، كرونة نرويجية (اختياري)","Calculate estimate":"حساب التقدير","Reset inputs":"إعادة ضبط المدخلات","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"أدخل قائمة الأسعار الأصلية والأشهر المتاحة.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"التحقق من قائمة الأسعار والأشهر والكيلومترات والنسبة المئوية؛ أدخل قيمًا صالحة غير سالبة.","2026 estimate":"تقدير 2026","List price as new":"قائمة الأسعار جديدة","Taxable list-price base":"قاعدة الأسعار الخاضعة للضريبة","Reduced list-price base":"قاعدة أسعار القائمة المخفضة","Average taxable benefit per month":"متوسط المزايا الخاضعة للضريبة شهريًا","Taxable benefit for entered months":"المزايا الخاضعة للضريبة للأشهر المدخلة","Taxable benefit for a full year":"مزايا خاضعة للضريبة لمدة عام كامل","Marginal tax rate entered":"تم إدخال معدل الضريبة الهامشي","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"الضريبة الشخصية المقدرة على هذه الميزة","Own-car annual cost entered":"تم إدخال التكلفة السنوية للسيارة الخاصة","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"تكلفة السيارة الخاصة مطروحًا منها الضريبة الشخصية المقدرة على سيارة الشركة","Months included":"الأشهر متضمنة","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"عمر يزيد عن 3 سنة على 1 تم تطبيق تخفيض شهر يناير","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"تم تطبيق تقليل المسافة المقطوعة أثناء العمل","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"يتطلب تقليل عدد الأميال وجود سجل وأكثر من 40,000 كيلومتر عمل.","Tax year":"السنة الضريبية","Official rate checked":"تم التحقق من السعر الرسمي","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · أسعار سيارات الشركة 2026","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · الاستخدام الخاص لسيارة الشركة","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"السياق فقط: التكلفة السنوية للسيارة الخاصة والضريبة الشخصية المقدرة على مزايا سيارة الشركة هما مقياسان مختلفان؛ هذه ليست مقارنة التكلفة الإجمالية.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"الفائدة هي الدخل الخاضع للضريبة، وليس فاتورة الضريبة. لا يتم تضمين ضريبة الدخل الكاملة، أو تكلفة صاحب العمل، أو السداد أو حساب التمويل.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"يتم تشغيله محليًا في هذا المتصفح؛ لا يتم إرسال أرقام الإدخال إلى الخادم."},"bg":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Калкулатор за данък върху автомобили на Норвегия","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Данъчен калкулатор за автомобили на норвежки фирми 2026 — Оценка на облагаемата печалба","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Оценете облагаемата полза на Норвегия 2026 за частна употреба на стандартен служебен лек автомобил. Въведете каталожна цена, квалифицирани намаления, месеци и вашата пределна данъчна оценка.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Оценете норвежката облагаема заплата от лична употреба на стандартен служебен лек автомобил, след което изчислете личния данък с въведената от вас пределна ставка.","What does this estimate?":"Каква е тази оценка?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"За стандартните правила 2026 на Норвегия ползата се основава на каталожната цена на автомобила като нов, а не на покупната цена. Калкулаторът прилага публикувания праг и ставки, всяка допустима възраст или документирано намаление на работния пробег и броя на наличните месеци.","How the estimate works":"Как работи оценката","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Стандартното предимство 2026 е 30% от намалената каталожна цена до NOK 370,300, плюс 20% от всяка надценка. Базата на каталожната цена обикновено е 100%; той е 75%, ако автомобилът е бил на повече от три години на 1 януари или документирано шофиране на работа е надвишило 40,000 км, и 56.25%, когато са приложими и двете условия. Въведете цели месеци за непълна година. Очакваният личен данък е облагаемата полза, умножена по вашата собствена пределна ставка; това не е пълно изчисление на данъка.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Облагаемата полза равна ли е на данъка, който плащам?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Бр. Обезщетението се добавя към облагаемата заплата съгласно стандартните правила. Отделната данъчна оценка го умножава по пределната ставка, която въвеждате, и не изчислява пълния ви норвежки данък.","Which car price should I enter?":"Коя цена на автомобил трябва да въведа?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Използвайте каталожната цена като нова, включително съответното фабрично монтирано и монтирано от дилър оборудване съгласно официалните правила. Не използвайте текущата пазарна стойност или цената, която сте платили за употребяван автомобил.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Кога мога да използвам намалението на пробега?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Само когато служебното шофиране е документирано от дневник за квалифициран пробег и надвишава 40,000 км през годината. Точно 40,000 км не се класира. Личното шофиране не е работен пробег.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Това обхваща ли всяко превозно средство или служебен автомобил?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Бр. Той обхваща само стандартните норвежки правила за леки автомобили. Специални превозни средства, ванове клас 2, изключения и отделни изключения са извън тази оценка.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Сравнението със собствен автомобил подобно за подобно ли е?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Бр. Той поставя въведените от вас годишни разходи за собствен автомобил до изчисления личен данък върху обезщетение за служебен автомобил. Това са различни мерки; изключва разходите на работодателя, възстановяванията, финансирането, горивото, данъчните облекчения и пълната стойност на личната употреба.","Norway scope and data date":"Обхват на Норвегия и дата на данните","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Това е специфична за Норвегия прогноза за планиране, използваща стандартните тарифи 2026 на Skatteetaten за служебни автомобили, проверени 16 октомври 2026. Правилата не зависят от езика, избран на тази страница. Това не е официална данъчна декларация, пълно изчисление на данъка или правно решение. Специални превозни средства и изключения са изключени. Цените са статични в тази компилация и не се опресняват на заден план; проверете Skatteetaten за текущата година, преди да разчитате на тях.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Изчисленията се изпълняват в този браузър. Цифрите, които въвеждате не се качват.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Оценете ползата от служебен автомобил","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕЗПЛАТНО · ПУСКА ВЪВ ВАШИЯ БРАУЗЪР","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Норвежки стандартни правила 2026 за леки автомобили. Тази страница не прави заключение за вашата данъчна държава от вашия език.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Каталожна цена на автомобил, когато е нов, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Цели месеци колата беше налична, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"Колата е била на повече от 3 години на 1 януари","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Документирана работа шофиране през годината, км","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Имам дневник за квалифициран пробег за служебно шофиране","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Вашата прогнозна пределна данъчна ставка, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Годишна цена за вашия собствен автомобил, NOK (по избор)","Calculate estimate":"Изчисляване на оценка","Reset inputs":"Нулиране на входове","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Въведете оригиналната каталожна цена и наличните месеци.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Проверете каталожната цена, месеци, километри и процент; въведете валидни неотрицателни стойности.","2026 estimate":"2026 прогноза","List price as new":"Каталожна цена като нова","Taxable list-price base":"Облагаема каталожна база","Reduced list-price base":"Намалена каталожна база","Average taxable benefit per month":"Средна облагаема печалба на месец","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Облагаемо обезщетение за въведени месеци","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Облагаемо обезщетение за цяла година","Marginal tax rate entered":"Въведена е пределна данъчна ставка","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Приблизителен личен данък върху това обезщетение","Own-car annual cost entered":"Въведени са годишни разходи за собствен автомобил","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Разходи за собствена кола минус прогнозен личен данък за служебна кола","Months included":"Включени месеци","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"На възраст над 3 години на 1 Приложено намаление за януари","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Приложено документирано намаление на работния пробег","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Намаляването на пробега изисква бордов дневник и повече от 40,000 работни километри.","Tax year":"Данъчна година","Official rate checked":"Проверен официален курс","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 такси за служебни автомобили","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · лично ползване на служебен автомобил","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Само в контекста: годишните разходи за собствен автомобил и приблизителният личен данък върху ползите от служебен автомобил са различни мерки; това не е сравнение на общите разходи.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Ползата е облагаем доход, а не данъчна сметка. Не е включен пълен данък върху доходите, разходи на работодателя, възстановяване или изчисление на финансиране.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Изпълнява се локално в този браузър; входните цифри не се изпращат до сървър."},"bn":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"নরওয়ে কোম্পানি কার ট্যাক্স ক্যালকুলেটর 2026 — করযোগ্য সুবিধা অনুমান","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"একটি স্ট্যান্ডার্ড কোম্পানির যাত্রীবাহী গাড়ির ব্যক্তিগত ব্যবহারের জন্য নরওয়ের 2026 করযোগ্য সুবিধা অনুমান করুন। তালিকা মূল্য, যোগ্যতা হ্রাস, মাস এবং আপনার প্রান্তিক করের অনুমান লিখুন।","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.","What does this estimate?":"What does this estimate?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"নরওয়ের 2026 স্ট্যান্ডার্ড নিয়মের জন্য, সুবিধাটি গাড়ির নতুন হিসাবে তালিকার মূল্যের উপর ভিত্তি করে, এর ক্রয় মূল্য নয়। The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.","How the estimate works":"কিভাবে অনুমান কাজ করে","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026 স্ট্যান্ডার্ড সুবিধা হল NOK 370,300 পর্যন্ত হ্রাসকৃত তালিকা মূল্যের 30%, সাথে যেকোন অতিরিক্ত 20%। তালিকা-মূল্যের ভিত্তি সাধারণত 100% হয়; 1 জানুয়ারিতে গাড়ির বয়স তিন বছরের বেশি হলে এটি 75% বা নথিভুক্ত কাজের ড্রাইভিং 40,000 কিমি অতিক্রম করলে এবং উভয় শর্ত প্রযোজ্য হলে 56.25%। Enter whole months for a part-year. আনুমানিক ব্যক্তিগত কর হল করযোগ্য সুবিধা যা আপনার নিজস্ব প্রান্তিক হার দ্বারা গুণিত হয়; this is not a full tax calculation.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"করযোগ্য সুবিধা কি আমার প্রদত্ত করের সমান?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"না। The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. পৃথক করের অনুমান এটিকে আপনার প্রবেশ করা প্রান্তিক হার দ্বারা গুণ করে এবং আপনার সম্পূর্ণ নরওয়েজিয়ান ট্যাক্স গণনা করে না।","Which car price should I enter?":"আমি কোন গাড়ির দাম লিখব?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"আধিকারিক নিয়মের অধীনে প্রাসঙ্গিক ফ্যাক্টরি-ফিট করা এবং ডিলার-ইনস্টল করা সরঞ্জাম সহ তালিকার মূল্যকে নতুন হিসাবে ব্যবহার করুন। বর্তমান বাজার মূল্য বা ব্যবহৃত গাড়ির জন্য আপনি যে মূল্য প্রদান করেছেন তা ব্যবহার করবেন না।","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"আমি কখন মাইলেজ হ্রাস ব্যবহার করতে পারি?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"শুধুমাত্র যখন কাজের ড্রাইভিং একটি যোগ্য মাইলেজ লগ দ্বারা নথিভুক্ত করা হয় এবং বছরে 40,000 কিমি অতিক্রম করে। ঠিক 40,000 কিমি যোগ্য নয়। ব্যক্তিগত ড্রাইভিং কাজের মাইলেজ নয়।","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"না। এটি শুধুমাত্র স্ট্যান্ডার্ড নরওয়েজিয়ান যাত্রী-গাড়ির নিয়মগুলিকে কভার করে৷ Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"নিজের গাড়ির তুলনা কি লাইক-ফর-লাইক?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"না। এটি একটি কোম্পানি-গাড়ির সুবিধার উপর আনুমানিক ব্যক্তিগত ট্যাক্সের পাশে আপনার প্রবেশ করা বার্ষিক নিজস্ব-কার খরচ রাখে। সেগুলি বিভিন্ন ব্যবস্থা; এটি নিয়োগকর্তার খরচ, প্রতিদান, অর্থায়ন, জ্বালানী, কর কর্তন এবং ব্যক্তিগত ব্যবহারের সম্পূর্ণ মূল্য বাদ দেয়।","Norway scope and data date":"নরওয়ে সুযোগ এবং তথ্য তারিখ","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"এটি Skatteetaten-এর 2026 স্ট্যান্ডার্ড কোম্পানি-কার রেট ব্যবহার করে একটি নরওয়ে-নির্দিষ্ট পরিকল্পনা অনুমান, 16 অক্টোবর 2026 তারিখে চেক করা হয়েছে। নিয়মগুলি এই পৃষ্ঠায় নির্বাচিত ভাষার উপর নির্ভর করে না। এটি একটি অফিসিয়াল ট্যাক্স রিটার্ন, সম্পূর্ণ ট্যাক্স গণনা বা আইনি সিদ্ধান্ত নয়। বিশেষ যানবাহন এবং ব্যতিক্রম বাদ দেওয়া হয়. এই বিল্ডে রেটগুলি স্থির এবং পটভূমিতে রিফ্রেশ হয় না; তাদের উপর নির্ভর করার আগে বর্তমান বছরের জন্য Skatteetaten পরীক্ষা করুন।","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"এই ব্রাউজারে গণনা চালানো হয়। আপনার প্রবেশ করা পরিসংখ্যান আপলোড করা হয় না.","Estimate company-car benefit":"কোম্পানি-গাড়ির সুবিধা অনুমান করুন","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"বিনামূল্যে · আপনার ব্রাউজারে চলে","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"যাত্রী গাড়ির জন্য নরওয়েজিয়ান 2026 স্ট্যান্ডার্ড নিয়ম। এই পৃষ্ঠাটি আপনার ভাষা থেকে আপনার ট্যাক্স দেশ অনুমান করে না।","Car list price when new, NOK":"গাড়ির তালিকার দাম যখন নতুন, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"পুরো মাস গাড়িটি উপলব্ধ ছিল, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"গাড়িটি 1 জানুয়ারিতে 3 বছরেরও বেশি পুরানো ছিল","Documented work driving during the year, km":"বছরে নথিভুক্ত কাজ ড্রাইভিং, কিমি","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"কাজের ড্রাইভিংয়ের জন্য আমার কাছে একটি যোগ্য মাইলেজ লগ আছে","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"আপনার আনুমানিক প্রান্তিক করের হার, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"আপনার নিজের গাড়ির বার্ষিক খরচ, NOK (ঐচ্ছিক)","Calculate estimate":"আনুমানিক হিসাব করুন","Reset inputs":"ইনপুট রিসেট করুন","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"মূল তালিকার মূল্য এবং উপলব্ধ মাসগুলি লিখুন৷","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"তালিকা মূল্য, মাস, কিলোমিটার এবং শতাংশ পরীক্ষা করুন; বৈধ অ-নেতিবাচক মান লিখুন।","2026 estimate":"2026 অনুমান","List price as new":"নতুন হিসাবে মূল্য তালিকাভুক্ত করুন","Taxable list-price base":"করযোগ্য তালিকা-মূল্যের ভিত্তি","Reduced list-price base":"তালিকা-মূল্য বেস হ্রাস করা হয়েছে","Average taxable benefit per month":"প্রতি মাসে গড় করযোগ্য সুবিধা","Taxable benefit for entered months":"প্রবেশকৃত মাসগুলির জন্য করযোগ্য সুবিধা","Taxable benefit for a full year":"পুরো বছরের জন্য করযোগ্য সুবিধা","Marginal tax rate entered":"প্রান্তিক করের হার প্রবেশ করা হয়েছে৷","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"এই সুবিধার উপর আনুমানিক ব্যক্তিগত ট্যাক্স","Own-car annual cost entered":"নিজের গাড়ির বার্ষিক খরচ প্রবেশ করানো হয়েছে৷","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"নিজের-গাড়ির খরচ মাইনাস আনুমানিক কোম্পানি-কার ব্যক্তিগত ট্যাক্স","Months included":"মাস অন্তর্ভুক্ত","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"1 জানুয়ারিতে 3 বছরের বেশি বয়সী হ্রাস প্রয়োগ করা হয়েছে","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"ডকুমেন্টেড ওয়ার্ক-মাইলেজ হ্রাস প্রয়োগ করা হয়েছে","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"মাইলেজ কমানোর জন্য একটি লগবুক এবং 40,000 ওয়ার্ক কিমি এর বেশি প্রয়োজন।","Tax year":"কর বছর","Official rate checked":"অফিসিয়াল রেট চেক করা হয়েছে৷","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 কোম্পানি-গাড়ির হার","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · একটি কোম্পানির গাড়ির ব্যক্তিগত ব্যবহার","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"শুধুমাত্র প্রসঙ্গ: নিজের-গাড়ির বার্ষিক খরচ এবং কোম্পানি-গাড়ির সুবিধার উপর আনুমানিক ব্যক্তিগত ট্যাক্স ভিন্ন ব্যবস্থা; এটি মোট খরচের তুলনা নয়।","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"সুবিধা হল করযোগ্য আয়, ট্যাক্স বিল নয়। কোনো সম্পূর্ণ আয়কর, নিয়োগকর্তা-খরচ, প্রতিদান বা অর্থায়নের হিসাব অন্তর্ভুক্ত নেই।","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"এই ব্রাউজারে স্থানীয়ভাবে চলে; ইনপুট পরিসংখ্যান একটি সার্ভারে পাঠানো হয় না."},"ca":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Calculadora d'impostos sobre cotxes d'empreses de Noruega","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Calculeu el benefici salarial imposable noruec de l'ús privat d'un cotxe de passatgers d'empresa estàndard i, a continuació, calculeu l'impost personal amb un tipus marginal que introduïu.","What does this estimate?":"Què estima això?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. La calculadora aplica el llindar i les tarifes publicats, qualsevol edat elegible o reducció documentada de quilometratge laboral i el nombre de mesos disponibles.","How the estimate works":"Com funciona el pressupost","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. La base de preus de llista normalment és 100%; és 75% si el cotxe tenia més de tres anys d'antiguitat el 1 de gener o el treball documentat en conducció va superar 40,000 km, i 56.25% quan s'apliquen ambdues condicions. Introduïu mesos sencers durant un any parcial. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; aquest no és un càlcul complet d'impostos.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Núm. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.","Which car price should I enter?":"Which car price should I enter?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"When can I use the mileage reduction?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Núm. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"La comparació del cotxe propi és semblant?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Núm. Col·loca el cost anual del cotxe propi introduït al costat de l'impost personal estimat sobre un benefici del cotxe d'empresa. Those are different measures; exclou els costos de l'empresari, els reemborsaments, el finançament, el combustible, les deduccions fiscals i el valor total de l'ús privat.","Norway scope and data date":"Norway scope and data date","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. Les regles no depenen de l'idioma seleccionat en aquesta pàgina. No és una declaració oficial, un càlcul complet d'impostos o una decisió legal. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Les tarifes són estàtiques en aquesta compilació i no s'actualitzen en segon pla; comproveu Skatteetaten per a l'any en curs abans de confiar-hi.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Estimate company-car benefit","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Normes estàndard 2026 noruegues per als cotxes de passatgers. Aquesta pàgina no dedueix el vostre país fiscal del vostre idioma.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Preu de llista del cotxe quan sigui nou, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Meses sencers el cotxe estava disponible, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"El cotxe tenia més de 3 anys d'antiguitat l'1 de gener","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Treball documentat conducció durant l'any, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Tinc un registre de quilometratge qualificatiu per a la conducció laboral","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"El teu tipus impositiu marginal estimat, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Cost anual del vostre propi cotxe, NOK (opcional)","Calculate estimate":"Calcular estimació","Reset inputs":"Restablir entrades","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Enter the original list price and the months available.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; introduïu valors no negatius vàlids.","2026 estimate":"2026 estimació","List price as new":"Preu de llista com a nou","Taxable list-price base":"Base de preus de llista imposable","Reduced list-price base":"Preu base reduït","Average taxable benefit per month":"Benefici imposable mitjà al mes","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Benefici imposable per mesos introduïts","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Benefici imposable durant un any sencer","Marginal tax rate entered":"S'ha introduït el tipus impositiu marginal","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Estimated personal tax on this benefit","Own-car annual cost entered":"S'ha introduït el cost anual del cotxe propi","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax","Months included":"Mes inclosos","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"S'ha aplicat la reducció de quilometratge de treball documentada","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"La reducció del quilometratge requereix un quadern de registre i més de 40,000 km de treball.","Tax year":"Any fiscal","Official rate checked":"Tarifa oficial comprovat","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · Tarifes de cotxes d'empresa 2026","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · ús privat d'un cotxe d'empresa","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Només context: el cost anual del cotxe propi i l'impost personal estimat sobre el benefici del cotxe d'empresa són mesures diferents; aquesta no és una comparació de costos totals.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"El benefici és la renda imposable, no la factura fiscal. No s'inclou cap càlcul complet de l'impost sobre la renda, el cost de l'empresari, el reemborsament o el finançament.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"S'executa localment en aquest navegador; les xifres d'entrada no s'envien a un servidor."},"de":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Norwegischer Firmenwagensteuerrechner","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Norwegischer Kfz-Steuerrechner 2026 – Schätzung des steuerpflichtigen Vorteils","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Schätzen Sie Norwegens steuerpflichtigen Vorteil in Höhe von 2026 für die private Nutzung eines Standard-Firmenwagens. Geben Sie den Listenpreis, die qualifizierenden Ermäßigungen, die Monate und Ihre Grenzsteuerschätzung ein.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Schätzen Sie den norwegischen steuerpflichtigen Gehaltsvorteil aus der privaten Nutzung eines Standard-Firmenwagens und schätzen Sie dann die persönliche Steuer mit einem von Ihnen eingegebenen Grenzsatz.","What does this estimate?":"Was bedeutet diese Schätzung?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Für die norwegischen 2026-Standardregeln basiert der Vorteil auf dem Listenpreis des Neuwagens und nicht auf dem Kaufpreis. Der Rechner wendet den veröffentlichten Schwellenwert und die veröffentlichten Tarife, das anspruchsberechtigte Alter oder die dokumentierte Reduzierung der Arbeitskilometer sowie die Anzahl der verfügbaren Monate an.","How the estimate works":"So funktioniert die Schätzung","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Der 2026-Standardvorteil beträgt 30 % des reduzierten Listenpreises bis zu NOK 370,300, zuzüglich 20 % der Selbstbeteiligung. Die Listenpreisbasis beträgt normalerweise 100%; Sie beträgt 75 %, wenn das Auto am 1 Januar älter als drei Jahre war oder die dokumentierte Arbeitsfahrt mehr als 40,000 km betrug, und 56.25 %, wenn beide Bedingungen zutreffen. Geben Sie für ein Teiljahr ganze Monate ein. Die geschätzte persönliche Steuer ist der steuerpflichtige Vorteil multipliziert mit Ihrem eigenen Grenzsteuersatz. Dies ist keine vollständige Steuerberechnung.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Entspricht der steuerpflichtige Vorteil der von mir gezahlten Steuer?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Nr. Die Leistung wird gemäß den Standardregeln zum steuerpflichtigen Gehalt hinzugerechnet. Der separate Steuervoranschlag multipliziert ihn mit dem von Ihnen eingegebenen Grenzsteuersatz und berechnet nicht Ihre volle norwegische Steuer.","Which car price should I enter?":"Welchen Autopreis soll ich eingeben?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Verwenden Sie den Listenpreis als Neupreis, einschließlich entsprechender werkseitig eingebauter und vom Händler installierter Ausrüstung gemäß den offiziellen Vorschriften. Verwenden Sie nicht den aktuellen Marktwert oder den Preis, den Sie für einen Gebrauchtwagen gezahlt haben.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Wann kann ich die Kilometerreduzierung nutzen?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Nur wenn die Arbeitsfahrten durch ein qualifiziertes Kilometerprotokoll dokumentiert sind und 40,000 km im Jahr überschreiten. Genau 40,000 km ist nicht qualifiziert. Persönliches Fahren ist keine Arbeitsleistung.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Gilt dies für jeden Fahrzeug- oder Firmenwagenfall?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Nr. Es deckt nur die norwegischen Standardvorschriften für Personenkraftwagen ab. Sonderfahrzeuge, Transporter der Klasse 2, Ausnahmen und einzelne Ausnahmen fallen nicht in diese Schätzung.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Ist der Vergleich mit dem eigenen Auto vergleichbar?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Nr. Dabei werden Ihre eingegebenen jährlichen Kosten für den eigenen Pkw neben die geschätzte persönliche Steuer auf eine Firmenwagenvergütung gesetzt. Das sind unterschiedliche Maßnahmen; Arbeitgeberkosten, Erstattungen, Finanzierung, Treibstoff, Steuerabzüge und der volle Wert der privaten Nutzung sind davon ausgenommen.","Norway scope and data date":"Norwegen Umfang und Datendatum","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Dies ist eine norwegenspezifische Planungsschätzung unter Verwendung der Standard-Firmenwagentarife 2026 von Skatteetaten, geprüft 16 Oktober 2026. Die Regeln hängen nicht von der auf dieser Seite ausgewählten Sprache ab. Es handelt sich nicht um eine offizielle Steuererklärung, vollständige Steuerberechnung oder Rechtsentscheidung. Ausgenommen sind Sonderfahrzeuge und Ausnahmen. Die Preise sind in diesem Build statisch und werden nicht im Hintergrund aktualisiert; Überprüfen Sie die Skatteetaten für das laufende Jahr, bevor Sie sich darauf verlassen.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Berechnungen werden in diesem Browser ausgeführt. Die von Ihnen eingegebenen Zahlen werden nicht hochgeladen.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Schätzung des Firmenwagenvorteils","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"KOSTENLOS · LÄUFT IN IHREM BROWSER","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Norwegische 2026-Standardregeln für Personenkraftwagen. Diese Seite leitet Ihr Steuerland nicht aus Ihrer Sprache ab.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Autolistenpreis im Neuzustand, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Ganze Monate, in denen das Auto verfügbar war, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"Das Auto war am 1 Januar mehr als 3 Jahre alt","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Dokumentierte Arbeitsfahrten im Laufe des Jahres, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Ich habe ein qualifiziertes Kilometerprotokoll für die Arbeitsfahrt","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Ihr geschätzter Grenzsteuersatz, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Ihre jährlichen Kosten für Ihr eigenes Auto, NOK (optional)","Calculate estimate":"Schätzung berechnen","Reset inputs":"Eingänge zurücksetzen","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Geben Sie den ursprünglichen Listenpreis und die verfügbaren Monate ein.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Überprüfen Sie den Listenpreis, die Monate, die Kilometer und den Prozentsatz. Geben Sie gültige nicht negative Werte ein.","2026 estimate":"2026-Schätzung","List price as new":"Listenpreis wie neu","Taxable list-price base":"Steuerpflichtige Listenpreisbasis","Reduced list-price base":"Reduzierter Listenpreis","Average taxable benefit per month":"Durchschnittlicher steuerpflichtiger Vorteil pro Monat","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Steuerpflichtiger Vorteil für eingegebene Monate","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Steuerpflichtiger Vorteil für ein ganzes Jahr","Marginal tax rate entered":"Grenzsteuersatz eingegeben","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Geschätzte persönliche Steuer auf diese Leistung","Own-car annual cost entered":"Jährliche Kosten für das eigene Auto eingegeben","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Kosten für den eigenen Wagen abzüglich der geschätzten persönlichen Steuer für den Firmenwagen","Months included":"Monate eingeschlossen","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Über 3 Jahre alt, 1 Januar-Reduktion angewendet","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Dokumentierte Reduzierung der Arbeitskilometer angewendet","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Kilometerreduzierung erfordert ein Fahrtenbuch und mehr als 40,000 Arbeitskilometer.","Tax year":"Steuerjahr","Official rate checked":"Offizieller Tarif überprüft","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 Firmenwagentarife","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · private Nutzung eines Firmenwagens","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Nur Kontext: Die jährlichen Kosten für den eigenen Pkw und die geschätzte persönliche Steuer auf eine Firmenwagenvergütung sind unterschiedliche Messgrößen. Hierbei handelt es sich nicht um einen Gesamtkostenvergleich.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Der Vorteil ist steuerpflichtiges Einkommen, nicht die Steuerrechnung. Es sind keine vollständigen Einkommensteuer-, Arbeitgeberkosten-, Erstattungs- oder Finanzierungsberechnungen enthalten.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Läuft lokal in diesem Browser; Eingabezahlen werden nicht an einen Server gesendet."},"el":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Υπολογιστής φόρου αυτοκινήτου εταιρείας Νορβηγίας","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Υπολογιστής φόρου αυτοκινήτου εταιρείας Νορβηγίας 2026 — Εκτίμηση φορολογητέων οφελών","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Υπολογίστε το φορολογητέο όφελος 2026 της Νορβηγίας για ιδιωτική χρήση ενός τυπικού εταιρικού επιβατικού αυτοκινήτου. Εισαγάγετε την τιμή καταλόγου, τις επιλέξιμες μειώσεις, τους μήνες και την οριακή φορολογική εκτίμηση.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Υπολογίστε το φορολογητέο μισθολογικό όφελος της Νορβηγίας από την ιδιωτική χρήση ενός τυπικού εταιρικού επιβατικού αυτοκινήτου και, στη συνέχεια, υπολογίστε τον προσωπικό φόρο με έναν οριακό συντελεστή που εισάγετε.","What does this estimate?":"Τι εκτιμά αυτό;","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Για τους τυπικούς κανόνες 2026 της Νορβηγίας, το όφελος βασίζεται στην τιμή καταλόγου του αυτοκινήτου ως καινούργιο, όχι στην τιμή αγοράς του. Η αριθμομηχανή εφαρμόζει το δημοσιευμένο όριο και τις τιμές, τυχόν επιλέξιμη ηλικία ή τεκμηριωμένη μείωση των χιλιομέτρων εργασίας και τον αριθμό των διαθέσιμων μηνών.","How the estimate works":"Πώς λειτουργεί η εκτίμηση","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Το τυπικό όφελος 2026 είναι το 30% της μειωμένης τιμής καταλόγου έως το NOK 370,300, συν το 20% τυχόν υπερβάλλοντος. Η βάση της τιμής καταλόγου είναι συνήθως 100%. είναι 75% εάν το αυτοκίνητο ήταν άνω των τριών ετών τον 1 Ιανουάριο ή η τεκμηριωμένη οδήγηση εργασίας υπερέβη το 40,000 km και το 56.25% όταν ισχύουν και οι δύο προϋποθέσεις. Εισαγάγετε ολόκληρους μήνες για ένα μέρος του έτους. Ο εκτιμώμενος φόρος φυσικών προσώπων είναι το φορολογητέο όφελος πολλαπλασιασμένο με τον δικό σας οριακό συντελεστή. αυτός δεν είναι πλήρης υπολογισμός φόρου.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Το φορολογητέο όφελος ισούται με τον φόρο που πληρώνω;","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Αρ. Το επίδομα προστίθεται στον φορολογητέο μισθό σύμφωνα με τους τυπικούς κανόνες. Η χωριστή εκτίμηση φόρου τον πολλαπλασιάζει με τον οριακό συντελεστή που εισάγετε και δεν υπολογίζει τον πλήρη νορβηγικό φόρο σας.","Which car price should I enter?":"Ποια τιμή αυτοκινήτου να καταχωρίσω;","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Χρησιμοποιήστε την τιμή καταλόγου ως καινούργια, συμπεριλαμβανομένου του σχετικού εργοστασιακού εξοπλισμού και του εξοπλισμού που έχει εγκατασταθεί από τον αντιπρόσωπο σύμφωνα με τους επίσημους κανόνες. Μην χρησιμοποιείτε την τρέχουσα αγοραία αξία ή την τιμή που πληρώσατε για ένα μεταχειρισμένο αυτοκίνητο.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Πότε μπορώ να χρησιμοποιήσω τη μείωση χιλιομέτρων;","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Μόνο όταν η οδήγηση στην εργασία τεκμηριώνεται από πιστοποιημένο αρχείο καταγραφής χιλιομέτρων και υπερβαίνει τα 40,000 km το έτος. Ακριβώς 40,000 km δεν πληροί τις προϋποθέσεις. Η προσωπική οδήγηση δεν είναι χιλιόμετρα εργασίας.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Αυτό καλύπτει κάθε περίπτωση οχήματος ή εταιρικού αυτοκινήτου;","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Αρ. Καλύπτει μόνο τους τυπικούς κανόνες για τα επιβατικά αυτοκίνητα της Νορβηγίας. Τα ειδικά οχήματα, τα φορτηγά κατηγορίας 2, οι εξαιρέσεις και οι μεμονωμένες εξαιρέσεις βρίσκονται εκτός αυτής της εκτίμησης.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Μοιάζει η σύγκριση με το δικό του αυτοκίνητο;","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Αρ. Τοποθετεί το εισαγόμενο ετήσιο κόστος αυτοκινήτου δίπλα στον εκτιμώμενο προσωπικό φόρο σε ένα όφελος εταιρικού αυτοκινήτου. Αυτά είναι διαφορετικά μέτρα. Εξαιρούνται τα έξοδα εργοδότη, οι επιστροφές, η χρηματοδότηση, τα καύσιμα, οι φορολογικές εκπτώσεις και η πλήρης αξία της ιδιωτικής χρήσης.","Norway scope and data date":"Πεδίο εφαρμογής και ημερομηνία δεδομένων της Νορβηγίας","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Αυτή είναι μια εκτίμηση σχεδιασμού για τη Νορβηγία που χρησιμοποιεί τις τυπικές τιμές 2026 για εταιρικά αυτοκίνητα της Skatteetaten, ελεγμένες 16 Οκτώβριος 2026. Οι κανόνες δεν εξαρτώνται από τη γλώσσα που έχει επιλεγεί σε αυτήν τη σελίδα. Δεν είναι επίσημη φορολογική δήλωση, πλήρης υπολογισμός φόρου ή νομική απόφαση. Εξαιρούνται τα ειδικά οχήματα και οι εξαιρέσεις. Οι τιμές είναι στατικές σε αυτήν την έκδοση και δεν ανανεώνονται στο παρασκήνιο. ελέγξτε το Skatteetaten για το τρέχον έτος πριν βασιστείτε σε αυτά.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Οι υπολογισμοί εκτελούνται σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης. Τα στοιχεία που εισάγετε δεν μεταφορτώνονται.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Εκτιμήστε το όφελος εταιρικού αυτοκινήτου","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ΔΩΡΕΑΝ · ΕΚΤΕΛΕΙΤΑΙ ΣΤΟ BROWSER ΣΑΣ","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Νορβηγικοί τυπικοί κανόνες 2026 για επιβατικά αυτοκίνητα. Αυτή η σελίδα δεν συνάγει τη φορολογική σας χώρα από τη γλώσσα σας.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Τιμή καταλόγου αυτοκινήτου όταν είναι καινούργιο, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Ολόκληρους μήνες το αυτοκίνητο ήταν διαθέσιμο, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"Το αυτοκίνητο ήταν περισσότερο από 3 ετών τον Ιανουάριο 1","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Τεκμηριωμένη εργασία οδήγησης κατά τη διάρκεια του έτους, χλμ","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Έχω ένα κατάλληλο αρχείο καταγραφής χιλιομέτρων για την οδήγηση εργασίας","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Ο εκτιμώμενος οριακός φορολογικός συντελεστής σας, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Ετήσιο κόστος του δικού σας αυτοκινήτου, NOK (προαιρετικό)","Calculate estimate":"Υπολογισμός εκτίμησης","Reset inputs":"Επαναφορά εισόδων","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Εισαγάγετε την αρχική τιμή καταλόγου και τους διαθέσιμους μήνες.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Ελέγξτε την τιμή καταλόγου, τους μήνες, τα χιλιόμετρα και το ποσοστό. εισαγάγετε έγκυρες μη αρνητικές τιμές.","2026 estimate":"2026 εκτίμηση","List price as new":"Τιμή καταλόγου ως καινούργια","Taxable list-price base":"Φορολογητέα βάση τιμής καταλόγου","Reduced list-price base":"Μειωμένη βάση τιμής καταλόγου","Average taxable benefit per month":"Μέσο φορολογητέο όφελος ανά μήνα","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Φορολογητέο όφελος για εισαγόμενους μήνες","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Φορολογητέα παροχή για ένα πλήρες έτος","Marginal tax rate entered":"Εισήγαγε οριακό φορολογικό συντελεστή","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Εκτιμώμενος προσωπικός φόρος για αυτό το όφελος","Own-car annual cost entered":"Καταχωρήθηκε ετήσιο κόστος ιδιόκτητου αυτοκινήτου","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Κόστος ιδίου αυτοκινήτου μείον τον εκτιμώμενο προσωπικό φόρο εταιρείας-αυτοκίνητου","Months included":"Μήνες περιλαμβάνονται","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Πάνω από 3 ετών σε 1 ισχύει μείωση Ιανουαρίου","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Εφαρμόστηκε τεκμηριωμένη μείωση χιλιομέτρων εργασίας","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Η μείωση των χιλιομέτρων απαιτεί ημερολόγιο και περισσότερα από 40,000 χιλιόμετρα εργασίας.","Tax year":"Φορολογικό έτος","Official rate checked":"Ελέγχθηκε η επίσημη τιμή","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 τιμές εταιρικού αυτοκινήτου","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · ιδιωτική χρήση εταιρικού αυτοκινήτου","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Πλαίσιο μόνο: το ετήσιο κόστος για το δικό του αυτοκίνητο και ο εκτιμώμενος προσωπικός φόρος για ένα όφελος για το εταιρικό αυτοκίνητο είναι διαφορετικά μέτρα. αυτό δεν είναι σύγκριση συνολικού κόστους.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Το όφελος είναι φορολογητέο εισόδημα, όχι ο φορολογικός λογαριασμός. Δεν περιλαμβάνεται πλήρης φόρος εισοδήματος, εργοδότης-κόστος, αποζημίωση ή υπολογισμός χρηματοδότησης.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Εκτελείται τοπικά σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης. Τα στοιχεία εισόδου δεν αποστέλλονται σε διακομιστή."},"es":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Calculadora de impuestos sobre automóviles de la empresa noruega","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Calculadora de impuestos sobre automóviles para empresas de Noruega 2026 — Estimación de beneficios imponibles","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Estime el beneficio imponible 2026 de Noruega para el uso privado de un vehículo de pasajeros estándar de empresa. Ingrese el precio de lista, las reducciones calificadas, los meses y su estimación de impuesto marginal.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Estime el beneficio salarial imponible noruego por el uso privado de un vehículo de pasajeros estándar de la empresa y luego calcule el impuesto personal con una tasa marginal que ingrese.","What does this estimate?":"¿Qué estima esto?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Según las reglas estándar 2026 de Noruega, el beneficio se basa en el precio de lista del automóvil como nuevo, no en su precio de compra. La calculadora aplica el umbral y las tarifas publicados, cualquier edad elegible o reducción de millaje de trabajo documentada y la cantidad de meses disponibles.","How the estimate works":"Cómo funciona el presupuesto","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"El beneficio estándar 2026 es 30% del precio de lista reducido hasta NOK 370,300, más 20% de cualquier exceso. La base del precio de lista es normalmente 100%; es 75% si el automóvil tenía más de tres años en 1 enero o la conducción por trabajo documentado superó 40,000 km, y 56.25% cuando se aplican ambas condiciones. Introduzca meses completos para un año parcial. El impuesto personal estimado es el beneficio imponible multiplicado por su propia tasa marginal; Este no es un cálculo de impuestos completo.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"¿El beneficio imponible es igual al impuesto que pago?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"No. El beneficio se suma al salario imponible según las reglas estándar. La estimación de impuestos separada lo multiplica por la tasa marginal que ingresa y no calcula su impuesto noruego completo.","Which car price should I enter?":"¿Qué precio de coche debo introducir?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Utilice el precio de lista como nuevo, incluido el equipo relevante instalado en fábrica e instalado por el distribuidor según las reglas oficiales. No utilice el valor de mercado actual ni el precio que pagó por un automóvil usado.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"¿Cuándo puedo utilizar la reducción de kilometraje?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Solo cuando la conducción laboral está documentada mediante un registro de kilometraje calificado y excede 40,000 km en el año. Exactamente 40,000 km no califican. La conducción personal no es kilometraje laboral.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"¿Esto cubre todos los casos de vehículos o coches de empresa?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"No. Cubre únicamente las normas estándar noruegas sobre turismos. Quedan fuera de esta estimación los vehículos especiales, furgonetas clase 2, exenciones y excepciones individuales.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"¿La comparación entre vehículos propios es comparable?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"No. Coloca el costo anual ingresado del automóvil propio junto al impuesto personal estimado sobre el beneficio de un automóvil de empresa. Esas son medidas diferentes; excluye los costos del empleador, los reembolsos, la financiación, el combustible, las deducciones fiscales y el valor total del uso privado.","Norway scope and data date":"Alcance y fecha de datos de Noruega","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Esta es una estimación de planificación específica de Noruega utilizando las tarifas estándar para vehículos de empresa 2026 de Skatteetaten, verificadas 16 Octubre 2026. Las reglas no dependen del idioma seleccionado en esta página. No se trata de una declaración de impuestos oficial, ni de un cálculo fiscal completo ni de una decisión legal. Quedan excluidos los vehículos especiales y las excepciones. Las tarifas son estáticas en esta compilación y no se actualizan en segundo plano; Consulte los Skatteetaten para el año en curso antes de confiar en ellos.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Los cálculos se ejecutan en este navegador. Las cifras que ingresas no se cargan.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Estimación del beneficio del coche de empresa","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · SE EJECUTA EN TU NAVEGADOR","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Normas estándar noruegas 2026 para turismos. Esta página no infiere su país fiscal a partir de su idioma.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Precio de lista del coche cuando es nuevo, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Meses completos en los que el coche estuvo disponible, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"El coche tenía más de 3 años el 1 de enero","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Trabajos documentados de conducción durante el año, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Tengo un registro de kilometraje calificado para conducir en el trabajo","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Su tasa impositiva marginal estimada, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Coste anual de tu propio coche, NOK (opcional)","Calculate estimate":"Calcular estimación","Reset inputs":"Restablecer entradas","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Ingrese el precio de lista original y los meses disponibles.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Consulta el precio de lista, meses, kilómetros y porcentaje; introduzca valores válidos no negativos.","2026 estimate":"2026 estimación","List price as new":"Precio de lista como nuevo","Taxable list-price base":"Base de precios de lista imponibles","Reduced list-price base":"Base de precios de lista reducidos","Average taxable benefit per month":"Beneficio imponible promedio por mes","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Beneficio imponible por meses ingresados","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Beneficio imponible por un año completo","Marginal tax rate entered":"Tipo impositivo marginal introducido","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Impuesto personal estimado sobre este beneficio","Own-car annual cost entered":"Costo anual del vehículo propio ingresado","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Coste del coche propio menos impuesto personal estimado del coche de empresa","Months included":"Meses incluidos","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Más de 3 años de antigüedad en 1 Se aplicó la reducción de enero","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Reducción de kilometraje de trabajo documentada aplicada","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"La reducción de kilometraje requiere un libro de registro y más de 40,000 km de trabajo.","Tax year":"Año fiscal","Official rate checked":"Tarifa oficial comprobada","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 Tarifas para vehículos de empresa","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · uso privado de un coche de empresa","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Solo contexto: el costo anual del automóvil propio y el impuesto personal estimado sobre el beneficio de un automóvil de empresa son medidas diferentes; Esta no es una comparación del costo total.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"El beneficio es la renta imponible, no la factura de impuestos. No se incluye ningún cálculo completo del impuesto sobre la renta, el costo para el empleador, el reembolso o la financiación.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Se ejecuta localmente en este navegador; Las cifras de entrada no se envían a un servidor."},"fa":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"ماشین حساب مالیات خودرو شرکت نروژ","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"ماشین حساب مالیات خودرو شرکت نروژ 2026 — برآورد سود مشمول مالیات","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"مزایای مالیاتی 2026 نروژ را برای استفاده خصوصی از یک خودروی سواری شرکت استاندارد برآورد کنید. لیست قیمت، تخفیف های واجد شرایط، ماه ها و برآورد مالیات نهایی خود را وارد کنید.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"مزایای حقوق و دستمزد مشمول مالیات نروژی را از استفاده خصوصی از یک خودروی سواری استاندارد شرکتی تخمین بزنید، سپس مالیات شخصی را با نرخ نهایی که وارد می‌کنید تخمین بزنید.","What does this estimate?":"این چه تخمینی دارد؟","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"برای قوانین استاندارد 2026 نروژ، مزیت بر اساس لیست قیمت خودرو به عنوان نو است، نه قیمت خرید آن. ماشین حساب آستانه و نرخ های منتشر شده، سن واجد شرایط یا کاهش مسافت پیموده شده کار مستند، و تعداد ماه های موجود را اعمال می کند.","How the estimate works":"تخمین چگونه کار می کند","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"مزایای استاندارد 2026 30٪ از قیمت فهرست کاهش یافته تا NOK 370,300، به علاوه 20٪ از هر مازاد است. پایه لیست قیمت معمولاً 100٪ است. اگر خودرو در ژانویه 1 بیش از سه سال سن داشته باشد یا رانندگی مستند از 40,000 کیلومتر فراتر رفته باشد، 75٪ است و در صورت اعمال هر دو شرایط، 56.25٪ است. ماه های کامل را برای یک پاره سال وارد کنید. مالیات شخصی تخمینی سود مشمول مالیات ضرب در نرخ نهایی شماست. این یک محاسبه مالیات کامل نیست.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"آیا سود مشمول مالیات با مالیاتی که من می پردازم برابر است؟","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"شماره. این مزایا طبق قوانین استاندارد به حقوق مشمول مالیات اضافه می شود. برآورد مالیات جداگانه آن را در نرخ نهایی که وارد می‌کنید ضرب می‌کند و مالیات کامل نروژی شما را محاسبه نمی‌کند.","Which car price should I enter?":"قیمت کدام خودرو را وارد کنم؟","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"از فهرست قیمت به‌عنوان جدید استفاده کنید، از جمله تجهیزات مربوطه در کارخانه و نصب‌شده در نمایندگی تحت قوانین رسمی. از ارزش فعلی بازار یا قیمتی که برای خودروی دست دوم پرداخت کرده اید استفاده نکنید.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"چه زمانی می توانم از کاهش مسافت پیموده شده استفاده کنم؟","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"فقط زمانی که رانندگی در محل کار توسط گزارش مسافت پیموده شده واجد شرایط ثبت شده باشد و بیش از 40,000 کیلومتر در سال باشد. دقیقاً 40,000 کیلومتر واجد شرایط نیست. رانندگی شخصی مسافت پیموده شده کار نیست.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"آیا این مورد هر وسیله نقلیه یا ماشین شرکتی را پوشش می دهد؟","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"شماره. این فقط قوانین استاندارد خودروهای سواری نروژی را پوشش می دهد. وسایل نقلیه ویژه، وانت های کلاس 2، معافیت ها و استثنائات فردی خارج از این برآورد هستند.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"آیا مقایسه خودروهای شخصی مشابه است؟","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"شماره. این هزینه سالانه خودروی شخصی وارد شده شما را در کنار مالیات براورد شده شخصی بر مزایای خودروی شرکت قرار می دهد. این اقدامات متفاوت هستند. هزینه های کارفرما، بازپرداخت، تامین مالی، سوخت، کسر مالیات و ارزش کامل استفاده خصوصی را شامل نمی شود.","Norway scope and data date":"محدوده نروژ و تاریخ داده","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"این یک تخمین برنامه‌ریزی خاص نروژ است که با استفاده از نرخ استاندارد خودروهای شرکتی 2026 Skatteetaten، 16 اکتبر 2026 بررسی شده است. قوانین به زبان انتخاب شده در این صفحه بستگی ندارد. این یک اظهارنامه مالیاتی رسمی، محاسبه مالیات کامل یا تصمیم قانونی نیست. وسایل نقلیه ویژه و استثناء مستثنی هستند. نرخ ها در این ساخت ثابت هستند و در پس زمینه رفرش نمی شوند. قبل از تکیه بر آنها، Skatteetaten را برای سال جاری بررسی کنید.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"محاسبات در این مرورگر اجرا می شود. ارقامی که وارد می کنید آپلود نمی شوند.","Estimate company-car benefit":"مزایای خودروهای شرکتی را برآورد کنید","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"رایگان · در مرورگر شما اجرا می شود","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"قوانین استاندارد نروژی 2026 برای خودروهای سواری. این صفحه کشور مالیاتی شما را از زبان شما استنتاج نمی کند.","Car list price when new, NOK":"قیمت لیست خودرو در صورت نو، NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"ماههای کامل ماشین در دسترس بود، 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"این خودرو در ژانویه 1 بیش از 3 سال سن داشت","Documented work driving during the year, km":"کار مستند رانندگی در طول سال، کیلومتر","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"من یک گزارش مسافت پیموده شده واجد شرایط برای رانندگی کار دارم","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"نرخ مالیات نهایی شما، %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"هزینه سالانه خودروی شخصی شما، NOK (اختیاری)","Calculate estimate":"برآورد را محاسبه کنید","Reset inputs":"بازنشانی ورودی ها","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"قیمت اصلی و ماه های موجود را وارد کنید.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"لیست قیمت، ماه، کیلومتر و درصد را بررسی کنید. مقادیر غیر منفی معتبر وارد کنید.\nبرآورد","2026 estimate":"2026","List price as new":"قیمت جدید را درج کنید","Taxable list-price base":"پایه لیست قیمت مشمول مالیات","Reduced list-price base":"پایه لیست قیمت کاهش یافته","Average taxable benefit per month":"میانگین سود مشمول مالیات در ماه","Taxable benefit for entered months":"مزایای مشمول مالیات برای ماههای وارده","Taxable benefit for a full year":"مزایای مشمول مالیات برای یک سال کامل","Marginal tax rate entered":"نرخ مالیات نهایی وارد شده است","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"برآورد مالیات شخصی بر این مزایا","Own-car annual cost entered":"هزینه سالانه خودروی شخصی وارد شده است","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"هزینه خودروی شخصی منهای تخمینی مالیات شخصی شرکت خودرو","Months included":"ماه شامل","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"بیش از 3 سال در 1 کاهش ژانویه اعمال شد","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"کاهش مسافت پیموده شده کار مستند اعمال شد","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"کاهش مسافت پیموده شده به یک دفترچه گزارش و بیش از 40,000 کیلومتر کار نیاز دارد.","Tax year":"سال مالیاتی","Official rate checked":"نرخ رسمی بررسی شد","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · نرخ خودروهای شرکتی 2026","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · استفاده خصوصی از ماشین شرکتی","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"فقط زمینه: هزینه سالانه خودروی شخصی و تخمینی مالیات شخصی بر مزایای خودروی شرکت، معیارهای متفاوتی هستند. این یک مقایسه کل هزینه نیست.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"مزایای آن درآمد مشمول مالیات است نه صورت حساب مالیاتی. هیچ محاسبه مالیات بر درآمد کامل، هزینه کارفرما، بازپرداخت یا تامین مالی لحاظ نشده است.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"به صورت محلی در این مرورگر اجرا می شود. ارقام ورودی به سرور ارسال نمی شوند."},"fr":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Calculateur de taxe automobile pour les sociétés norvégiennes","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Calculateur de taxe automobile pour les sociétés norvégiennes 2026 — Estimation des avantages imposables","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Estimez l'avantage imposable 2026 de la Norvège pour l'utilisation privée d'une voiture de tourisme de société standard. Entrez le prix catalogue, les réductions éligibles, les mois et votre estimation de taxe marginale.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Estimez l'avantage salarial imposable norvégien résultant de l'utilisation privée d'une voiture de tourisme de société standard, puis estimez l'impôt des personnes physiques avec un taux marginal que vous saisissez.","What does this estimate?":"Qu'est-ce que cette estimation ?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Pour les règles standard norvégiennes 2026, l'avantage est basé sur le prix catalogue de la voiture à l'état neuf, et non sur son prix d'achat. Le calculateur applique le seuil et les tarifs publiés, tout âge éligible ou réduction documentée du kilométrage professionnel, ainsi que le nombre de mois disponibles.","How the estimate works":"Fonctionnement du devis","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"L'avantage standard 2026 correspond à 30 % du prix catalogue réduit jusqu'à NOK 370,300, plus 20 % de tout excédent. La base du prix catalogue est normalement 100% ; il s'agit de 75% si la voiture avait plus de trois ans le 1 janvier ou si la conduite de travail documentée dépassait 40,000 km, et 56.25% lorsque les deux conditions s'appliquent. Entrez des mois entiers pour une partie de l'année. L'impôt personnel estimé est l'avantage imposable multiplié par votre propre taux marginal ; il ne s’agit pas d’un calcul d’impôt complet.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"L'avantage imposable est-il égal à l'impôt que je paie ?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Non. L'avantage s'ajoute au salaire imposable selon les règles standards. L'estimation fiscale distincte la multiplie par le taux marginal que vous saisissez et ne calcule pas l'intégralité de votre impôt norvégien.","Which car price should I enter?":"Quel prix de voiture dois-je saisir ?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Utilisez le prix catalogue comme neuf, y compris l'équipement approprié monté en usine et installé par le concessionnaire conformément aux règles officielles. N'utilisez pas la valeur marchande actuelle ou le prix que vous avez payé pour une voiture d'occasion.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Quand puis-je bénéficier de la réduction kilométrique ?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Uniquement lorsque la conduite professionnelle est documentée par un carnet de kilométrage admissible et dépasse 40,000 km dans l'année. Exactement, les km 40,000 ne sont pas admissibles. La conduite personnelle n’est pas un kilométrage professionnel.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Cela couvre-t-il tous les cas de véhicules ou de voitures de société ?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Non. Il couvre uniquement les règles norvégiennes standard relatives aux voitures particulières. Les véhicules spéciaux, les fourgons classe 2, les exemptions et exceptions individuelles sont en dehors de cette estimation.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"La comparaison avec votre propre voiture est-elle comparable ?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Non. Il place le coût annuel de votre propre voiture saisi à côté de l'impôt des personnes physiques estimé sur un avantage lié à une voiture de société. Ce sont des mesures différentes ; il exclut les coûts de l'employeur, les remboursements, le financement, le carburant, les déductions fiscales et la valeur totale de l'usage privé.","Norway scope and data date":"Périmètre Norvège et date des données","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Il s'agit d'une estimation de planification spécifique à la Norvège utilisant les tarifs standard des voitures de société 2026 de Skatteetaten, vérifiée 16 en octobre 2026. Les règles ne dépendent pas de la langue sélectionnée sur cette page. Il ne s’agit pas d’une déclaration de revenus officielle, d’un calcul complet de l’impôt ou d’une décision judiciaire. Les véhicules spéciaux et les exceptions sont exclus. Les tarifs sont statiques dans cette version et ne s'actualisent pas en arrière-plan ; vérifiez les Skatteetaten pour l'année en cours avant de vous y fier.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Les calculs sont exécutés dans ce navigateur. Les chiffres que vous saisissez ne sont pas téléchargés.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Estimation du bénéfice voiture de société","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUIT · FONCTIONNE DANS VOTRE NAVIGATEUR","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Règles standard norvégiennes 2026 pour les voitures particulières. Cette page ne déduit pas votre pays fiscal de votre langue.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Prix catalogue de la voiture à l'état neuf, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Mois entiers pendant lesquels la voiture était disponible, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"La voiture avait plus de 3 ans le 1 janvier","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Travaux documentés de conduite au cours de l'année, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"J'ai un carnet de kilométrage admissible pour le travail de conduite","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Votre taux d'imposition marginal estimé, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Coût annuel de votre propre voiture, NOK (facultatif)","Calculate estimate":"Calculer l'estimation","Reset inputs":"Réinitialiser les entrées","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Entrez le prix catalogue d'origine et les mois disponibles.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Vérifiez le prix catalogue, les mois, les kilomètres et le pourcentage ; entrez des valeurs valides non négatives.","2026 estimate":"2026 estimation","List price as new":"Prix catalogue comme neuf","Taxable list-price base":"Base de prix catalogue imposable","Reduced list-price base":"Base de prix catalogue réduite","Average taxable benefit per month":"Avantage imposable moyen par mois","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Avantage imposable pour les mois saisis","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Avantage imposable pour une année complète","Marginal tax rate entered":"Taux marginal de taxe saisi","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Impôt personnel estimé sur cet avantage","Own-car annual cost entered":"Coût annuel de votre propre voiture saisi","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Coût de la voiture personnelle moins taxe personnelle estimée sur la voiture de société","Months included":"Mois inclus","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Plus de 3 années sur 1 Réduction de janvier appliquée","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Réduction documentée du kilométrage de travail appliquée","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"La réduction du kilométrage nécessite un journal de bord et plus de 40,000 kilomètres de travail.","Tax year":"Année d'imposition","Official rate checked":"Tarif officiel vérifié","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · Tarifs des voitures de société 2026","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · utilisation privée d'une voiture de société","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Contexte uniquement : le coût annuel d'une voiture propre et l'impôt des personnes physiques estimé sur un avantage lié à une voiture de société sont des mesures différentes ; il ne s’agit pas d’une comparaison du coût total.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"L'avantage correspond au revenu imposable et non à la facture fiscale. Aucun calcul complet de l’impôt sur le revenu, des coûts pour l’employeur, du remboursement ou du financement n’est inclus.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"S'exécute localement dans ce navigateur ; les chiffres saisis ne sont pas envoyés à un serveur."},"gu":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"નોર્વે કંપની કાર ટેક્સ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"નોર્વે કંપની કાર ટેક્સ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર 2026 — કરપાત્ર લાભ અંદાજ","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"સ્ટાન્ડર્ડ કંપની પેસેન્જર કારના ખાનગી ઉપયોગ માટે નોર્વેના 2026 કરપાત્ર લાભનો અંદાજ કાઢો. સૂચિ કિંમત, લાયકાત ઘટાડા, મહિના અને તમારા સીમાંત કર અંદાજ દાખલ કરો.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"માનક કંપનીની પેસેન્જર કારના ખાનગી ઉપયોગથી નોર્વેજીયન કરપાત્ર પગાર લાભનો અંદાજ કાઢો, પછી તમે દાખલ કરેલ નજીવા દર સાથે વ્યક્તિગત કરનો અંદાજ કાઢો.","What does this estimate?":"આ શું અંદાજ આપે છે?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"નોર્વેના 2026 માનક નિયમો માટે, લાભ કારની નવી તરીકેની સૂચિ કિંમત પર આધારિત છે, તેની ખરીદી કિંમત પર નહીં. કેલ્ક્યુલેટર પ્રકાશિત થ્રેશોલ્ડ અને દરો, કોઈપણ પાત્ર વય અથવા દસ્તાવેજીકૃત કાર્ય-માઈલેજ ઘટાડો અને ઉપલબ્ધ મહિનાઓની સંખ્યા લાગુ કરે છે.","How the estimate works":"અંદાજ કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026 માનક લાભ એ NOK 370,300 સુધીની ઘટાડેલી સૂચિ કિંમતના 30% છે, વત્તા કોઈપણ વધારાના 20%. સૂચિ-કિંમતનો આધાર સામાન્ય રીતે 100% છે; જો 1 જાન્યુઆરીના રોજ કાર ત્રણ વર્ષથી વધુ જૂની હોય અથવા દસ્તાવેજીકૃત વર્ક ડ્રાઇવિંગ 40,000 કિમીથી વધુ હોય તો 75% અને જ્યારે બંને શરતો લાગુ થાય ત્યારે 56.25% છે. ભાગ-વર્ષ માટે આખા મહિનાઓ દાખલ કરો. અંદાજિત વ્યક્તિગત કર એ તમારા પોતાના સીમાંત દર દ્વારા ગુણાકાર કરપાત્ર લાભ છે; આ સંપૂર્ણ ટેક્સ ગણતરી નથી.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"શું કરપાત્ર લાભ હું જે કર ચૂકવું છું તેના સમાન છે?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"નં. માનક નિયમો હેઠળ કરપાત્ર પગારમાં લાભ ઉમેરવામાં આવે છે. અલગ કરનો અંદાજ તેને તમે દાખલ કરેલ સીમાંત દરથી ગુણાકાર કરે છે અને તમારા સંપૂર્ણ નોર્વેજીયન કરની ગણતરી કરતું નથી.","Which car price should I enter?":"મારે કઈ કારની કિંમત દાખલ કરવી જોઈએ?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"અધિકૃત નિયમો હેઠળ સંબંધિત ફેક્ટરી-ફીટ અને ડીલર-ઇન્સ્ટોલ કરેલ સાધનો સહિત સૂચિ કિંમતનો નવા તરીકે ઉપયોગ કરો. વર્તમાન બજાર કિંમત અથવા વપરાયેલી કાર માટે તમે ચૂકવેલ કિંમતનો ઉપયોગ કરશો નહીં.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"માઇલેજ ઘટાડાનો ઉપયોગ હું ક્યારે કરી શકું?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"ફક્ત જ્યારે વર્ક ડ્રાઇવિંગ ક્વોલિફાઇંગ માઇલેજ લોગ દ્વારા દસ્તાવેજીકૃત કરવામાં આવે અને વર્ષમાં 40,000 કિમીથી વધુ હોય. બરાબર 40,000 km લાયક નથી. પર્સનલ ડ્રાઇવિંગ એ વર્ક માઇલેજ નથી.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"શું આ દરેક વાહન અથવા કંપની-કાર કેસને આવરી લે છે?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"નં. તે માત્ર પ્રમાણભૂત નોર્વેજીયન પેસેન્જર-કાર નિયમોને આવરી લે છે. વિશેષ વાહનો, વાન વર્ગ 2, મુક્તિ અને વ્યક્તિગત અપવાદો આ અંદાજની બહાર છે.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"શું પોતાની કારની સરખામણી જેવી છે?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"નં. તે કંપની-કાર લાભ પર અંદાજિત વ્યક્તિગત કરની બાજુમાં તમારી દાખલ કરેલ વાર્ષિક પોતાની-કાર કિંમત મૂકે છે. તે વિવિધ પગલાં છે; તે એમ્પ્લોયર ખર્ચ, વળતર, ધિરાણ, બળતણ, કર કપાત અને ખાનગી ઉપયોગની સંપૂર્ણ કિંમતને બાકાત રાખે છે.","Norway scope and data date":"નોર્વે સ્કોપ અને ડેટા તારીખ","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Skatteetaten ના 2026 સ્ટાન્ડર્ડ કંપની-કાર રેટ્સનો ઉપયોગ કરીને આ નોર્વે-વિશિષ્ટ આયોજન અંદાજ છે, 16 ઓક્ટોબર 2026 ચેક કરેલ છે. નિયમો આ પૃષ્ઠ પર પસંદ કરેલી ભાષા પર આધારિત નથી. તે સત્તાવાર ટેક્સ રિટર્ન, સંપૂર્ણ ટેક્સ ગણતરી અથવા કાનૂની નિર્ણય નથી. ખાસ વાહનો અને અપવાદો બાકાત છે. આ બિલ્ડમાં દરો સ્થિર છે અને પૃષ્ઠભૂમિમાં તાજું થતા નથી; તેમના પર આધાર રાખતા પહેલા ચાલુ વર્ષ માટે Skatteetaten તપાસો.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં ગણતરીઓ ચાલે છે. તમે દાખલ કરેલા આંકડાઓ અપલોડ થયા નથી.","Estimate company-car benefit":"કંપની-કાર લાભનો અંદાજ કાઢો","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"મફત · તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં ચાલે છે","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"પેસેન્જર કાર માટે નોર્વેજીયન 2026 માનક નિયમો. આ પૃષ્ઠ તમારી ભાષામાંથી તમારા ટેક્સ દેશનું અનુમાન કરતું નથી.","Car list price when new, NOK":"નવી હોય ત્યારે કારની સૂચિ કિંમત, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"આખા મહિના સુધી કાર ઉપલબ્ધ હતી, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"આ કાર 1 જાન્યુઆરીના રોજ 3 વર્ષથી વધુ જૂની હતી","Documented work driving during the year, km":"વર્ષ દરમિયાન દસ્તાવેજીકૃત કાર્ય ડ્રાઇવિંગ, કિ.મી","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"મારી પાસે વર્ક ડ્રાઇવિંગ માટે યોગ્ય માઇલેજ લોગ છે","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"તમારા અંદાજિત સીમાંત કર દર, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"તમારી પોતાની કારની વાર્ષિક કિંમત, NOK (વૈકલ્પિક)","Calculate estimate":"અંદાજની ગણતરી કરો","Reset inputs":"રીસેટ ઇનપુટ્સ","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"મૂળ સૂચિ કિંમત અને ઉપલબ્ધ મહિનાઓ દાખલ કરો.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"સૂચિ કિંમત, મહિના, કિલોમીટર અને ટકાવારી તપાસો; માન્ય બિન-નકારાત્મક મૂલ્યો દાખલ કરો.","2026 estimate":"2026 અંદાજ","List price as new":"નવા તરીકે કિંમત સૂચિબદ્ધ કરો","Taxable list-price base":"કરપાત્ર સૂચિ-કિંમત આધાર","Reduced list-price base":"સૂચિ-કિંમતનો આધાર ઘટાડ્યો","Average taxable benefit per month":"દર મહિને સરેરાશ કરપાત્ર લાભ","Taxable benefit for entered months":"દાખલ કરેલ મહિનાઓ માટે કરપાત્ર લાભ","Taxable benefit for a full year":"આખા વર્ષ માટે કરપાત્ર લાભ","Marginal tax rate entered":"સીમાંત કર દર દાખલ કર્યો","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"આ લાભ પર અંદાજિત વ્યક્તિગત કર","Own-car annual cost entered":"પોતાની કારની વાર્ષિક કિંમત દાખલ કરી","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"પોતાની કારની કિંમત બાદ અંદાજિત કંપની-કાર વ્યક્તિગત કર","Months included":"મહિનાઓ શામેલ છે","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"1 જાન્યુઆરી ઘટાડા પર 3 વર્ષથી વધુ જૂનું","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"દસ્તાવેજીકૃત વર્ક-માઇલેજ ઘટાડો લાગુ","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"માઇલેજ ઘટાડવા માટે લોગબુક અને 40,000 વર્ક કિમી કરતાં વધુની જરૂર છે.","Tax year":"કર વર્ષ","Official rate checked":"સત્તાવાર દર ચકાસાયેલ","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 કંપની-કારના દરો","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · કંપનીની કારનો ખાનગી ઉપયોગ","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"ફક્ત સંદર્ભ: પોતાની-કારની વાર્ષિક કિંમત અને કંપની-કારના લાભ પરનો અંદાજિત વ્યક્તિગત કર અલગ-અલગ પગલાં છે; આ કુલ ખર્ચની સરખામણી નથી.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"લાભ કરપાત્ર આવક છે, ટેક્સ બિલ નહીં. કોઈ સંપૂર્ણ આવક-વેરો, એમ્પ્લોયર-ખર્ચ, ભરપાઈ અથવા ધિરાણની ગણતરી શામેલ નથી.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં સ્થાનિક રીતે ચાલે છે; ઇનપુટ આંકડા સર્વર પર મોકલવામાં આવતા નથી."},"ha":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Kalkuletarar Harajin Mota na Kamfanin Norway","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Ƙididdigar Harajin Mota na Kamfanin Norway 2026 - Ƙimar Amfanin Haraji","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Yi ƙididdige fa'idar harajin Norway na 2026 don amfanin sirri na daidaitaccen motar fasinja na kamfani. Shigar da farashin jeri, ragi masu cancanta, watanni da ƙimar harajin ku.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Yi ƙididdige fa'idar albashin Norwegian mai biyan haraji daga amfani da sirri na daidaitaccen motar fasinja na kamfani, sannan kimanta haraji na sirri tare da ɗan ƙaramin adadin da kuka shigar.","What does this estimate?":"Menene wannan kiyasin?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Don ƙa'idodin ƙa'idodin Norway na 2026, fa'idar ta dogara ne akan farashin jerin motar a matsayin sabo, ba farashin sayan sa ba. Ƙididdigar ƙididdiga ta shafi ƙaƙƙarfan da aka buga da ƙima, kowane shekarun da suka cancanta ko raguwar nisan aiki, da adadin watanni da ke akwai.","How the estimate works":"Yadda kimantawa ke aiki","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Matsakaicin fa'idar 2026 shine kashi 30% na ragin farashin jeri har zuwa NOK 370,300, da kashi 20% na duk wani abin da ya wuce gona da iri. Tushen-farashin lissafin yawanci shine 100%; yana da kashi 75% idan motar ta kasance fiye da shekaru uku a ranar 1 ga Janairu ko aikin tukin tuƙi ya wuce kilomita 40,000, da 56.25% lokacin da sharuɗɗan biyu suka shafi. Shigar da dukan watanni na shekara ɗaya. Kiyasin haraji na sirri shine fa'idar da za a iya biyan haraji wanda aka ninka ta ƙimar ku ta gefe; wannan ba cikakken lissafin haraji ba ne.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Shin fa'idar da ake biyan haraji daidai da harajin da na biya?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"A'a. Ana ƙara fa'idar zuwa albashin haraji a ƙarƙashin ƙa'idodin ƙa'idodi. Ƙididdiga na haraji daban yana ninka shi ta ƙimar ƙimar da kuka shigar kuma baya ƙididdige cikakken harajin Norwegian.","Which car price should I enter?":"Wanne farashin mota zan shiga?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Yi amfani da farashin jeri azaman sabo, gami da kayan aikin masana'anta masu dacewa da shigar dilla a ƙarƙashin ƙa'idodin hukuma. Kada ku yi amfani da darajar kasuwa ta yanzu ko farashin da kuka biya don motar da aka yi amfani da ita.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Yaushe zan iya amfani da rage mileage?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Sai kawai lokacin da aka rubuta tuƙin aikin tuƙi ta hanyar rajistar nisan nisan miloli kuma ya wuce kilomita 40,000 a cikin shekara. Daidai kilomita 40,000 bai cancanta ba. Tuki na sirri ba nisan aiki bane.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Shin wannan yana rufe kowane abin hawa ko akwati-motar kamfani?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"A'a. Ya ƙunshi daidaitattun ƙa'idodin motar fasinja na Norway kawai. Motoci na musamman, vans aji 2, keɓancewa da keɓantacce mutum ɗaya ba su da wannan kimanta.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Shin kwatancen motar kansa yana kama-na-kamar?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"No. Yana sanya kuɗin kuɗin motar ku na shekara-shekara kusa da kimanta haraji na sirri akan fa'idar motar kamfani. Wadancan matakan daban-daban ne; ya keɓance farashin ma'aikata, ramawa, kuɗi, mai, cire haraji da cikakken ƙimar amfani mai zaman kansa.","Norway scope and data date":"Yankin Norway da kwanan wata","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Wannan ƙayyadaddun ƙayyadaddun tsarin ƙididdiga ne na Norway ta amfani da Skatteetaten's 2026 daidaitattun ƙimar kamfani-mota, duba 16 Oktoba 2026. Dokokin ba su dogara da harshen da aka zaɓa a wannan shafin ba. Ba harajin hukuma ba ne, cikakken lissafin haraji ko yanke hukunci na doka. Motoci na musamman da keɓancewa an keɓe. Ƙididdigar ƙima a cikin wannan ginin kuma ba sa wartsakewa a bango; duba Skattetaten na wannan shekarar kafin dogaro da su.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Lissafi yana gudana a cikin wannan mazugi. Ba a loda alkaluman da ka shigar.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Kimanin fa'idar kamfani-mota","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"KYAUTA · Yana Gudu A CIKIN browsing","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Ka'idodin ƙa'idodin 2026 na Norwegian don motocin fasinja. Wannan shafin ba ya tantance ƙasar ku ta haraji daga yaren ku.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Farashin lissafin mota lokacin sabo, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Dukkan watanni motar tana samuwa, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"Motar ta kasance fiye da shekaru 3 akan 1 Janairu","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Tsarin tuƙi na aiki a cikin shekara, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Ina da ƙaƙƙarfan rajistar nisan miloli don tukin aikin","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Kimanin kuɗin harajin ku, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Kudin motar ku na shekara, NOK (na zaɓi)","Calculate estimate":"Kididdige ƙiyasin","Reset inputs":"Sake saitin abubuwan shigar","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Shigar da farashin jeri na asali da watanni da ke akwai.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Duba farashin jeri, watanni, kilomita da kaso; shigar da ingantattun dabi'u mara kyau.\nƘimar","2026 estimate":"2026","List price as new":"Farashin lissafin azaman sabo","Taxable list-price base":"Tsarin farashin lissafin haraji","Reduced list-price base":"Rage tushen farashin jeri","Average taxable benefit per month":"Matsakaicin fa'idar haraji kowane wata","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Fa'idar haraji na watanni da aka shigar","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Abin da za a biya haraji na tsawon shekara guda","Marginal tax rate entered":"An shigar da ƙimar haraji kaɗan","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Kimanin haraji na sirri akan wannan fa'idar","Own-car annual cost entered":"Kudin mota na shekara ya shiga","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Kudin motar da aka rage kiyasin harajin kamfani-mota na sirri","Months included":"Watannin sun haɗa","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Sama da shekaru 3 akan 1 an yi amfani da raguwar Janairu","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"An yi amfani da ragin daftarin aiki","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Raguwar nisan mil yana buƙatar littafin shiga da fiye da aikin 40,000 km.","Tax year":"Shekarar haraji","Official rate checked":"An duba ƙimar hukuma","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skattetaten · 2026 farashin mota na kamfani","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skattetaten · amfani da keɓaɓɓen motar kamfani","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Tsarin yanayi kawai: farashin mota na shekara-shekara da kiyasin haraji na mutum akan fa'idar motar kamfani daban-daban matakan; wannan ba kwatankwacin farashi ba ne.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Amfanin shine kudin shiga na haraji, ba lissafin haraji ba. Babu cikakken harajin shiga-kudin shiga, farashin aiki, biyan kuɗi ko lissafin kuɗi da aka haɗa.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Yana gudana cikin gida a cikin wannan burauzar; Ba a aika lambobin shigarwa zuwa uwar garken ba."},"hi":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"नॉर्वे कंपनी कार टैक्स कैलकुलेटर","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"नॉर्वे कंपनी कार टैक्स कैलकुलेटर 2026 — कर योग्य लाभ अनुमान","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"मानक कंपनी यात्री कार के निजी उपयोग के लिए नॉर्वे के 2026 कर योग्य लाभ का अनुमान लगाएं। सूची मूल्य, योग्यता कटौती, महीने और अपना सीमांत कर अनुमान दर्ज करें।","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"एक मानक कंपनी यात्री कार के निजी उपयोग से नॉर्वेजियन कर योग्य वेतन लाभ का अनुमान लगाएं, फिर आपके द्वारा दर्ज की गई सीमांत दर के साथ व्यक्तिगत कर का अनुमान लगाएं।","What does this estimate?":"यह क्या अनुमान लगाता है?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"नॉर्वे के 2026 मानक नियमों के लिए, लाभ कार की नई सूची कीमत पर आधारित है, न कि उसकी खरीद कीमत पर। कैलकुलेटर प्रकाशित सीमा और दरों, किसी भी योग्य आयु या दस्तावेज़ित कार्य-लाभ में कमी और उपलब्ध महीनों की संख्या को लागू करता है।","How the estimate works":"अनुमान कैसे काम करता है","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026 मानक लाभ NOK 370,300 तक घटी हुई सूची कीमत का 30% है, साथ ही किसी भी अतिरिक्त का 20% है। सूची-मूल्य का आधार सामान्यतः 100% है; यह 75% है यदि कार 1 जनवरी को तीन साल से अधिक पुरानी थी या दस्तावेज़ीकृत कार्य ड्राइविंग 40,000 किमी से अधिक थी, और दोनों शर्तें लागू होने पर 56.25% है। अंश-वर्ष के लिए पूरे महीने दर्ज करें. अनुमानित व्यक्तिगत कर आपके स्वयं की सीमांत दर से गुणा किया जाने वाला कर योग्य लाभ है; यह संपूर्ण कर गणना नहीं है.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"क्या करयोग्य लाभ मेरे भुगतान किए गए कर के बराबर है?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"नहीं। मानक नियमों के तहत लाभ कर योग्य वेतन में जोड़ा जाता है। अलग कर अनुमान इसे आपके द्वारा दर्ज की गई सीमांत दर से गुणा करता है और आपके पूर्ण नॉर्वेजियन कर की गणना नहीं करता है।","Which car price should I enter?":"मुझे कौन सी कार की कीमत दर्ज करनी चाहिए?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"आधिकारिक नियमों के तहत प्रासंगिक फैक्ट्री-फिटेड और डीलर-स्थापित उपकरण सहित, सूची मूल्य को नए के रूप में उपयोग करें। मौजूदा बाज़ार मूल्य या प्रयुक्त कार के लिए आपके द्वारा भुगतान की गई कीमत का उपयोग न करें।","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"मैं माइलेज कटौती का उपयोग कब कर सकता हूं?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"केवल तभी जब वर्क ड्राइविंग को क्वालीफाइंग माइलेज लॉग द्वारा प्रलेखित किया जाता है और वर्ष में 40,000 किमी से अधिक हो जाता है। बिल्कुल 40,000 किमी योग्य नहीं है। व्यक्तिगत ड्राइविंग कार्य लाभ नहीं है.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"क्या यह प्रत्येक वाहन या कंपनी-कार केस को कवर करता है?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"नहीं। इसमें केवल मानक नॉर्वेजियन यात्री-कार नियम शामिल हैं। विशेष वाहन, वैन श्रेणी 2, छूट और व्यक्तिगत अपवाद इस अनुमान से बाहर हैं।","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"क्या अपनी कार की तुलना एक जैसी है?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"नहीं। यह आपकी दर्ज की गई वार्षिक स्वयं की कार की लागत को कंपनी-कार लाभ पर अनुमानित व्यक्तिगत कर के बगल में रखता है। वे अलग-अलग उपाय हैं; इसमें नियोक्ता लागत, प्रतिपूर्ति, वित्तपोषण, ईंधन, कर कटौती और निजी उपयोग का पूरा मूल्य शामिल नहीं है।","Norway scope and data date":"नॉर्वे दायरा और डेटा दिनांक","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"यह एक नॉर्वे-विशिष्ट योजना अनुमान है जो स्कैटीटेटेन की 2026 मानक कंपनी-कार दरों का उपयोग करता है, 16 अक्टूबर 2026 की जाँच की जाती है। नियम इस पृष्ठ पर चयनित भाषा पर निर्भर नहीं हैं। यह कोई आधिकारिक कर रिटर्न, पूर्ण कर गणना या कानूनी निर्णय नहीं है। विशेष वाहनों और अपवादों को बाहर रखा गया है। इस निर्माण में दरें स्थिर हैं और पृष्ठभूमि में ताज़ा नहीं होती हैं; उन पर भरोसा करने से पहले चालू वर्ष के लिए स्कैटीटेटेन की जांच करें।","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"गणना इस ब्राउज़र में चलती है। आपके द्वारा दर्ज किए गए आंकड़े अपलोड नहीं किए गए हैं.","Estimate company-car benefit":"कंपनी-कार लाभ का अनुमान लगाएं","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"मुफ़्त · आपके ब्राउज़र में चलता है","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"यात्री कारों के लिए नॉर्वेजियन 2026 मानक नियम। यह पृष्ठ आपकी भाषा से आपके कर देश का अनुमान नहीं लगाता है।","Car list price when new, NOK":"नई होने पर कार सूची मूल्य, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"कार पूरे महीने उपलब्ध थी, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"1 जनवरी को कार 3 वर्ष से अधिक पुरानी थी","Documented work driving during the year, km":"वर्ष के दौरान प्रलेखित कार्य ड्राइविंग, किमी","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"मेरे पास वर्क ड्राइविंग के लिए क्वालीफाइंग माइलेज लॉग है","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"आपकी अनुमानित सीमांत कर दर, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"आपकी अपनी कार की वार्षिक लागत, NOK (वैकल्पिक)","Calculate estimate":"अनुमान की गणना करें","Reset inputs":"इनपुट रीसेट करें","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"मूल सूची मूल्य और उपलब्ध महीने दर्ज करें।","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"सूची मूल्य, महीने, किलोमीटर और प्रतिशत की जाँच करें; मान्य गैर-नकारात्मक मान दर्ज करें.","2026 estimate":"2026 अनुमान","List price as new":"सूची कीमत नई के रूप में","Taxable list-price base":"करयोग्य सूची-मूल्य आधार","Reduced list-price base":"कम सूची-मूल्य आधार","Average taxable benefit per month":"प्रति माह औसत कर योग्य लाभ","Taxable benefit for entered months":"प्रविष्ट महीनों के लिए कर योग्य लाभ","Taxable benefit for a full year":"पूरे वर्ष के लिए कर योग्य लाभ","Marginal tax rate entered":"सीमांत कर दर दर्ज की गई","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"इस लाभ पर अनुमानित व्यक्तिगत कर","Own-car annual cost entered":"अपनी कार की वार्षिक लागत दर्ज की गई","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"अपनी कार की लागत घटाकर अनुमानित कंपनी-कार व्यक्तिगत कर","Months included":"महीने शामिल","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"3 वर्ष से अधिक पुराने 1 पर जनवरी में कटौती लागू की गई","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"प्रलेखित कार्य-माइलेज कटौती लागू की गई","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"माइलेज कटौती के लिए एक लॉगबुक और 40,000 से अधिक कार्य किमी की आवश्यकता होती है।","Tax year":"कर वर्ष","Official rate checked":"आधिकारिक दर की जाँच की गई","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 कंपनी-कार दरें","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · कंपनी की कार का निजी उपयोग","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"केवल संदर्भ: स्वयं की कार की वार्षिक लागत और कंपनी-कार लाभ पर अनुमानित व्यक्तिगत कर अलग-अलग उपाय हैं; यह कुल लागत की तुलना नहीं है.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"लाभ कर योग्य आय है, कर बिल नहीं। कोई पूर्ण आयकर, नियोक्ता-लागत, प्रतिपूर्ति या वित्तपोषण गणना शामिल नहीं है।","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"इस ब्राउज़र में स्थानीय रूप से चलता है; इनपुट आंकड़े सर्वर पर नहीं भेजे जाते हैं।"},"id":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Kalkulator Pajak Mobil Perusahaan Norwegia","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Kalkulator Pajak Mobil Perusahaan Norwegia 2026 — Perkiraan Manfaat Kena Pajak","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Perkirakan manfaat kena pajak 2026 di Norwegia untuk penggunaan pribadi atas mobil penumpang perusahaan standar. Masukkan harga jual, pengurangan yang memenuhi syarat, bulan dan perkiraan pajak marjinal Anda.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Perkirakan manfaat gaji kena pajak Norwegia dari penggunaan pribadi atas mobil penumpang perusahaan standar, lalu perkirakan pajak pribadi dengan tarif marjinal yang Anda masukkan.","What does this estimate?":"Berapa perkiraannya?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Untuk aturan standar 2026 Norwegia, keuntungan didasarkan pada daftar harga mobil sebagai baru, bukan harga pembeliannya. Kalkulator menerapkan ambang batas dan tarif yang dipublikasikan, usia yang memenuhi syarat atau pengurangan jarak tempuh kerja yang terdokumentasi, dan jumlah bulan yang tersedia.","How the estimate works":"Cara kerja perkiraan","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Manfaat standar 2026 adalah 30% dari harga jual yang dikurangi hingga NOK 370,300, ditambah 20% dari kelebihan apa pun. Basis daftar harga biasanya 100%; itu adalah 75% jika mobil berusia lebih dari tiga tahun pada 1 bulan Januari atau dokumen kerja mengemudi melebihi 40,000 km, dan 56.25% ketika kedua kondisi berlaku. Masukkan seluruh bulan untuk paruh tahun. Taksiran pajak pribadi adalah manfaat kena pajak dikalikan dengan tarif marjinal Anda sendiri; ini bukan perhitungan pajak penuh.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Apakah manfaat kena pajak sama dengan pajak yang saya bayarkan?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Tidak. Tunjangan tersebut ditambahkan ke gaji kena pajak berdasarkan aturan standar. Perkiraan pajak terpisah mengalikannya dengan tarif marjinal yang Anda masukkan dan tidak menghitung pajak Norwegia secara penuh.","Which car price should I enter?":"Berapa harga mobil yang harus saya masukkan?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Gunakan daftar harga seperti baru, termasuk peralatan terkait yang dipasang di pabrik dan dipasang oleh dealer berdasarkan aturan resmi. Jangan gunakan nilai pasar saat ini atau harga yang Anda bayarkan untuk mobil bekas.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Kapan saya bisa menggunakan pengurangan jarak tempuh?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Hanya ketika mengemudi di tempat kerja didokumentasikan oleh catatan jarak tempuh yang memenuhi syarat dan melebihi 40,000 km pada tahun tersebut. Tepatnya 40,000 km tidak memenuhi syarat. Mengemudi pribadi bukanlah jarak tempuh kerja.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Apakah ini mencakup semua kendaraan atau casing mobil perusahaan?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Tidak. Ini hanya mencakup peraturan mobil penumpang standar Norwegia. Kendaraan khusus, van kelas 2, pengecualian dan pengecualian individu berada di luar perkiraan ini.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Apakah perbandingan mobil sendiri suka-suka?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Tidak. Ini menempatkan biaya mobil tahunan yang Anda masukkan di sebelah perkiraan pajak pribadi atas keuntungan mobil perusahaan. Ini adalah langkah-langkah yang berbeda; ini tidak termasuk biaya pemberi kerja, penggantian biaya, pembiayaan, bahan bakar, pengurangan pajak, dan nilai penuh penggunaan pribadi.","Norway scope and data date":"Cakupan Norwegia dan tanggal data","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Ini adalah perkiraan perencanaan khusus Norwegia menggunakan tarif mobil perusahaan standar 2026 Skatteetaten, diperiksa 16 Oktober 2026. Aturan tidak bergantung pada bahasa yang dipilih di halaman ini. Ini bukan laporan pajak resmi, penghitungan pajak lengkap, atau keputusan hukum. Kendaraan khusus dan pengecualian tidak termasuk. Tarif bersifat statis dalam versi ini dan tidak disegarkan di latar belakang; periksa Skatteetaten untuk tahun berjalan sebelum mengandalkannya.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Perhitungan dijalankan di browser ini. Angka yang Anda masukkan tidak diunggah.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Perkirakan keuntungan mobil perusahaan","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · BERJALAN DI BROWSER ANDA","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Aturan standar 2026 Norwegia untuk mobil penumpang. Halaman ini tidak menyimpulkan negara pajak Anda dari bahasa Anda.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Daftar harga mobil saat baru, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Sepanjang bulan mobil tersedia, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"Mobil berusia lebih dari 3 tahun pada 1 Januari","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Pekerjaan mengemudi yang terdokumentasi sepanjang tahun, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Saya memiliki catatan jarak tempuh yang memenuhi syarat untuk pekerjaan mengemudi","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Perkiraan tarif pajak marjinal Anda, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Biaya tahunan mobil Anda sendiri, NOK (opsional)","Calculate estimate":"Hitung perkiraan","Reset inputs":"Setel ulang input","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Masukkan daftar harga asli dan bulan yang tersedia.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Periksa daftar harga, bulan, kilometer dan persentase; masukkan nilai non-negatif yang valid.\nPerkiraan","2026 estimate":"2026","List price as new":"Daftarkan harga seperti baru","Taxable list-price base":"Dasar harga daftar kena pajak","Reduced list-price base":"Pengurangan basis harga daftar","Average taxable benefit per month":"Rata-rata manfaat kena pajak per bulan","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Manfaat kena pajak untuk bulan-bulan yang dimasukkan","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Manfaat kena pajak selama setahun penuh","Marginal tax rate entered":"Tarif pajak marjinal dimasukkan","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Perkiraan pajak pribadi atas manfaat ini","Own-car annual cost entered":"Biaya tahunan mobil sendiri dimasukkan","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Biaya mobil sendiri dikurangi perkiraan pajak pribadi mobil perusahaan","Months included":"Termasuk bulan","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Lebih dari 3 tahun pada pengurangan 1 bulan Januari diterapkan","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Pengurangan jarak tempuh kerja yang terdokumentasi diterapkan","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Pengurangan jarak tempuh memerlukan buku catatan dan lebih dari 40,000 km kerja.","Tax year":"Tahun pajak","Official rate checked":"Tarif resmi diperiksa","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · Tarif mobil perusahaan 2026","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · penggunaan pribadi mobil perusahaan","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Hanya konteks: biaya tahunan mobil sendiri dan perkiraan pajak pribadi atas keuntungan mobil perusahaan adalah ukuran yang berbeda; ini bukan perbandingan total biaya.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Manfaatnya adalah penghasilan kena pajak, bukan tagihan pajak. Tidak ada perhitungan penuh pajak penghasilan, biaya pemberi kerja, penggantian atau pembiayaan.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Berjalan secara lokal di browser ini; angka input tidak dikirim ke server."},"it":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Calcolatore delle tasse sulle auto aziendali norvegesi","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Calcolatore delle tasse sulle auto aziendali norvegesi 2026 — Stima del beneficio imponibile","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Stima del beneficio imponibile 2026 della Norvegia per l'uso privato di un'autovettura aziendale standard. Inserisci il prezzo di listino, le riduzioni qualificanti, i mesi e la stima delle imposte marginali.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Stima il beneficio salariale imponibile norvegese derivante dall'uso privato di un'autovettura aziendale standard, quindi stima l'imposta personale con un'aliquota marginale inserita.","What does this estimate?":"Che cosa stima?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Per le regole standard 2026 della Norvegia, il vantaggio si basa sul prezzo di listino dell'auto come nuova, non sul prezzo di acquisto. Il calcolatore applica la soglia e le tariffe pubblicate, qualsiasi età ammissibile o riduzione documentata del chilometraggio lavorativo e il numero di mesi disponibili.","How the estimate works":"Come funziona il preventivo","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Il vantaggio standard 2026 è pari a 30% del prezzo di listino ridotto fino a NOK 370,300, più 20% di qualsiasi franchigia. La base del prezzo di listino è normalmente 100%; è 75% se l'auto aveva più di tre anni al 1 gennaio o se la guida lavorativa documentata superava 40,000 km e 56.25% quando si applicano entrambe le condizioni. Inserisci mesi interi per una parte dell'anno. L'imposta personale stimata è il beneficio imponibile moltiplicato per la propria aliquota marginale; questo non è un calcolo fiscale completo.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Il beneficio imponibile è pari all'imposta che pago?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"N. Il beneficio viene aggiunto allo stipendio imponibile secondo le regole standard. La stima fiscale separata la moltiplica per l'aliquota marginale inserita e non calcola l'intera imposta norvegese.","Which car price should I enter?":"Quale prezzo dell'auto devo inserire?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Utilizzare il prezzo di listino come nuovo, comprese le apparecchiature pertinenti montate in fabbrica e installate dal rivenditore secondo le norme ufficiali. Non utilizzare il valore di mercato corrente o il prezzo pagato per un'auto usata.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Quando posso usufruire della riduzione chilometrica?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Solo quando la guida per lavoro è documentata da un registro del chilometraggio valido e supera 40,000 km nell'anno. Esattamente 40,000 km non sono idonei. La guida personale non è il chilometraggio lavorativo.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Copre ogni caso di veicolo o auto aziendale?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"N. Copre solo le norme standard delle autovetture norvegesi. Veicoli speciali, furgoni classe 2, esenzioni ed eccezioni individuali non rientrano in questa stima.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Il confronto tra auto proprie è omogeneo?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"N. Posiziona il costo annuale dell'auto propria inserito accanto all'imposta personale stimata su un beneficio per l'auto aziendale. Queste sono misure diverse; sono esclusi i costi a carico del datore di lavoro, i rimborsi, i finanziamenti, il carburante, le detrazioni fiscali e l'intero valore dell'uso privato.","Norway scope and data date":"Ambito e data dei dati della Norvegia","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Questa è una stima di pianificazione specifica per la Norvegia che utilizza le tariffe standard per auto aziendali 2026 di Skatteetaten, verificata 16 ottobre 2026. Le regole non dipendono dalla lingua selezionata in questa pagina. Non si tratta di una dichiarazione dei redditi ufficiale, di un calcolo completo delle imposte o di una decisione legale. Sono esclusi veicoli speciali ed eccezioni. Le tariffe sono statiche in questa build e non si aggiornano in background; controlla Skateetaten per l'anno in corso prima di affidarti a loro.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"I calcoli vengono eseguiti in questo browser. Le cifre inserite non vengono caricate.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Stima del vantaggio dell'auto aziendale","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUITO · FUNZIONA NEL TUO BROWSER","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Regole standard norvegesi 2026 per le autovetture. Questa pagina non deduce il tuo paese fiscale dalla tua lingua.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Prezzo di listino auto da nuova, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Mesi interi in cui l'auto era disponibile, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"L'auto aveva più di 3 anni il 1 gennaio","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Lavori documentati di guida nell'anno, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Ho un registro del chilometraggio valido per la guida di lavoro","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"La tua aliquota fiscale marginale stimata,%","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Costo annuale della tua auto, NOK (opzionale)","Calculate estimate":"Calcola preventivo","Reset inputs":"Reimposta gli ingressi","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Inserisci il prezzo di listino originale e i mesi disponibili.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Verifica prezzo di listino, mesi, chilometri e percentuale; immettere valori validi non negativi.","2026 estimate":"2026 stima","List price as new":"Prezzo di listino come nuovo","Taxable list-price base":"Prezzo di listino imponibile","Reduced list-price base":"Listino base ridotto","Average taxable benefit per month":"Beneficio imponibile medio al mese","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Beneficio imponibile per i mesi inseriti","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Beneficio imponibile per un anno intero","Marginal tax rate entered":"Aliquota fiscale marginale inserita","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Imposta personale stimata su questo vantaggio","Own-car annual cost entered":"Costo annuale della propria auto inserito","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Costo dell'auto propria meno l'imposta personale stimata sull'auto aziendale","Months included":"Mesi inclusi","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Oltre 3 anni al 1 Riduzione di gennaio applicata","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Riduzione documentata del chilometraggio lavorativo applicata","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"La riduzione del chilometraggio richiede un registro e più di 40,000 km di lavoro.","Tax year":"Anno fiscale","Official rate checked":"Tariffa ufficiale controllata","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · Tariffe per auto aziendali 2026","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · uso privato di un'auto aziendale","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Solo contesto: il costo annuale della propria auto e l'imposta personale stimata su un beneficio relativo all'auto aziendale sono misure diverse; questo non è un confronto del costo totale.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Il vantaggio è il reddito imponibile, non la fattura fiscale. Non è incluso il calcolo completo dell'imposta sul reddito, dei costi del datore di lavoro, del rimborso o del finanziamento.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Esegue localmente in questo browser; i dati di input non vengono inviati a un server."},"ja":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"ノルウェー会社の自動車税計算機","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"ノルウェー会社の自動車税計算ツール 2026 — 課税対象となる給付金の見積り","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"標準的な社用乗用車の私的使用に対するノルウェーの 2026 課税特典を見積もります。定価、対象となる割引額、月数、および限界税額の見積りを入力します。","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"標準的な社用乗用車の私的使用によるノルウェーの課税対象給与利益を見積もり、入力した限界税率を使用して個人税を見積もります。","What does this estimate?":"これは何を推定しますか?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"ノルウェーの 2026 標準規則の場合、特典は車の購入価格ではなく、新車としての定価に基づいています。この計算ツールは、公開されているしきい値とレート、対象となる年齢または文書化されたワークマイレージの削減、および利用可能な月数を適用します。","How the estimate works":"見積もりの仕組み","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026 の標準特典は、NOK 370,300 までの割引定価の 30% に、超過分の 20% を加えたものです。通常、定価ベースは 100% です。 1 1 月に車が 3 年以上経過していた場合、または文書化された仕事の運転が 40,000 km を超えていた場合は 75% となり、両方の条件が当てはまる場合は 56.25% になります。一部年の場合は月全体を入力します。推定個人税は、課税対象利益に独自の限界税率を乗じたものです。これは完全な税金の計算ではありません。","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"課税対象の給付金は私が支払う税金と同じですか?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"いいえ。この給付金は、標準規則に基づいて課税対象給与に加算されます。個別の税額の見積もりでは、入力した限界税率が乗算され、ノルウェーの税額全体が計算されるわけではありません。","Which car price should I enter?":"どの車の価格を入力すればよいですか?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"正規の規則に基づいて、関連する工場装着およびディーラー設置の機器を含む、新品としての定価を使用してください。現在の市場価格や中古車に支払った価格を使用しないでください。","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"マイレージ割引はいつ利用できますか?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"仕事での運転が適格な走行距離ログに記録され、年間の走行距離が 40,000 km を超えた場合のみ。まさに 40,000 km は対象外です。個人的な運転は仕事上の走行距離ではありません。","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"これはすべての車両または社用車のケースをカバーしますか?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"いいえ。ノルウェーの標準乗用車規則のみを対象としています。特殊車両、バン クラス 2、免除および個別の例外は、この見積もりの​​対象外です。","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"自車の比較は同等ですか?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"いいえ。入力した年間自家用車費用は、社用車給付金の推定個人税の隣に表示されます。これらは異なる対策です。これには、雇用主のコスト、償還、資金調達、燃料、税控除、および私的使用の全額は含まれません。","Norway scope and data date":"ノルウェーの範囲とデータの日付","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"これは、Skatteetaten の 2026 標準社用車料金を使用したノルウェー固有の計画見積もりであり、16 10 月 2026 で確認されます。ルールは、このページで選択した言語には依存しません。これは正式な納税申告書、完全な税額計算、または法的決定ではありません。特殊車両や例外車両は除きます。このビルドではレートは静的であり、バックグラウンドで更新されません。信頼する前に、今年の Skatteetaten を確認してください。","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"計算はこのブラウザで実行されます。入力した数値はアップロードされません。","Estimate company-car benefit":"社用車の福利厚生の見積もり","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"無料 · ブラウザで実行可能","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"乗用車に関するノルウェーの 2026 標準規則。このページでは、言語から課税国を推測するものではありません。","Car list price when new, NOK":"新車時の車の定価、NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"車が利用可能だった月全体、1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"車は 1 1 月に 3 年以上経過していました","Documented work driving during the year, km":"年間の業務運転の記録、km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"仕事での運転に適した走行距離記録を持っています","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"推定限界税率、%","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"自家用車の年間費用、NOK (オプション)","Calculate estimate":"見積もりを計算する","Reset inputs":"リセット入力","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"元の希望小売価格と利用可能な月を入力します。","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"定価、月数、キロメートル、パーセンテージを確認します。有効な負でない値を入力してください。","2026 estimate":"2026 の見積もり","List price as new":"新品時の定価","Taxable list-price base":"課税対象定価ベース","Reduced list-price base":"定価ベースの値下げ","Average taxable benefit per month":"1 か月あたりの平均課税給付額","Taxable benefit for entered months":"入力した月の課税対象給付金","Taxable benefit for a full year":"通年分の課税対象給付金","Marginal tax rate entered":"限界税率が入力されました","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"この給付金に対する推定個人税","Own-car annual cost entered":"自車の年間コストを入力しました","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"自家用車の費用から推定社用車の個人税を差し引いた額","Months included":"含まれる月数","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"1 で 3 年以上経過し、1 月の削減が適用されました","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"文書化されたワークマイレージ削減が適用されました","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"走行距離を減らすには、ログブックと 40,000 作業キロ以上が必要です。","Tax year":"課税年度","Official rate checked":"公式レートを確認しました","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"スカッとしたてん・2026社用車料金","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"スカしてたてん・社用車の私的使用","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"文脈のみ: 自家用車の年間コストと社用車給付金に対する推定個人税は異なる尺度です。これは総コストの比較ではありません。","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"給付金は税金請求額ではなく、課税所得です。完全な所得税、雇用主のコスト、償還または資金調達の計算は含まれていません。","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"このブラウザでローカルに実行されます。入力された数値はサーバーに送信されません。"},"ko":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"노르웨이 회사 자동차세 계산기","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"노르웨이 회사 자동차세 계산기 2026 — 과세 혜택 추정치","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"표준 회사 승용차의 개인 사용에 대한 노르웨이의 2026 과세 혜택을 추정합니다. 정가, 적격 할인 금액, 개월 수 및 한계 세금 추정치를 입력하세요.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"표준 회사 승용차의 개인적 사용으로 인한 노르웨이 과세 급여 혜택을 추정한 다음 입력한 한계율을 사용하여 개인세를 추정합니다.","What does this estimate?":"이 추정치는 무엇입니까?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"노르웨이 2026 표준 규칙의 경우 혜택은 구매 가격이 아닌 새 자동차의 정가를 기준으로 결정됩니다. 계산기는 게시된 임계값과 요율, 적격 연령 또는 문서화된 근무 마일리지 감소, 사용 가능한 개월 수를 적용합니다.","How the estimate works":"추정 작동 방식","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026 표준 혜택은 최대 NOK 370,300까지 인하된 정가의 30%에 초과 금액의 20%를 더한 금액입니다. 정가 기준은 일반적으로 100%입니다. 차량이 1월 1일에 3년 이상 낡았거나 문서화된 작업 운전이 40,000km를 초과한 경우 75%이고 두 조건이 모두 적용되면 56.25%입니다. 부분 연도의 경우 전체 월을 입력합니다. 추정 개인세는 과세 혜택에 한계 세율을 곱한 금액입니다. 이는 전체 세금 계산이 아닙니다.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"과세 혜택은 내가 지불하는 세금과 동일합니까?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"아니요. 이 혜택은 표준 규칙에 따라 과세 급여에 추가됩니다. 별도의 세금 추정치는 여기에 입력한 한계 세율을 곱하며 노르웨이 세금 전체를 계산하지 않습니다.","Which car price should I enter?":"어떤 자동차 가격을 입력해야 합니까?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"공식 규정에 따라 관련 공장 장착 및 딜러 설치 장비를 포함하여 정가를 새 제품으로 사용하십시오. 현재의 시장 가치나 중고차 구입 가격을 사용하지 마십시오.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"마일리지 감소는 언제 사용할 수 있나요?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"업무 운전이 적격 마일리지 기록에 기록되고 연간 40,000km를 초과하는 경우에만 해당됩니다. 정확히 40,000km는 자격이 없습니다. 개인 운전은 업무 마일리지가 아닙니다.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"이것은 모든 차량 또는 회사 차량 케이스에 적용됩니까?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"아니요. 이는 표준 노르웨이 승용차 규정만을 다루고 있습니다. 특수 차량, 밴 클래스 2, 면제 및 개별 예외는 이 추정치에 포함되지 않습니다.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"자차 비교가 비슷합니까?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"아니요. 회사 차량 혜택에 대한 예상 개인세 옆에 입력한 연간 차량 소유 비용을 표시합니다. 그것들은 다른 측정값입니다. 고용주 비용, 환급, 자금 조달, 연료, 세금 공제 및 개인 사용의 전체 가치는 제외됩니다.","Norway scope and data date":"노르웨이 범위 및 데이터 날짜","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"이것은 Skatteetaten의 2026 표준 회사 차량 요금을 사용한 노르웨이별 계획 추정치입니다. 16 10월 2026를 확인했습니다. 규칙은 이 페이지에서 선택한 언어에 따라 달라지지 않습니다. 이는 공식적인 세금 신고서, 전체 세금 계산 또는 법적 결정이 아닙니다. 특수차량 및 예외차량은 제외됩니다. 이 빌드에서는 요금이 정적이며 백그라운드에서 새로 고쳐지지 않습니다. 의존하기 전에 올해 Skatteetaten을 확인하세요.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"계산은 이 브라우저에서 실행됩니다. 입력하신 수치는 업로드되지 않습니다.","Estimate company-car benefit":"회사 차량 혜택 추정","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"무료 · 브라우저에서 실행","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"노르웨이 2026 승용차 표준 규칙입니다. 이 페이지는 귀하의 언어에서 귀하의 세금 국가를 추론하지 않습니다.","Car list price when new, NOK":"신차일 때 자동차 정가, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"자동차를 사용할 수 있는 달 내내, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"차는 1년 1월에 3년이 넘었습니다.","Documented work driving during the year, km":"연간 작업 운전 기록, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"업무 운전에 적합한 마일리지 기록이 있습니다.","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"예상 한계 세율, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"자차 연간 비용, NOK(선택 사항)","Calculate estimate":"견적 계산","Reset inputs":"입력 재설정","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"원래 정가와 사용 가능한 월을 입력하세요.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"정가, 월, 킬로미터 및 백분율을 확인하십시오. 음수가 아닌 유효한 값을 입력하세요.","2026 estimate":"2026 추정","List price as new":"신품 정가","Taxable list-price base":"과세 정가 기준","Reduced list-price base":"정가 기반 감소","Average taxable benefit per month":"월 평균 과세 혜택","Taxable benefit for entered months":"입력한 달에 대해 과세 대상 혜택","Taxable benefit for a full year":"1년 동안 과세 대상 혜택","Marginal tax rate entered":"한계 세율이 입력되었습니다.","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"이 혜택에 대한 추정 개인세","Own-car annual cost entered":"자차 연간 비용 입력됨","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"자유 차량 비용에서 예상 회사 차량 개인세를 뺀 금액","Months included":"월 포함","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"1에 3년 이상 1월 감소 적용","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"문서화된 작업 마일리지 감소 적용","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"마일리지 감소에는 로그북과 40,000 이상의 작업 km가 필요합니다.","Tax year":"과세연도","Official rate checked":"공식 환율 확인됨","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 회사 차량 요금","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · 회사 차량의 개인 사용","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"컨텍스트 전용: 자동차 소유 연간 비용과 회사 자동차 혜택에 대한 추정 개인세는 서로 다른 측정값입니다. 이는 총 비용 비교가 아닙니다.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"혜택은 세금 고지서가 아니라 과세 소득입니다. 전체 소득세, 고용주 비용, 환급 또는 자금 조달 계산은 포함되지 않습니다.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"이 브라우저에서 로컬로 실행됩니다. 입력 수치는 서버로 전송되지 않습니다."},"mr":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"नॉर्वे कंपनी कार टॅक्स कॅल्क्युलेटर","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"नॉर्वे कंपनी कार कर कॅल्क्युलेटर 2026 — करपात्र लाभ अंदाज","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"मानक कंपनीच्या प्रवासी कारच्या खाजगी वापरासाठी नॉर्वेच्या 2026 करपात्र लाभाचा अंदाज लावा. सूची किंमत, पात्र कपात, महिने आणि तुमचा किरकोळ कर अंदाज एंटर करा.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"मानक कंपनीच्या प्रवासी कारच्या खाजगी वापरातून नॉर्वेजियन करपात्र पगाराच्या लाभाचा अंदाज लावा, त्यानंतर तुम्ही प्रविष्ट केलेल्या किरकोळ दरासह वैयक्तिक कराचा अंदाज लावा.","What does this estimate?":"याचा अंदाज काय आहे?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"नॉर्वेच्या 2026 मानक नियमांसाठी, फायदा कारच्या नवीन म्हणून सूची किंमतीवर आधारित आहे, त्याच्या खरेदी किंमतीवर नाही. कॅल्क्युलेटर प्रकाशित थ्रेशोल्ड आणि दर, कोणतेही पात्र वय किंवा दस्तऐवजीकरण केलेले काम-मायलेज कपात आणि उपलब्ध महिन्यांची संख्या लागू करते.","How the estimate works":"अनुमान कसे कार्य करते","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026 मानक लाभ हा NOK 370,300 पर्यंत कमी केलेल्या सूची किमतीच्या 30%, तसेच कोणत्याही अतिरिक्त 20% आहे. सूची-किंमत आधार सामान्यतः 100% आहे; 1 जानेवारीला कार तीन वर्षांहून अधिक जुनी असेल किंवा कागदोपत्री कामाने 40,000 किमी ओलांडली असेल तर 75% आणि दोन्ही अटी लागू झाल्यास 56.25%. अर्ध-वर्षासाठी संपूर्ण महिने प्रविष्ट करा. अंदाजे वैयक्तिक कर हा तुमच्या स्वतःच्या किरकोळ दराने गुणाकार केलेला करपात्र लाभ आहे; ही संपूर्ण कर गणना नाही.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"करपात्र लाभ हा मी भरलेल्या कराच्या बरोबरीचा आहे का?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"नं. मानक नियमांनुसार करपात्र पगारामध्ये लाभ जोडला जातो. वेगळा कर अंदाज तुम्ही एंटर केलेल्या किरकोळ दराने गुणाकार करतो आणि तुमच्या संपूर्ण नॉर्वेजियन कराची गणना करत नाही.","Which car price should I enter?":"मी कोणत्या कारची किंमत प्रविष्ट करावी?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"अधिकृत नियमांनुसार संबंधित फॅक्टरी-फिट केलेल्या आणि डीलर-स्थापित उपकरणांसह, यादी किंमत नवीन म्हणून वापरा. सध्याचे बाजार मूल्य किंवा तुम्ही वापरलेल्या कारसाठी दिलेली किंमत वापरू नका.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"मी मायलेज कपात कधी वापरू शकतो?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"केवळ जेव्हा कामाचे ड्रायव्हिंग पात्र मायलेज लॉगद्वारे दस्तऐवजीकरण केले जाते आणि वर्षात 40,000 किमी ओलांडते. नक्की 40,000 किमी पात्र नाही. वैयक्तिक ड्रायव्हिंग हे कामाचे मायलेज नाही.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"हे प्रत्येक वाहन किंवा कंपनी-कार केस कव्हर करते का?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"नं. हे फक्त नॉर्वेजियन प्रवासी-कार नियम समाविष्ट करते. विशेष वाहने, व्हॅन क्लास 2, सूट आणि वैयक्तिक अपवाद या अंदाजाबाहेर आहेत.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"स्वतःच्या कारची तुलना सारखी आहे का?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"नं. हे कंपनी-कार फायद्यावरील अंदाजे वैयक्तिक कराच्या पुढे तुमची प्रविष्ट केलेली वार्षिक स्वत:ची-कार किंमत ठेवते. ते वेगवेगळे उपाय आहेत; यात नियोक्ता खर्च, प्रतिपूर्ती, वित्तपुरवठा, इंधन, कर कपात आणि खाजगी वापराचे संपूर्ण मूल्य वगळले आहे.","Norway scope and data date":"नॉर्वे स्कोप आणि डेटा तारीख","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"हा Skatteetaten चे 2026 मानक कंपनी-कार दर वापरून नॉर्वे-विशिष्ट नियोजन अंदाज आहे, 16 ऑक्टोबर 2026 तपासले. नियम या पृष्ठावर निवडलेल्या भाषेवर अवलंबून नाहीत. हे अधिकृत कर विवरण, पूर्ण कर गणना किंवा कायदेशीर निर्णय नाही. विशेष वाहने आणि अपवाद वगळण्यात आले आहेत. या बिल्डमध्ये दर स्थिर आहेत आणि पार्श्वभूमीमध्ये रीफ्रेश होत नाहीत; त्यांच्यावर अवलंबून राहण्यापूर्वी चालू वर्षासाठी Skatteetaten तपासा.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"गणना या ब्राउझरमध्ये चालतात. तुम्ही प्रविष्ट केलेले आकडे अपलोड केलेले नाहीत.","Estimate company-car benefit":"कंपनी-कार लाभाचा अंदाज लावा","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"विनामूल्य · तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये चालते","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"प्रवासी कारसाठी नॉर्वेजियन 2026 मानक नियम. हे पृष्ठ तुमच्या भाषेतून तुमच्या कर देशाचा अंदाज लावत नाही.","Car list price when new, NOK":"नवीन असताना कारची सूची किंमत, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"संपूर्ण महिने कार उपलब्ध होती, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"1 जानेवारी रोजी कार 3 वर्षांपेक्षा जुनी होती","Documented work driving during the year, km":"वर्षभरात ड्रायव्हिंगचे दस्तऐवजीकरण केलेले काम, किमी","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"वर्क ड्रायव्हिंगसाठी माझ्याकडे पात्र मायलेज लॉग आहे","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"तुमचा अंदाजे किरकोळ कर दर, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"तुमची स्वतःची कार वार्षिक किंमत, NOK (पर्यायी)","Calculate estimate":"अंदाज मोजा","Reset inputs":"इनपुट रीसेट करा","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"मूळ यादी किंमत आणि उपलब्ध महिने प्रविष्ट करा.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"सूची किंमत, महिने, किलोमीटर आणि टक्केवारी तपासा; वैध गैर-नकारात्मक मूल्ये प्रविष्ट करा.","2026 estimate":"2026 अंदाज","List price as new":"नवीन म्हणून किंमत सूचीबद्ध करा","Taxable list-price base":"करपात्र सूची-किंमत आधार","Reduced list-price base":"सूची-किंमत आधार कमी","Average taxable benefit per month":"दर महिन्याला सरासरी करपात्र लाभ","Taxable benefit for entered months":"प्रविष्ट केलेल्या महिन्यांसाठी करपात्र लाभ","Taxable benefit for a full year":"पूर्ण वर्षासाठी करपात्र लाभ","Marginal tax rate entered":"सीमांत कर दर प्रविष्ट केला","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"या लाभावर अंदाजे वैयक्तिक कर","Own-car annual cost entered":"स्वतःच्या कारची वार्षिक किंमत प्रविष्ट केली आहे","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"स्वतःच्या कारची किंमत वजा अंदाजे कंपनी-कार वैयक्तिक कर","Months included":"महिने समाविष्ट","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"1 जानेवारी रोजी 3 वर्षांपेक्षा जास्त जुनी कपात लागू","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"दस्तऐवजीकरण केलेले काम-मायलेज कपात लागू","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"मायलेज कमी करण्यासाठी लॉगबुक आवश्यक आहे आणि 40,000 कार्य किमीपेक्षा जास्त.","Tax year":"कर वर्ष","Official rate checked":"अधिकृत दर तपासले","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 कंपनी-कार दर","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · कंपनीच्या कारचा खाजगी वापर","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"केवळ संदर्भ: स्वत:च्या कारची वार्षिक किंमत आणि कंपनी-कारच्या फायद्यावरचा अंदाजे वैयक्तिक कर हे वेगवेगळे उपाय आहेत; ही एकूण खर्चाची तुलना नाही.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"लाभ करपात्र उत्पन्न आहे, कर बिल नाही. कोणताही पूर्ण आयकर, नियोक्ता-खर्च, प्रतिपूर्ती किंवा वित्तपुरवठा गणना समाविष्ट नाही.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"या ब्राउझरमध्ये स्थानिक पातळीवर चालते; इनपुट आकडे सर्व्हरवर पाठवले जात नाहीत."},"ms":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Kalkulator Cukai Kereta Syarikat Norway","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Kalkulator Cukai Kereta Syarikat Norway 2026 — Anggaran Manfaat Bercukai","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Anggarkan faedah bercukai 2026 Norway untuk kegunaan persendirian kereta penumpang syarikat standard. Masukkan harga senarai, pengurangan kelayakan, bulan dan anggaran cukai marginal anda.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Anggarkan faedah gaji boleh cukai Norway daripada penggunaan persendirian kereta penumpang syarikat standard, kemudian anggarkan cukai peribadi dengan kadar marginal yang anda masukkan.","What does this estimate?":"Apakah anggaran ini?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Untuk peraturan standard 2026 Norway, faedahnya adalah berdasarkan senarai harga kereta sebagai baharu, bukan harga pembeliannya. Kalkulator menggunakan ambang dan kadar yang diterbitkan, sebarang umur yang layak atau pengurangan perbatuan kerja yang didokumenkan, dan bilangan bulan yang tersedia.","How the estimate works":"Cara anggaran berfungsi","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Manfaat standard 2026 ialah 30% daripada harga senarai yang dikurangkan sehingga NOK 370,300, serta 20% daripada sebarang lebihan. Asas harga senarai biasanya 100%; ia adalah 75% jika kereta itu berusia lebih daripada tiga tahun pada 1 Januari atau kerja yang didokumenkan memandu melebihi 40,000 km dan 56.25% apabila kedua-dua syarat dikenakan. Masukkan bulan penuh untuk separuh tahun. Anggaran cukai peribadi ialah faedah boleh cukai didarab dengan kadar marginal anda sendiri; ini bukan pengiraan cukai penuh.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Adakah faedah bercukai sama dengan cukai yang saya bayar?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"No. Manfaat ditambah kepada gaji boleh cukai di bawah peraturan standard. Anggaran cukai berasingan mendarabkannya dengan kadar marginal yang anda masukkan dan tidak mengira cukai penuh Norway anda.","Which car price should I enter?":"Harga kereta manakah yang harus saya masukkan?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Gunakan harga senarai sebagai baharu, termasuk peralatan yang dipasang di kilang dan yang dipasang oleh pengedar di bawah peraturan rasmi. Jangan gunakan nilai pasaran semasa atau harga yang anda bayar untuk kereta terpakai.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Bilakah saya boleh menggunakan pengurangan perbatuan?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Hanya apabila pemanduan kerja didokumenkan oleh log perbatuan yang layak dan melebihi 40,000 km pada tahun itu. Tepat 40,000 km tidak layak. Pemanduan peribadi bukanlah perbatuan kerja.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Adakah ini meliputi setiap kenderaan atau bekas kereta syarikat?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"No. Ia merangkumi peraturan kereta penumpang standard Norway sahaja. Kenderaan khas, kelas van 2, pengecualian dan pengecualian individu adalah di luar anggaran ini.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Adakah perbandingan kereta sendiri seperti-untuk-seperti?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"No. Ia meletakkan kos kereta sendiri tahunan anda yang dimasukkan bersebelahan dengan anggaran cukai peribadi ke atas manfaat kereta syarikat. Itu adalah langkah-langkah yang berbeza; ia tidak termasuk kos majikan, pembayaran balik, pembiayaan, bahan api, potongan cukai dan nilai penuh penggunaan persendirian.","Norway scope and data date":"skop Norway dan tarikh data","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Ini ialah anggaran perancangan khusus Norway menggunakan kadar kereta syarikat standard 2026 Skatteetaten, diperiksa 16 Oktober 2026. Peraturan tidak bergantung pada bahasa yang dipilih pada halaman ini. Ia bukan penyata cukai rasmi, pengiraan cukai penuh atau keputusan undang-undang. Kenderaan khas dan pengecualian dikecualikan. Kadar adalah statik dalam binaan ini dan tidak dimuatkan semula di latar belakang; semak Skatteetaten untuk tahun semasa sebelum bergantung padanya.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Pengiraan dijalankan dalam penyemak imbas ini. Angka yang anda masukkan tidak dimuat naik.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Anggaran faedah kereta syarikat","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"PERCUMA · DIJALANKAN DALAM PENYIARI SEMAK ANDA","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Peraturan standard 2026 Norway untuk kereta penumpang. Halaman ini tidak membuat kesimpulan negara cukai anda daripada bahasa anda.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Harga senarai kereta apabila baru, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Sepanjang bulan kereta itu tersedia, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"Kereta itu berusia lebih daripada 3 tahun pada 1 Januari","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Kerja pemanduan yang didokumenkan sepanjang tahun, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Saya mempunyai log perbatuan yang layak untuk kerja memandu","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Anggaran kadar cukai marginal anda, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Kos tahunan kereta anda sendiri, NOK (pilihan)","Calculate estimate":"Kira anggaran","Reset inputs":"Tetapkan semula input","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Masukkan senarai harga asal dan bulan yang tersedia.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Semak senarai harga, bulan, kilometer dan peratusan; masukkan nilai bukan negatif yang sah.\nAnggaran","2026 estimate":"2026","List price as new":"Senaraikan harga sebagai baharu","Taxable list-price base":"Asas harga senarai bercukai","Reduced list-price base":"Asas harga senarai dikurangkan","Average taxable benefit per month":"Purata faedah bercukai sebulan","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Manfaat bercukai untuk bulan masuk","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Manfaat bercukai selama setahun penuh","Marginal tax rate entered":"Kadar cukai marginal dimasukkan","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Anggaran cukai peribadi ke atas manfaat ini","Own-car annual cost entered":"Kos tahunan kereta sendiri dimasukkan","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Kos kereta sendiri tolak anggaran cukai peribadi kereta syarikat","Months included":"Termasuk bulan","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Melebihi 3 tahun pada 1 pengurangan Januari digunakan","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Pengurangan perbatuan kerja yang didokumenkan digunakan","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Pengurangan perbatuan memerlukan buku log dan lebih daripada 40,000 km kerja.","Tax year":"Tahun cukai","Official rate checked":"Kadar rasmi disemak","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 kadar kereta syarikat","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · penggunaan persendirian kereta syarikat","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Konteks sahaja: kos tahunan kereta sendiri dan anggaran cukai peribadi ke atas manfaat kereta syarikat ialah ukuran yang berbeza; ini bukan perbandingan kos keseluruhan.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Faedahnya ialah pendapatan boleh cukai, bukan bil cukai. Tiada cukai pendapatan penuh, kos majikan, pembayaran balik atau pengiraan pembiayaan disertakan.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Berjalan secara setempat dalam penyemak imbas ini; angka input tidak dihantar ke pelayan."},"nb":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Norge firmabilavgiftskalkulator","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Norge firmabilavgiftskalkulator 2026 — Skattepliktig fordelestimat","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Beregn Norges 2026 skattepliktige fordel for privat bruk av standard firmabil. Skriv inn listepris, kvalifiserende reduksjoner, måneder og marginalskattestimatet ditt.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Estimer norsk skattepliktig lønnsfordel ved privat bruk av standard firmabil, estimer deretter personskatt med en marginalsats du legger inn.","What does this estimate?":"Hva anslår dette?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"For Norges 2026 standardregler er fordelen basert på bilens listepris som ny, ikke kjøpesummen. Kalkulatoren bruker den publiserte terskelen og satsene, eventuell kvalifisert alder eller dokumentert reduksjon av arbeidslengde og antall tilgjengelige måneder.","How the estimate works":"Hvordan estimatet fungerer","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026-standardfordelen er 30 % av den reduserte listeprisen opp til NOK 370,300, pluss 20 % av eventuell egenandel. Listeprisgrunnlaget er normalt 100%; den er 75 % hvis bilen var mer enn tre år gammel på 1 januar eller dokumentert arbeidskjøring oversteg 40,000 km, og 56.25 % når begge forholdene gjelder. Angi hele måneder for et delår. Beregnet personskatt er den skattepliktige fordelen multiplisert med din egen marginalsats; dette er ikke en fullstendig skatteberegning.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Er den skattepliktige fordelen lik skatten jeg betaler?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Nr. Ytelsen legges til skattepliktig lønn etter standardreglene. Det separate skatteanslaget multipliserer det med marginalsatsen du legger inn og beregner ikke hele din norske skatt.","Which car price should I enter?":"Hvilken bilpris skal jeg angi?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Bruk listeprisen som ny, inkludert relevant fabrikkmontert og forhandlerinstallert utstyr under de offisielle reglene. Ikke bruk gjeldende markedsverdi eller prisen du betalte for en bruktbil.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Når kan jeg bruke kilometerreduksjonen?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Bare når arbeidskjøring er dokumentert av en kvalifisert kilometerlogg og overskrider 40,000 km i året. Akkurat 40,000 km kvalifiserer ikke. Personlig kjøring er ikke arbeidslengde.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Dekker dette alle kjøretøy eller firmabilkofferter?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Nr. Den dekker kun de vanlige norske personbilreglene. Spesialkjøretøyer, varebiler klasse 2, unntak og individuelle unntak ligger utenfor dette anslaget.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Er sammenligningen av egen bil lik?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Nr. Den plasserer din oppførte årlige egenbilkostnad ved siden av beregnet personavgift på en firmabilfordel. Det er forskjellige tiltak; det ekskluderer arbeidsgiverkostnader, refusjoner, finansiering, drivstoff, skattefradrag og den fulle verdien av privat bruk.","Norway scope and data date":"Norge omfang og datadato","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Dette er et Norgesspesifikt planleggingsestimat som bruker Skatteetatens 2026 standard firmabilpriser, kontrollert 16 oktober 2026. Reglene avhenger ikke av språket som er valgt på denne siden. Det er ikke en offisiell selvangivelse, full skatteberegning eller rettslig avgjørelse. Spesielle kjøretøy og unntak er ekskludert. Prisene er statiske i denne versjonen og oppdateres ikke i bakgrunnen; sjekk Skatteetaten for inneværende år før du stoler på dem.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Beregninger kjøres i denne nettleseren. Tallene du legger inn blir ikke lastet opp.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Beregn fordel for firmabil","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · KJØRER I NETTLESEREN DIN","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Norske 2026 standardregler for personbiler. Denne siden utleder ikke skattelandet ditt fra språket ditt.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Billistepris ny, kr","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Hele måneder var bilen tilgjengelig, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"Bilen var mer enn 3 år gammel på 1 januar","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Dokumentert arbeidskjøring i løpet av året, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Jeg har en kvalifisert kjørelengdelogg for arbeidskjøringen","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Din estimerte marginale skattesats, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Årskostnad for egen bil, kr (valgfritt)","Calculate estimate":"Beregn estimat","Reset inputs":"Tilbakestill innganger","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Skriv inn den opprinnelige listeprisen og månedene tilgjengelig.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Sjekk listepris, måneder, kilometer og prosentandel; angi gyldige ikke-negative verdier.","2026 estimate":"2026 estimat","List price as new":"Listepris som ny","Taxable list-price base":"Avgiftspliktig listeprisgrunnlag","Reduced list-price base":"Redusert listeprisgrunnlag","Average taxable benefit per month":"Gjennomsnittlig skattepliktig fordel per måned","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Skattepliktig fordel for angitte måneder","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Skattepliktig fordel i et helt år","Marginal tax rate entered":"Marginell avgiftssats angitt","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Beregnet personlig skatt på denne fordelen","Own-car annual cost entered":"Årskostnad for egen bil lagt inn","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Egen bilkostnad minus estimert personbilavgift","Months included":"Måneder inkludert","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Over 3 år gammel på 1 januarreduksjon brukt","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Dokumentert reduksjon av arbeidslengde er brukt","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Reduksjon av kilometerstand krever loggbok og mer enn 40,000 arbeidskm.","Tax year":"Skatteår","Official rate checked":"Offisiell kurs sjekket","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 firmabilpriser","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · privat bruk av firmabil","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Kun kontekst: årskostnad for egen bil og beregnet personavgift på en firmabilfordel er ulike tiltak; dette er ikke en totalkostnadssammenligning.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Fordelen er skattepliktig inntekt, ikke skatteregningen. Ingen full inntektsskatt, arbeidsgiverkostnad, refusjon eller finansieringsberegning er inkludert.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Kjøres lokalt i denne nettleseren; inndatatall sendes ikke til en server."},"nl":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Rekenmachine voor autobelastingen in Noorwegen","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Rekenmachine voor autobelasting in Noorwegen 2026 — Schatting van het belastbaar voordeel","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Schat het belastbare voordeel van Noorwegen 2026 voor privégebruik van een standaard personenauto van de zaak. Voer de catalogusprijs, in aanmerking komende kortingen, maanden en uw marginale belastingschatting in.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Schat het Noorse belastbare salarisvoordeel uit privégebruik van een standaard personenauto van de zaak, en schat vervolgens de personenbelasting met een marginaal tarief dat u invoert.","What does this estimate?":"Wat schat dit?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Volgens de Noorse 2026-standaardregels is het voordeel gebaseerd op de catalogusprijs van de auto als nieuw, niet op de aankoopprijs. De calculator past de gepubliceerde drempel en tarieven toe, elke in aanmerking komende leeftijd of gedocumenteerde verlaging van het aantal werkkilometers, en het aantal beschikbare maanden.","How the estimate works":"Hoe de schatting werkt","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Het 2026 standaardvoordeel bedraagt 30% van de verlaagde catalogusprijs tot NOK 370,300, plus 20% van het eventuele eigen risico. De catalogusprijsbasis is normaal gesproken 100%; het is 75% als de auto op 1 januari meer dan drie jaar oud was of als de gedocumenteerde werkritten meer dan 40,000 km bedroegen, en 56.25% als beide voorwaarden van toepassing zijn. Voor een deel van een jaar vult u hele maanden in. De geschatte personenbelasting is het belastbare voordeel vermenigvuldigd met uw eigen marginale tarief; dit is geen volledige belastingberekening.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Is het belastbare voordeel gelijk aan de belasting die ik betaal?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Nr. Volgens de standaardregels wordt de uitkering opgeteld bij het belastbaar loon. De afzonderlijke belastingschatting vermenigvuldigt deze met het marginale tarief dat u invoert en berekent niet uw volledige Noorse belasting.","Which car price should I enter?":"Welke autoprijs moet ik invoeren?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Gebruik de catalogusprijs als nieuw, inclusief relevante in de fabriek gemonteerde en door de dealer geïnstalleerde apparatuur volgens de officiële regels. Ga niet uit van de huidige marktwaarde of de prijs die u voor een gebruikte auto heeft betaald.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Wanneer kan ik gebruik maken van de kilometerkorting?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Alleen wanneer het werkverkeer is gedocumenteerd door een in aanmerking komend kilometerregistratiebestand en meer dan 40,000 km per jaar bedraagt. Precies 40,000 km komt niet in aanmerking. Persoonlijk rijden is geen werkkilometers.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Dekt dit elke voertuig- of bedrijfsautokoffer?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Nr. Het heeft uitsluitend betrekking op de standaard Noorse regels voor personenauto's. Bijzondere voertuigen, bestelwagens klasse 2, ontheffingen en individuele uitzonderingen vallen buiten deze schatting.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Is de vergelijking van eigen auto's vergelijkbaar?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Nr. Het plaatst uw ingevoerde jaarlijkse kosten voor een eigen auto naast de geschatte personenbelasting op een voordeel voor een bedrijfswagen. Dat zijn verschillende maatregelen; het is exclusief werkgeverskosten, vergoedingen, financiering, brandstof, belastingaftrek en de volledige waarde van privégebruik.","Norway scope and data date":"Reikwijdte en gegevensdatum Noorwegen","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Dit is een voor Noorwegen specifieke planningsschatting op basis van Skatteetaten's 2026 standaard bedrijfswagentarieven, gecontroleerd 16 oktober 2026. De regels zijn niet afhankelijk van de taal die op deze pagina is geselecteerd. Het is geen officiële belastingaangifte, volledige belastingberekening of juridische beslissing. Speciale voertuigen en uitzonderingen zijn uitgesloten. Tarieven zijn statisch in deze build en worden niet op de achtergrond vernieuwd; controleer Skatteetaten voor het lopende jaar voordat u erop vertrouwt.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Berekeningen worden in deze browser uitgevoerd. De cijfers die u invoert, worden niet geüpload.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Schatting bedrijfswagenvoordeel","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · DRAAIT IN UW BROWSER","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Noorse 2026 standaardregels voor personenauto's. Deze pagina leidt uw belastingland niet af uit uw taal.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Catalogusprijs auto als nieuw, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"De auto was de hele maand beschikbaar, 1 – 12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"De auto was meer dan 3 jaar oud op 1 januari","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Gedocumenteerd werk rijden gedurende het jaar, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Ik heb een kwalificerende kilometerregistratie voor het werkrijden","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Uw geschatte marginale belastingtarief, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Jaarlijkse kosten voor uw eigen auto, NOK (optioneel)","Calculate estimate":"Bereken schatting","Reset inputs":"Ingangen resetten","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Vul de originele catalogusprijs en de beschikbare maanden in.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Check de catalogusprijs, maanden, kilometers en percentage; voer geldige, niet-negatieve waarden in.","2026 estimate":"2026 schatting","List price as new":"Lijstprijs als nieuw","Taxable list-price base":"Belastbare catalogusprijsbasis","Reduced list-price base":"Verlaagde catalogusprijsbasis","Average taxable benefit per month":"Gemiddeld belastbaar voordeel per maand","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Belastbaar voordeel voor ingevoerde maanden","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Belastbaar voordeel voor een heel jaar","Marginal tax rate entered":"Marginaal belastingtarief ingevoerd","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Geschatte personenbelasting over dit voordeel","Own-car annual cost entered":"Jaarlijkse kosten eigen auto ingevoerd","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Kosten eigen auto minus geschatte personenbelasting bedrijfsauto","Months included":"Maanden inbegrepen","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Meer dan 3 jaar oud op 1 Januari-reductie toegepast","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Gedocumenteerde werkkilometerreductie toegepast","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Kilometerreductie vereist een logboek en meer dan 40,000 werkkm.","Tax year":"Belastingjaar","Official rate checked":"Officieel tarief gecontroleerd","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteeetaten · 2026 bedrijfswagentarieven","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteeetaten · privégebruik van een bedrijfsauto","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Alleen context: de jaarlijkse kosten van een eigen auto en de geschatte personenbelasting op het voordeel van een bedrijfswagen zijn verschillende maatstaven; dit is geen vergelijking van de totale kosten.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Het voordeel is het belastbaar inkomen, niet het belastingaanslag. Er is geen volledige loonbelasting-, werkgeverskosten-, vergoedings- of financieringsberekening opgenomen.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Wordt lokaal uitgevoerd in deze browser; invoercijfers worden niet naar een server verzonden."},"pl":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Kalkulator podatku samochodowego w Norwegii","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Norwegia Kalkulator podatku samochodowego 2026 — oszacowanie świadczenia podlegającego opodatkowaniu","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Oszacuj podlegającą opodatkowaniu kwotę 2026 w Norwegii z tytułu prywatnego użytkowania standardowego służbowego samochodu osobowego. Wprowadź cenę katalogową, kwalifikujące się obniżki, miesiące i szacunkową kwotę podatku krańcowego.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Oszacuj podlegające opodatkowaniu wynagrodzenie w Norwegii wynikające z prywatnego użytkowania standardowego samochodu służbowego, a następnie oszacuj podatek od osób fizycznych z wprowadzoną stawką krańcową.","What does this estimate?":"Jakie to szacunki?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"W przypadku norweskiej normy 2026 korzyść opiera się na cenie katalogowej samochodu jako nowego, a nie na cenie zakupu. Kalkulator uwzględnia opublikowane progi i stawki, kwalifikujący się wiek lub udokumentowaną redukcję przebiegu oraz liczbę dostępnych miesięcy.","How the estimate works":"Jak działa oszacowanie","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Standardowa korzyść 2026 to 30% obniżonej ceny katalogowej do NOK 370,300 plus 20% ewentualnej nadwyżki. Podstawowa cena katalogowa to zwykle 100%; jest to 75%, jeżeli samochód miał więcej niż trzy lata w dniu 1 stycznia lub udokumentowana jazda służbowa przekroczyła 40,000 km, oraz 56.25%, gdy spełnione są oba warunki. W przypadku części roku należy wprowadzić całe miesiące. Szacunkowy podatek od osób fizycznych to podlegająca opodatkowaniu korzyść pomnożona przez Twoją własną stawkę krańcową; nie jest to pełna kalkulacja podatku.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Czy podlegająca opodatkowaniu korzyść jest równa podatkowi, który płacę?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Nie. Świadczenie doliczane jest do wynagrodzenia podlegającego opodatkowaniu na zasadach standardowych. Oddzielny szacunek podatku mnoży go przez wprowadzoną stawkę krańcową i nie oblicza pełnego norweskiego podatku.","Which car price should I enter?":"Jaką cenę samochodu mam wpisać?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Używaj ceny katalogowej jako nowego, obejmującej odpowiedni sprzęt montowany fabrycznie i instalowany przez dealera zgodnie z oficjalnymi przepisami. Nie podawaj aktualnej wartości rynkowej ani ceny, jaką zapłaciłeś za używany samochód.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Kiedy mogę skorzystać z redukcji przebiegu?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Tylko wtedy, gdy jazda służbowa jest udokumentowana kwalifikującym przebiegiem i przekracza 40,000 km w ciągu roku. Dokładnie 40,000 km nie kwalifikuje się. Jazda prywatna nie jest przebiegiem służbowym.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Czy dotyczy to każdego pojazdu lub samochodu służbowego?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Nie. Obejmuje wyłącznie standardowe norweskie przepisy dotyczące samochodów osobowych. Pojazdy specjalne, samochody dostawcze klasy 2, zwolnienia i indywidualne wyjątki nie mieszczą się w tym szacunku.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Czy porównanie własnego samochodu jest porównywalne?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Nie. Umieszcza wprowadzony roczny koszt posiadania własnego samochodu obok szacunkowego podatku od osób fizycznych z tytułu świadczenia samochodu służbowego. To są różne środki; nie obejmuje kosztów pracodawcy, zwrotów kosztów, finansowania, paliwa, ulg podatkowych i pełnej wartości użytku prywatnego.","Norway scope and data date":"Zakres i data danych w Norwegii","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"To szacunkowy kosztorys dotyczący planowania przestrzennego dla Norwegii, oparty na standardowych stawkach za samochód służbowy 2026 firmy Skatteetaten, sprawdzonych w 16 w październiku 2026. Zasady nie zależą od języka wybranego na tej stronie. Nie jest to oficjalne zeznanie podatkowe, pełna kalkulacja podatku ani decyzja prawna. Pojazdy specjalne i wyjątki są wyłączone. W tej kompilacji stawki są statyczne i nie odświeżają się w tle; sprawdź Skatteetaten dla bieżącego roku, zanim na nich zaczniesz polegać.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Obliczenia uruchamiane są w tej przeglądarce. Wprowadzone liczby nie są przesyłane.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Oszacuj korzyści z samochodu służbowego","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"BEZPŁATNY · DZIAŁA W TWOJEJ PRZEGLĄDARCE","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Norweski standard 2026 dla samochodów osobowych. Ta strona nie określa kraju podatkowego na podstawie Twojego języka.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Cena katalogowa nowego samochodu, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Całe miesiące samochód był dostępny, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"W styczniu 1 samochód miał więcej niż 3 lat","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Udokumentowana jazda służbowa w ciągu roku, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Mam kwalifikujący się dziennik przebiegu do jazdy służbowej","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Twoja szacunkowa krańcowa stawka podatku,%","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Roczny koszt własnego samochodu, NOK (opcjonalnie)","Calculate estimate":"Oblicz oszacowanie","Reset inputs":"Zresetuj wejścia","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Wprowadź pierwotną cenę katalogową i dostępne miesiące.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Sprawdź cenę katalogową, miesiące, kilometry i procent; wprowadź prawidłowe wartości nieujemne.\nSzacunek","2026 estimate":"2026","List price as new":"Cena katalogowa jak nowa","Taxable list-price base":"Podstawowa cena katalogowa podlegająca opodatkowaniu","Reduced list-price base":"Obniżona cena podstawowa","Average taxable benefit per month":"Średnie miesięczne świadczenie podlegające opodatkowaniu","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Świadczenie podlegające opodatkowaniu za wprowadzone miesiące","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Świadczenie podlegające opodatkowaniu przez cały rok","Marginal tax rate entered":"Wprowadzono krańcową stawkę podatku","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Szacowany podatek osobisty od tego świadczenia","Own-car annual cost entered":"Wprowadzono roczny koszt własnego samochodu","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Koszt własnego samochodu minus szacunkowy podatek osobisty od samochodu służbowego","Months included":"Wliczone miesiące","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Powyżej 3 lat w dniu 1 Zastosowano styczniową obniżkę","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Zastosowano udokumentowaną redukcję przebiegu","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Zmniejszanie przebiegu wymaga dziennika pokładowego i ponad 40,000 km pracy.","Tax year":"Rok podatkowy","Official rate checked":"Sprawdzono oficjalny kurs","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 stawki za samochód służbowy","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · Prywatne korzystanie z samochodu służbowego","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Tylko kontekst: roczny koszt posiadania własnego samochodu i szacowany podatek osobisty od korzyści z tytułu korzystania z samochodu służbowego to różne miary; nie jest to porównanie całkowitych kosztów.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Korzyścią jest dochód podlegający opodatkowaniu, a nie kwota podatku. Nie uwzględniono pełnego obliczenia podatku dochodowego, kosztów pracodawcy, zwrotu kosztów ani finansowania.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Działa lokalnie w tej przeglądarce; dane wejściowe nie są wysyłane na serwer."},"pt":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Calculadora de imposto automóvel de empresa da Noruega","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Calculadora de imposto automóvel da empresa norueguesa 2026 - estimativa de benefício tributável","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Estimar o benefício tributável 2026 da Noruega para uso privado de um carro de passageiros padrão da empresa. Insira o preço de tabela, reduções qualificadas, meses e sua estimativa marginal de imposto.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Estime o benefício salarial tributável norueguês do uso privado de um carro de passageiros padrão da empresa e, em seguida, estime o imposto pessoal com uma taxa marginal inserida.","What does this estimate?":"O que isso estima?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Para as regras padrão 2026 da Noruega, o benefício é baseado no preço de tabela do carro como novo, e não no seu preço de compra. A calculadora aplica o limite e as taxas publicados, qualquer idade elegível ou redução documentada de quilometragem de trabalho e o número de meses disponíveis.","How the estimate works":"Como funciona a estimativa","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"O benefício padrão 2026 é 30% do preço de tabela reduzido até NOK 370,300, mais 20% de qualquer excesso. A base do preço de tabela normalmente é 100%; é 75% se o carro tinha mais de três anos em 1 janeiro ou a condução profissional documentada excedeu 40,000 km, e 56.25% quando ambas as condições se aplicam. Insira meses inteiros para um período parcial. O imposto pessoal estimado é o benefício tributável multiplicado pela sua própria taxa marginal; este não é um cálculo de imposto completo.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"O benefício tributável é igual ao imposto que pago?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Não. O benefício é adicionado ao salário tributável de acordo com as regras padrão. A estimativa de imposto separada multiplica-a pela taxa marginal inserida e não calcula o imposto norueguês completo.","Which car price should I enter?":"Qual preço de carro devo inserir?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Use o preço de tabela como novo, incluindo equipamentos relevantes instalados na fábrica e instalados pelo revendedor de acordo com as regras oficiais. Não use o valor atual de mercado ou o preço que você pagou por um carro usado.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Quando posso utilizar a redução de quilometragem?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Somente quando a condução profissional é documentada por um registro de quilometragem qualificado e excede 40,000 km no ano. Exatamente 40,000 km não se qualifica. Dirigir pessoalmente não é quilometragem de trabalho.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Isso cobre todos os veículos ou casos de carros da empresa?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Não. Abrange apenas as regras norueguesas padrão para automóveis de passageiros. Veículos especiais, vans classe 2, isenções e exceções individuais estão fora desta estimativa.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"A comparação entre carros próprios é igual?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Não. Ele coloca o custo anual do carro próprio inserido próximo ao imposto pessoal estimado sobre o benefício do carro da empresa. São medidas diferentes; exclui custos do empregador, reembolsos, financiamento, combustível, deduções fiscais e o valor total do uso privado.","Norway scope and data date":"Escopo da Noruega e data dos dados","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Esta é uma estimativa de planejamento específica para a Noruega, baseada nas taxas padrão de 2026 da Skatteetaten para carros da empresa, verificadas em 16 de outubro de 2026. As regras não dependem do idioma escolhido nesta página. Não é uma declaração de imposto oficial, um cálculo completo de impostos nem uma decisão jurídica. Veículos especiais e exceções não estão incluídos. As taxas são fixas nesta versão e não são atualizadas em segundo plano; consulte a Skatteetaten para confirmar o ano vigente antes de usar os valores.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Os cálculos são executados neste navegador. Os números inseridos não são carregados.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Estimativa do benefício do carro da empresa","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRÁTIS · FUNCIONA NO SEU NAVEGADOR","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Regras padrão norueguesas 2026 para automóveis de passageiros. Esta página não infere o país fiscal a partir do seu idioma.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Preço de tabela do carro quando novo, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Meses inteiros em que o carro esteve disponível, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"O carro tinha mais de 3 anos em 1 janeiro","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Trabalho documentado de condução durante o ano, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Tenho um registro de quilometragem qualificada para dirigir no trabalho","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Sua taxa de imposto marginal estimada, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Custo anual do seu próprio carro, NOK (opcional)","Calculate estimate":"Calcular estimativa","Reset inputs":"Redefinir entradas","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Insira o preço de tabela original e os meses disponíveis.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Consulte preço de tabela, meses, quilômetros e percentual; insira valores válidos não negativos.\nEstimativa","2026 estimate":"2026","List price as new":"Preço de tabela como novo","Taxable list-price base":"Base de preços de tabela tributável","Reduced list-price base":"Base de preços de tabela reduzida","Average taxable benefit per month":"Benefício tributável médio por mês","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Benefício tributável para meses inseridos","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Benefício tributável por um ano inteiro","Marginal tax rate entered":"Taxa marginal de imposto inserida","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Imposto pessoal estimado sobre este benefício","Own-car annual cost entered":"Custo anual do carro próprio inserido","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Custo do carro próprio menos imposto pessoal estimado sobre o carro da empresa","Months included":"Meses incluídos","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Mais de 3 anos em 1 Redução de janeiro aplicada","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Redução documentada de quilometragem aplicada","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"A redução de quilometragem requer um diário de bordo e mais de 40,000 km de trabalho.","Tax year":"Ano fiscal","Official rate checked":"Taxa oficial verificada","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 taxas de carro da empresa","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · uso privado de carro da empresa","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Apenas contexto: o custo anual do carro próprio e o imposto pessoal estimado sobre um benefício de carro da empresa são medidas diferentes; esta não é uma comparação de custo total.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"O benefício é o lucro tributável, não a conta fiscal. Não está incluído nenhum cálculo completo de imposto de renda, custo do empregador, reembolso ou financiamento.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Executa localmente neste navegador; os valores de entrada não são enviados para um servidor."},"ru":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Калькулятор налога на автомобиль для норвежских компаний","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Калькулятор налога на автомобиль для норвежских компаний 2026 — Оценка налогооблагаемой выгоды","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Оцените налогооблагаемую выгоду 2026 в Норвегии при использовании в личных целях стандартного служебного легкового автомобиля. Введите прейскурантную цену, соответствующие скидки, месяцы и оценку предельного налога.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Оцените норвежскую налогооблагаемую прибыль от заработной платы от частного использования стандартного служебного легкового автомобиля, а затем оцените личный налог с введенной вами предельной ставкой.","What does this estimate?":"Какова эта оценка?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"В соответствии со стандартными правилами Норвегии 2026 льгота основана на прейскурантной цене нового автомобиля, а не на его покупной цене. Калькулятор применяет опубликованные пороговые значения и ставки, любой приемлемый возраст или документально подтвержденное сокращение рабочего пробега, а также количество доступных месяцев.","How the estimate works":"Как работает оценка","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Стандартная выгода 2026 составляет 30% от сниженной прейскурантной цены до NOK 370,300 плюс 20% от любой надбавки. Базовая цена по прейскуранту обычно равна 100%; это 75%, если на момент 1 в январе возраст автомобиля превышал три года или документально подтвержденное рабочее вождение превысило 40,000 км, и 56.25%, когда применяются оба условия. Введите целые месяцы для неполного года. Расчетный личный налог — это налогооблагаемая выгода, умноженная на вашу собственную предельную ставку; это не полный расчет налога.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Соответствует ли налогооблагаемая выгода налогу, который я плачу?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Нет. Пособие прибавляется к налогооблагаемой заработной плате по стандартным правилам. При отдельной оценке налога она умножается на введенную вами предельную ставку и не рассчитывает полный норвежский налог.","Which car price should I enter?":"Какую цену автомобиля мне указать?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Используйте прейскурантную цену как новую, включая соответствующее оборудование, установленное на заводе или дилером в соответствии с официальными правилами. Не используйте текущую рыночную стоимость или цену, которую вы заплатили за подержанный автомобиль.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Когда я могу воспользоваться сокращением пробега?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Только если рабочее вождение подтверждено соответствующим журналом пробега и превышает 40,000 км в году. Ровно 40,000 км не подходит. Личное вождение – это не рабочий пробег.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Это относится ко всем автомобилям или автомобилям компании?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Нет. Он охватывает только стандартные норвежские правила для легковых автомобилей. Специальные транспортные средства, фургоны класса 2, льготы и отдельные исключения не входят в эту оценку.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Аналогично ли сравнение собственных автомобилей?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Нет. Введенная годовая стоимость собственного автомобиля помещается рядом с расчетным личным налогом на льготу по служебному автомобилю. Это разные меры; в него не включены затраты работодателя, возмещение расходов, финансирование, топливо, налоговые вычеты и полная стоимость частного использования.","Norway scope and data date":"Объем и дата данных для Норвегии","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Это расчет планирования для Норвегии с использованием стандартных тарифов на служебные автомобили Skatteetaten 2026, проверено 16, октябрь 2026. Правила не зависят от языка, выбранного на этой странице. Это не официальная налоговая декларация, полный налоговый расчет или юридическое решение. Специальные транспортные средства и исключения исключены. В этой сборке ставки являются статическими и не обновляются в фоновом режиме; проверьте Skatteetaten на текущий год, прежде чем полагаться на них.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Расчеты выполняются в этом браузере. Введенные вами цифры не загружаются.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Оценить выгоду от служебного автомобиля","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕСПЛАТНО · ЗАПУСКАЕТСЯ В ВАШЕМ БРАУЗЕРЕ","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Норвежские стандартные правила 2026 для легковых автомобилей. Эта страница не определяет вашу налоговую страну на основе вашего языка.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Цена нового автомобиля, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Целые месяцы машина была в наличии, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"В январе 1 машине было больше 3 лет.","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Документированный трудовой стаж вождения в течение года, км","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"У меня есть квалификационный журнал пробега для рабочего вождения","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Оценочная предельная ставка налога, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Годовая стоимость собственного автомобиля, норвежские крон (необязательно)","Calculate estimate":"Рассчитать смету","Reset inputs":"Сбросить входы","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Введите первоначальную прейскурантную цену и доступные месяцы.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Проверьте прейскурантную цену, месяцы, километры и проценты; введите действительные неотрицательные значения.","2026 estimate":"2026 оценка","List price as new":"Прейскурантная цена за новый","Taxable list-price base":"Налогооблагаемая база прейскурантной цены","Reduced list-price base":"Снижена базовая цена по прейскуранту","Average taxable benefit per month":"Средняя налогооблагаемая выгода в месяц","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Налогооблагаемая выгода за введенные месяцы","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Налогооблагаемая выгода за полный год","Marginal tax rate entered":"Введена предельная ставка налога","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Расчетный индивидуальный налог на эту льготу","Own-car annual cost entered":"Введена годовая стоимость собственного автомобиля","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Стоимость собственного автомобиля за вычетом расчетного налога на личный автомобиль компании","Months included":"Месяцы включены","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Старше 3 лет на 1 применено январское снижение","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Применено документально подтвержденное сокращение рабочего пробега.","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Для сокращения пробега требуется бортовой журнал и пробег более 40,000.","Tax year":"Налоговый год","Official rate checked":"Официальный тариф проверен","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 тарифы на служебные автомобили","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · частное пользование служебным автомобилем","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Только контекст: годовая стоимость собственного автомобиля и расчетный личный налог на льготу по служебному автомобилю — это разные меры; это не сравнение общей стоимости.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Получается налогооблагаемый доход, а не налоговый счет. Полный подоходный налог, расходы работодателя, возмещение или расчет финансирования не включены.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Запускается локально в этом браузере; входные данные не отправляются на сервер."},"sv":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Norge företagsbilskatteberäknare","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Norge företagsbilskattekalkylator 2026 — Uppskattning av skattepliktig förmån","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Uppskatta Norges 2026 skattepliktiga förmån för privat användning av en vanlig företagspersonbil. Ange listpris, kvalificerade rabatter, månader och din uppskattning av marginalskatt.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Uppskatta den norska skattepliktiga löneförmånen från privat användning av en vanlig företagspersonbil, beräkna sedan personskatten med en marginalsats du anger.","What does this estimate?":"Vad uppskattar detta?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"För Norges 2026 standardregler baseras förmånen på bilens listpris som ny, inte dess inköpspris. Kalkylatorn tillämpar den publicerade tröskeln och satserna, eventuell åldersgräns eller dokumenterad minskning av arbetsmil och antalet tillgängliga månader.","How the estimate works":"Hur uppskattningen fungerar","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026 standardförmån är 30 % av det reducerade listpriset upp till NOK 370,300, plus 20 % av eventuell självrisk. Listprisbasen är normalt 100%; det är 75% om bilen var mer än tre år gammal den 1 januari eller dokumenterad arbetskörning översteg 40,000 km, och 56.25% när båda villkoren gäller. Ange hela månader för ett delår. Beräknad personskatt är den skattepliktiga förmånen multiplicerad med din egen marginalsats; detta är inte en fullständig skatteberäkning.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Är den skattepliktiga förmånen lika med den skatt jag betalar?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Nr. Förmånen läggs till skattepliktig lön enligt standardreglerna. Den separata skatteuppskattningen multiplicerar den med den marginalsats du anger och beräknar inte din fulla norska skatt.","Which car price should I enter?":"Vilket bilpris ska jag ange?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Använd listpriset som nytt, inklusive relevant fabriksmonterad och återförsäljarinstallerad utrustning enligt de officiella reglerna. Använd inte det aktuella marknadsvärdet eller priset du betalade för en begagnad bil.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"När kan jag använda kilometerminskningen?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Endast när arbetskörning dokumenteras av en kvalificerad kördagbok och överstiger 40,000 km under året. Exakt 40,000 km kvalificerar inte. Personlig körning är inte arbetsmil.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Täcker detta varje fordon eller tjänstebilsväska?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Nr. Den täcker endast de vanliga norska personbilsreglerna. Specialfordon, skåpbilar klass 2, undantag och individuella undantag ligger utanför denna uppskattning.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Är jämförelsen av egen bil likvärdig?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Nr. Den placerar din angivna årliga egenbilskostnad bredvid beräknad personskatt på en tjänstebilsförmån. Det är olika mått; det exkluderar arbetsgivarkostnader, ersättningar, finansiering, bränsle, skatteavdrag och det fulla värdet av privat användning.","Norway scope and data date":"Norge omfattning och datadatum","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Detta är en Norge-specifik planeringsuppskattning som använder Skatteetatens 2026 standardpriser för tjänstebilar, kontrollerade 16 oktober 2026. Reglerna beror inte på vilket språk som valts på den här sidan. Det är inte en officiell skattedeklaration, fullständig skatteberäkning eller juridiskt beslut. Specialfordon och undantag är undantagna. Priserna är statiska i den här versionen och uppdateras inte i bakgrunden; kontrollera Skatteetaten för innevarande år innan du förlitar dig på dem.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Beräkningar körs i den här webbläsaren. Siffrorna du anger laddas inte upp.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Uppskatta förmånen för tjänstebil","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · KÖR I DIN BLÄDDARE","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Norska 2026 standardregler för personbilar. Den här sidan härleder inte ditt skatteland från ditt språk.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Bil listpris i nyskick, kr","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Hele månader var bilen tillgänglig, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"Bilen var mer än 3 år gammal den 1 januari","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Dokumenterad arbetskörning under året, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Jag har en kvalificerad kördagbok för arbetskörningen","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Din beräknade marginalskattesats, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Din egen bil årskostnad, NOK (valfritt)","Calculate estimate":"Beräkna uppskattning","Reset inputs":"Återställ ingångar","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Ange det ursprungliga listpriset och tillgängliga månader.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Kontrollera listpris, månader, kilometer och procentandel; ange giltiga icke-negativa värden.","2026 estimate":"2026 uppskattning","List price as new":"Listpris som ny","Taxable list-price base":"Skattepliktig listprisbas","Reduced list-price base":"Reducerad listprisbas","Average taxable benefit per month":"Genomsnittlig skattepliktig förmån per månad","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Skattepliktig förmån för angivna månader","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Skattepliktig förmån för ett helt år","Marginal tax rate entered":"Marginell skattesats har angetts","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Uppskattad personlig skatt på denna förmån","Own-car annual cost entered":"Angiven årskostnad för egen bil","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Egen bilkostnad minus beräknad tjänstebils personskatt","Months included":"Månader ingår","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Över 3 år gammal på 1 januarireduktion tillämpas","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Dokumenterad minskning av arbete och körsträcka tillämpas","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Reduktion av körsträcka kräver en loggbok och mer än 40,000 arbetskm.","Tax year":"Taxeringsår","Official rate checked":"Officiell kurs kontrollerad","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 tjänstebilspriser","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · privat användning av tjänstebil","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Endast sammanhang: årskostnad för egen bil och beräknad personskatt på förmån för tjänstebil är olika mått; detta är inte en jämförelse av totala kostnader.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Förmånen är skattepliktig inkomst, inte skattesedeln. Ingen full inkomstskatt, arbetsgivarkostnad, ersättning eller finansieringsberäkning ingår.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Körs lokalt i den här webbläsaren; indata skickas inte till en server."},"sw":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Kikokotoo cha Ushuru wa Magari cha Kampuni ya Norwe","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Kikokotoo cha Ushuru wa Magari cha Kampuni ya Norwe 2026 — Makadirio ya Manufaa Yanayopaswa Kutozwa Ushuru","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Kadiria manufaa yanayotozwa ushuru ya 2026 ya Norwe kwa matumizi ya kibinafsi ya gari la kawaida la abiria la kampuni. Weka bei ya orodha, punguzo zinazostahiki, miezi na makadirio ya kodi yako ya chini kabisa.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Kadiria manufaa ya mshahara unaotozwa ushuru wa Norwe kutokana na matumizi ya kibinafsi ya gari la kawaida la abiria la kampuni, kisha ukadiria kodi ya kibinafsi kwa kiwango kidogo unachoingiza.","What does this estimate?":"Hii inakadiria nini?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Kwa sheria za kawaida za 2026 za Norwe, manufaa yanatokana na orodha ya bei ya gari kama mpya, wala si bei yake ya ununuzi. Kikokotoo kinatumia viwango na viwango vilivyochapishwa, umri wowote unaostahiki au upunguzaji wa umbali wa kazi uliothibitishwa na idadi ya miezi inayopatikana.","How the estimate works":"Jinsi makadirio yanavyofanya kazi","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Manufaa ya kawaida ya 2026 ni 30% ya bei iliyopunguzwa hadi NOK 370,300, pamoja na 20% ya ziada yoyote. Msingi wa bei ya orodha ni kawaida 100%; ni 75% ikiwa gari lilikuwa na umri wa zaidi ya miaka mitatu kwenye 1 Januari au uendeshaji wa kazi iliyorekodiwa ulizidi kilomita 40,000, na 56.25% masharti yote mawili yanapotumika. Ingiza miezi nzima kwa mwaka wa sehemu. Kadirio la ushuru wa kibinafsi ni faida inayoweza kutozwa ushuru inayozidishwa na kiwango chako cha ukingo; hii sio hesabu kamili ya ushuru.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Je, faida inayotozwa ushuru ni sawa na kodi ninayolipa?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Na. Faida huongezwa kwa mshahara unaotozwa ushuru chini ya sheria za kawaida. Makadirio tofauti ya ushuru huizidisha kwa kiwango cha ukingo unachoweka na haihesabiwi kodi yako kamili ya Norwe.","Which car price should I enter?":"Niweke bei gani ya gari?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Tumia bei ya orodha kama mpya, ikijumuisha vifaa vinavyofaa vilivyowekwa kiwandani na vilivyosakinishwa kwa muuzaji chini ya sheria rasmi. Usitumie bei ya sasa ya soko au bei uliyolipa kwa gari lililotumika.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Ni lini ninaweza kutumia upunguzaji wa maili?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Ni wakati tu kuendesha gari kazini kunathibitishwa na kumbukumbu ya mileage inayostahiki na inazidi kilomita 40,000 kwa mwaka. Kilomita za 40,000 haswa hazifai. Uendeshaji wa kibinafsi sio umbali wa kazi.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Je, hii inashughulikia kila gari au sanduku la gari la kampuni?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Na. Inashughulikia sheria za kawaida za gari la abiria la Norway pekee. Magari maalum, vani za daraja la 2, misamaha na vighairi vya watu binafsi viko nje ya makadirio haya.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Je, ulinganisho wa gari-mwenyewe ni kama-kwa-kama?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Na. Inaweka gharama yako ya kila mwaka ya gari lako mwenyewe karibu na makadirio ya kodi ya kibinafsi kwa faida ya gari la kampuni. Hizo ni hatua tofauti; haijumuishi gharama za mwajiri, malipo, ufadhili, mafuta, makato ya ushuru na thamani kamili ya matumizi ya kibinafsi.","Norway scope and data date":"Norwei upeo na tarehe ya data","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Haya ni makadirio ya kupanga mahususi ya Norwe kwa kutumia viwango vya kawaida vya gari vya kampuni ya Skatteetaten 2026, vilivyoangaliwa 16 Oktoba 2026. Sheria hazitegemei lugha iliyochaguliwa kwenye ukurasa huu. Sio marejesho rasmi ya ushuru, hesabu kamili ya ushuru au uamuzi wa kisheria. Magari maalum na tofauti hazijumuishwa. Viwango ni tuli katika muundo huu na havionyeshi upya chinichini; angalia Skatteetaten kwa mwaka huu kabla ya kuwategemea.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Mahesabu huendeshwa katika kivinjari hiki. Takwimu unazoingiza hazijapakiwa.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Kadiria faida ya gari la kampuni","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"BILA MALIPO · INAENDELEA KATIKA KIvinjari CHAKO","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Sheria za kawaida za 2026 za Norway kwa magari ya abiria. Ukurasa huu hauashirii nchi yako ya kodi kutoka kwa lugha yako.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Orodha ya bei ya gari ikiwa mpya, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Miezi yote gari lilipatikana, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"Gari lilikuwa na umri wa zaidi ya miaka 3 mnamo 1 Januari","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Kuendesha gari kwa kumbukumbu katika mwaka, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Nina kumbukumbu ya mileage inayostahiki kwa uendeshaji wa kazi","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Kadirio lako la kiwango cha chini cha kodi, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Gharama yako ya kila mwaka ya gari, NOK (si lazima)","Calculate estimate":"Kokotoa makadirio","Reset inputs":"Weka upya pembejeo","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Weka bei halisi ya orodha na miezi inayopatikana.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Angalia bei ya orodha, miezi, kilomita na asilimia; weka thamani halali zisizo hasi.","2026 estimate":"2026 makadirio","List price as new":"Orodhesha bei kama mpya","Taxable list-price base":"Orodha ya bei ya msingi inayoweza kutozwa ushuru","Reduced list-price base":"Orodha ya msingi iliyopunguzwa","Average taxable benefit per month":"Wastani wa manufaa yanayotozwa ushuru kwa mwezi","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Manufaa yanayotozwa ushuru kwa miezi iliyowekwa","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Manufaa ya kutozwa ushuru kwa mwaka mzima","Marginal tax rate entered":"Kiwango cha chini cha ushuru kimeingizwa","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Kadirio la kodi ya kibinafsi kwa manufaa haya","Own-car annual cost entered":"Gharama ya kila mwaka ya gari yenyewe imeingizwa","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Gharama ya gari mwenyewe ukiondoa makadirio ya kodi ya kibinafsi ya gari la kampuni","Months included":"Miezi imejumuishwa","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Zaidi ya miaka 3 kwenye 1 upunguzaji wa Januari umetumika","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Kupunguza kwa kumbukumbu kwa umbali wa kazi kumetumika","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Kupunguza maili kunahitaji kitabu cha kumbukumbu na zaidi ya kilomita za kazi za 40,000.","Tax year":"Mwaka wa Kodi","Official rate checked":"Kiwango rasmi kimeangaliwa","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 viwango vya gari la kampuni","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · matumizi ya kibinafsi ya gari la kampuni","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Muktadha pekee: gharama ya kila mwaka ya gari lako mwenyewe na makadirio ya ushuru wa kibinafsi kwa faida ya gari la kampuni ni hatua tofauti; huu sio ulinganisho wa jumla wa gharama.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Manufaa ni mapato yanayotozwa kodi, si bili ya kodi. Hakuna hesabu kamili ya kodi ya mapato, gharama ya mwajiri, marejesho au ufadhili.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Hufanya kazi ndani ya kivinjari hiki; takwimu za pembejeo hazitumwa kwa seva."},"ta":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"நோர்வே நிறுவனத்தின் கார் வரி கால்குலேட்டர்","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"நோர்வே நிறுவனத்தின் கார் வரி கால்குலேட்டர் 2026 — வரி விதிக்கக்கூடிய நன்மை மதிப்பீடு","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"நிலையான நிறுவன பயணிகள் காரின் தனிப்பட்ட பயன்பாட்டிற்கான நார்வேயின் 2026 வரிவிதிப்பு நன்மையை மதிப்பிடுங்கள். பட்டியல் விலை, தகுதிக் குறைப்புகள், மாதங்கள் மற்றும் உங்களின் விளிம்பு வரி மதிப்பீடு ஆகியவற்றை உள்ளிடவும்.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"ஒரு நிலையான நிறுவனத்தின் பயணிகள் காரின் தனிப்பட்ட பயன்பாட்டிலிருந்து நார்வேஜியன் வரி விதிக்கக்கூடிய சம்பளப் பலனை மதிப்பிடவும், பின்னர் நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் சிறிய விகிதத்துடன் தனிப்பட்ட வரியை மதிப்பிடவும்.","What does this estimate?":"இந்த மதிப்பீடு என்ன?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"நோர்வேயின் 2026 நிலையான விதிகளுக்கு, நன்மையானது காரின் பட்டியல் விலையை அடிப்படையாகக் கொண்டது, அதன் கொள்முதல் விலை அல்ல. கால்குலேட்டர் வெளியிடப்பட்ட வரம்பு மற்றும் கட்டணங்கள், ஏதேனும் தகுதியான வயது அல்லது ஆவணப்படுத்தப்பட்ட வேலை-மைலேஜ் குறைப்பு மற்றும் கிடைக்கும் மாதங்களின் எண்ணிக்கை ஆகியவற்றைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது.","How the estimate works":"மதிப்பீடு எவ்வாறு செயல்படுகிறது","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026 நிலையான பலன் NOK 370,300 வரையிலான குறைக்கப்பட்ட பட்டியல் விலையில் 30% ஆகும், மேலும் 20% அதிகமாகும். பட்டியல்-விலை அடிப்படை பொதுவாக 100% ஆகும்; 1 ஜனவரியில் கார் மூன்று வருடங்களுக்கு மேல் பழமையானது அல்லது 40,000 கிமீக்கு மேல் ஆவணப்படுத்தப்பட்ட வேலை ஓட்டுதல் மற்றும் இரண்டு நிபந்தனைகளும் பொருந்தும் போது 56.25% அது 75% ஆகும். ஒரு பகுதி ஆண்டுக்கான முழு மாதங்களையும் உள்ளிடவும். மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட தனிநபர் வரி என்பது உங்கள் சொந்த விளிம்பு விகிதத்தால் பெருக்கப்படும் வரிக்குரிய பலன் ஆகும்; இது முழு வரி கணக்கீடு அல்ல.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"நான் செலுத்தும் வரிக்கு சமமான வரிக்கு உட்பட்ட பலன் உள்ளதா?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"எண். நிலையான விதிகளின் கீழ் வரிக்கு உட்பட்ட சம்பளத்துடன் நன்மை சேர்க்கப்படுகிறது. தனி வரி மதிப்பீடு அதை நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் விளிம்பு விகிதத்தால் பெருக்குகிறது மற்றும் உங்களின் முழு நோர்வே வரியைக் கணக்கிடாது.","Which car price should I enter?":"நான் எந்த கார் விலையை உள்ளிட வேண்டும்?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"அதிகாரப்பூர்வ விதிகளின் கீழ் தொடர்புடைய தொழிற்சாலை பொருத்தப்பட்ட மற்றும் டீலர் நிறுவிய உபகரணங்கள் உட்பட பட்டியல் விலையை புதியதாகப் பயன்படுத்தவும். தற்போதைய சந்தை மதிப்பையோ பயன்படுத்திய காருக்கு நீங்கள் செலுத்திய விலையையோ பயன்படுத்த வேண்டாம்.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"மைலேஜ் குறைப்பை நான் எப்போது பயன்படுத்தலாம்?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"தகுதியான மைலேஜ் பதிவின் மூலம் வேலை ஓட்டுதல் ஆவணப்படுத்தப்பட்டு, வருடத்தில் 40,000 கிமீக்கு மேல் இருந்தால் மட்டுமே. சரியாக 40,000 கிமீ தகுதி பெறவில்லை. தனிப்பட்ட ஓட்டுதல் வேலை மைலேஜ் அல்ல.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"இது ஒவ்வொரு வாகனம் அல்லது நிறுவன-கார் வழக்கையும் உள்ளடக்குமா?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"எண். இது நிலையான நோர்வே பயணிகள்-கார் விதிகளை மட்டுமே உள்ளடக்கியது. சிறப்பு வாகனங்கள், வேன்கள் வகுப்பு 2, விதிவிலக்குகள் மற்றும் தனிப்பட்ட விதிவிலக்குகள் இந்த மதிப்பீட்டிற்கு வெளியே உள்ளன.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"சொந்த கார் ஒப்பீடு போன்றது போன்றதா?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"எண். இது உங்கள் வருடாந்திர சொந்த கார் செலவை நிறுவனம்-கார் நன்மையில் மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட தனிப்பட்ட வரிக்கு அடுத்ததாக வைக்கிறது. அவை வெவ்வேறு நடவடிக்கைகள்; இது முதலாளியின் செலவுகள், திருப்பிச் செலுத்துதல், நிதியுதவி, எரிபொருள், வரி விலக்குகள் மற்றும் தனிப்பட்ட பயன்பாட்டின் முழு மதிப்பையும் விலக்குகிறது.","Norway scope and data date":"நோர்வே நோக்கம் மற்றும் தரவு தேதி","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"இது Skatteeten's 2026 நிலையான நிறுவன-கார் கட்டணங்களைப் பயன்படுத்தி, 16 அக்டோபர் 2026 ஐப் பயன்படுத்தி நார்வே-குறிப்பிட்ட திட்டமிடல் மதிப்பீடு ஆகும். விதிகள் இந்தப் பக்கத்தில் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட மொழியைப் பொறுத்தது அல்ல. இது உத்தியோகபூர்வ வரி அறிக்கை, முழு வரி கணக்கீடு அல்லது சட்ட முடிவு அல்ல. சிறப்பு வாகனங்கள் மற்றும் விதிவிலக்குகள் விலக்கப்பட்டுள்ளன. இந்தக் கட்டமைப்பில் விகிதங்கள் நிலையானவை மற்றும் பின்னணியில் புதுப்பிக்கப்படாது; அவற்றை நம்புவதற்கு முன் நடப்பு ஆண்டிற்கான Skatteetaten ஐ சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"இந்த உலாவியில் கணக்கீடுகள் இயங்கும். நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் புள்ளிவிவரங்கள் பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை.","Estimate company-car benefit":"கம்பனி-கார் பலனை மதிப்பிடவும்","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"இலவசம் · உங்கள் உலாவியில் இயங்குகிறது","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"நார்வேஜியன் 2026 பயணிகள் கார்களுக்கான நிலையான விதிகள். இந்தப் பக்கம் உங்கள் மொழியிலிருந்து உங்கள் வரி நாட்டைக் கண்டறியவில்லை.","Car list price when new, NOK":"கார் பட்டியல் விலை புதியதாக இருக்கும் போது, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"மொத்த மாதங்கள் கார் கிடைத்தது, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"1 ஜனவரியில் கார் 3 ஆண்டுகளுக்கு மேல் பழமையானது","Documented work driving during the year, km":"ஆண்டில் வாகனம் ஓட்டுவதற்கான ஆவணப்படுத்தப்பட்ட வேலை, கி.மீ","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"வேலை ஓட்டுவதற்கான தகுதியான மைலேஜ் பதிவு என்னிடம் உள்ளது","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"உங்கள் மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட விளிம்பு வரி விகிதம், %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"உங்கள் சொந்த கார் ஆண்டு செலவு, NOK (விரும்பினால்)","Calculate estimate":"மதிப்பீட்டைக் கணக்கிடுங்கள்","Reset inputs":"உள்ளீடுகளை மீட்டமைக்கவும்","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"அசல் பட்டியல் விலை மற்றும் கிடைக்கும் மாதங்களை உள்ளிடவும்.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"பட்டியல் விலை, மாதங்கள், கிலோமீட்டர்கள் மற்றும் சதவீதத்தை சரிபார்க்கவும்; செல்லுபடியாகும் எதிர்மறை அல்லாத மதிப்புகளை உள்ளிடவும்.","2026 estimate":"2026 மதிப்பீடு","List price as new":"பட்டியல் விலை புதியது","Taxable list-price base":"வரி விதிக்கக்கூடிய பட்டியல்-விலை அடிப்படை","Reduced list-price base":"குறைக்கப்பட்ட பட்டியல்-விலை அடிப்படை","Average taxable benefit per month":"மாதத்திற்கு சராசரி வரி விதிக்கக்கூடிய பலன்","Taxable benefit for entered months":"உள்ளீடு செய்யப்பட்ட மாதங்களுக்கு வரி விதிக்கக்கூடிய நன்மை","Taxable benefit for a full year":"முழு ஆண்டுக்கான வரிவிதிப்பு நன்மை","Marginal tax rate entered":"மார்ஜினல் வரி விகிதம் உள்ளிடப்பட்டது","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"இந்த நன்மைக்கான மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட தனிநபர் வரி","Own-car annual cost entered":"சொந்த கார் ஆண்டு செலவு உள்ளிடப்பட்டது","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"சொந்தக் கார் செலவைக் கழித்து மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட நிறுவனம்-கார் தனிநபர் வரி","Months included":"மாதங்கள் சேர்க்கப்பட்டுள்ளன","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"3 ஆண்டுகளுக்கும் மேலான 1 ஜனவரியில் குறைக்கப்பட்டது","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"ஆவணப்படுத்தப்பட்ட வேலை-மைலேஜ் குறைப்பு பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டது","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"மைலேஜ் குறைப்புக்கு பதிவு புத்தகம் மற்றும் 40,000 வேலை கிமீக்கு மேல் தேவை.","Tax year":"வரி ஆண்டு","Official rate checked":"அதிகாரப்பூர்வ கட்டணம் சரிபார்க்கப்பட்டது","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 நிறுவனம்-கார் விலைகள்","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · ஒரு நிறுவன காரின் தனிப்பட்ட பயன்பாடு","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"சூழல் மட்டும்: சொந்தக் காரின் வருடாந்திர செலவு மற்றும் நிறுவனம்-கார் நன்மையின் மீதான மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட தனிநபர் வரி ஆகியவை வெவ்வேறு நடவடிக்கைகள்; இது மொத்த செலவு ஒப்பீடு அல்ல.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"பயன் என்பது வரிக்கு உட்பட்ட வருமானம், வரி மசோதா அல்ல. முழு வருமான வரி, முதலாளி-செலவு, திருப்பிச் செலுத்துதல் அல்லது நிதிக் கணக்கீடு ஆகியவை சேர்க்கப்படவில்லை.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"இந்த உலாவியில் உள்ளூரில் இயங்கும்; உள்ளீட்டு புள்ளிவிவரங்கள் சேவையகத்திற்கு அனுப்பப்படவில்லை."},"te":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"నార్వే కంపెనీ కార్ ట్యాక్స్ కాలిక్యులేటర్","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"నార్వే కంపెనీ కార్ ట్యాక్స్ కాలిక్యులేటర్ 2026 — పన్ను విధించదగిన బెనిఫిట్ అంచనా","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"స్టాండర్డ్ కంపెనీ ప్యాసింజర్ కారు యొక్క ప్రైవేట్ ఉపయోగం కోసం నార్వే యొక్క 2026 పన్ను విధించదగిన ప్రయోజనాన్ని అంచనా వేయండి. జాబితా ధర, అర్హత తగ్గింపులు, నెలలు మరియు మీ ఉపాంత పన్ను అంచనాను నమోదు చేయండి.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"ప్రామాణిక కంపెనీ ప్యాసింజర్ కారు యొక్క ప్రైవేట్ ఉపయోగం నుండి నార్వేజియన్ పన్ను విధించదగిన జీతం ప్రయోజనాన్ని అంచనా వేయండి, ఆపై మీరు నమోదు చేసే ఉపాంత రేటుతో వ్యక్తిగత పన్నును అంచనా వేయండి.","What does this estimate?":"ఇది ఏమి అంచనా వేస్తుంది?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"నార్వే యొక్క 2026 ప్రామాణిక నియమాల కోసం, ప్రయోజనం కారు జాబితా ధరపై ఆధారపడి ఉంటుంది, దాని కొనుగోలు ధర కాదు. కాలిక్యులేటర్ ప్రచురించిన థ్రెషోల్డ్ మరియు రేట్లు, ఏదైనా అర్హత గల వయస్సు లేదా డాక్యుమెంట్ చేయబడిన పని-మైలేజ్ తగ్గింపు మరియు అందుబాటులో ఉన్న నెలల సంఖ్యను వర్తింపజేస్తుంది.","How the estimate works":"అంచనా ఎలా పని చేస్తుంది","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026 ప్రామాణిక ప్రయోజనం NOK 370,300 వరకు తగ్గిన జాబితా ధరలో 30%, అదనంగా ఏదైనా అదనపు 20%. జాబితా-ధర బేస్ సాధారణంగా 100%; 1 జనవరిలో కారు మూడు సంవత్సరాల కంటే ఎక్కువ పాతబడి ఉంటే లేదా 40,000 కిమీని మించి డాక్యుమెంట్ చేయబడిన వర్క్ డ్రైవింగ్ ఉంటే అది 75% మరియు రెండు షరతులు వర్తించినప్పుడు 56.25%. పార్ట్-ఇయర్ కోసం మొత్తం నెలలను నమోదు చేయండి. అంచనా వేయబడిన వ్యక్తిగత పన్ను అనేది మీ స్వంత ఉపాంత రేటుతో గుణించబడిన పన్ను విధించదగిన ప్రయోజనం; ఇది పూర్తి పన్ను గణన కాదు.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"పన్ను విధించదగిన ప్రయోజనం నేను చెల్లించే పన్నుకు సమానమా?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"నం. ప్రామాణిక నిబంధనల ప్రకారం పన్ను చెల్లించదగిన జీతంకి ప్రయోజనం జోడించబడుతుంది. ప్రత్యేక పన్ను అంచనా దానిని మీరు నమోదు చేసే ఉపాంత రేటుతో గుణిస్తుంది మరియు మీ పూర్తి నార్వేజియన్ పన్నును లెక్కించదు.","Which car price should I enter?":"నేను ఏ కారు ధరను నమోదు చేయాలి?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"అధికారిక నిబంధనల ప్రకారం సంబంధిత ఫ్యాక్టరీ-బిగించిన మరియు డీలర్-ఇన్‌స్టాల్ చేసిన పరికరాలతో సహా జాబితా ధరను కొత్తదిగా ఉపయోగించండి. ప్రస్తుత మార్కెట్ విలువను లేదా మీరు ఉపయోగించిన కారు కోసం చెల్లించిన ధరను ఉపయోగించవద్దు.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"నేను మైలేజ్ తగ్గింపును ఎప్పుడు ఉపయోగించగలను?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"అర్హత మైలేజ్ లాగ్ ద్వారా వర్క్ డ్రైవింగ్ డాక్యుమెంట్ చేయబడినప్పుడు మరియు సంవత్సరంలో 40,000 కిమీ కంటే ఎక్కువగా ఉన్నప్పుడు మాత్రమే. సరిగ్గా 40,000 కిమీ అర్హత లేదు. వ్యక్తిగత డ్రైవింగ్ పని మైలేజీ కాదు.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"ఇది ప్రతి వాహనం లేదా కంపెనీ-కార్ కేసును కవర్ చేస్తుందా?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"నం. ఇది ప్రామాణిక నార్వేజియన్ ప్యాసింజర్-కార్ నియమాలను మాత్రమే కవర్ చేస్తుంది. ప్రత్యేక వాహనాలు, వ్యాన్ల తరగతి 2, మినహాయింపులు మరియు వ్యక్తిగత మినహాయింపులు ఈ అంచనాకు వెలుపల ఉన్నాయి.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"సొంత-కారు పోలిక అలాంటిదేనా?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"నం. ఇది మీరు నమోదు చేసిన వార్షిక స్వంత కారు ధరను కంపెనీ-కార్ ప్రయోజనంపై అంచనా వేసిన వ్యక్తిగత పన్ను పక్కన ఉంచుతుంది. అవి వేర్వేరు చర్యలు; ఇది యజమాని ఖర్చులు, రీయింబర్స్‌మెంట్‌లు, ఫైనాన్సింగ్, ఇంధనం, పన్ను మినహాయింపులు మరియు ప్రైవేట్ వినియోగం యొక్క పూర్తి విలువను మినహాయిస్తుంది.","Norway scope and data date":"నార్వే పరిధి మరియు డేటా తేదీ","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"ఇది 16 అక్టోబర్ 2026ని తనిఖీ చేసిన Skatteeten's 2026 ప్రామాణిక కంపెనీ-కార్ రేట్లు ఉపయోగించి నార్వే-నిర్దిష్ట ప్రణాళిక అంచనా. నియమాలు ఈ పేజీలో ఎంచుకున్న భాషపై ఆధారపడి ఉండవు. ఇది అధికారిక పన్ను రిటర్న్, పూర్తి పన్ను గణన లేదా చట్టపరమైన నిర్ణయం కాదు. ప్రత్యేక వాహనాలు మరియు మినహాయింపులు మినహాయించబడ్డాయి. ఈ బిల్డ్‌లో ధరలు స్థిరంగా ఉంటాయి మరియు నేపథ్యంలో రిఫ్రెష్ చేయవు; వాటిపై ఆధారపడే ముందు ప్రస్తుత సంవత్సరానికి స్కట్టీటాటెన్‌ని తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో లెక్కలు అమలవుతాయి. మీరు నమోదు చేసిన బొమ్మలు అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడలేదు.","Estimate company-car benefit":"కంపెనీ-కారు ప్రయోజనాన్ని అంచనా వేయండి","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ఉచితం · మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో నడుస్తుంది","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"నార్వేజియన్ 2026 ప్యాసింజర్ కార్ల కోసం ప్రామాణిక నియమాలు. ఈ పేజీ మీ భాష నుండి మీ పన్ను దేశాన్ని ఊహించదు.","Car list price when new, NOK":"కొత్తగా ఉన్నప్పుడు కార్ జాబితా ధర, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"కారు మొత్తం నెలలు అందుబాటులో ఉంది, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"కారు 1 జనవరిలో 3 సంవత్సరాల కంటే పాతది","Documented work driving during the year, km":"సంవత్సరంలో డాక్యుమెంట్ చేయబడిన పని డ్రైవింగ్, కి.మీ","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"నేను వర్క్ డ్రైవింగ్ కోసం క్వాలిఫైయింగ్ మైలేజ్ లాగ్‌ని కలిగి ఉన్నాను","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"మీ అంచనా ఉపాంత పన్ను రేటు, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"మీ స్వంత కారు వార్షిక ధర, NOK (ఐచ్ఛికం)","Calculate estimate":"అంచనాను లెక్కించండి","Reset inputs":"ఇన్‌పుట్‌లను రీసెట్ చేయండి","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"అసలు జాబితా ధర మరియు అందుబాటులో ఉన్న నెలలను నమోదు చేయండి.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"జాబితా ధర, నెలలు, కిలోమీటర్లు మరియు శాతాన్ని తనిఖీ చేయండి; చెల్లుబాటు అయ్యే నాన్-నెగటివ్ విలువలను నమోదు చేయండి.","2026 estimate":"2026 అంచనా","List price as new":"కొత్తగా ధరను జాబితా చేయండి","Taxable list-price base":"పన్ను విధించదగిన జాబితా-ధర బేస్","Reduced list-price base":"తగ్గిన జాబితా-ధర బేస్","Average taxable benefit per month":"నెలకు సగటు పన్ను విధించదగిన ప్రయోజనం","Taxable benefit for entered months":"నమోదైన నెలలకు పన్ను విధించదగిన ప్రయోజనం","Taxable benefit for a full year":"పూర్తి సంవత్సరానికి పన్ను విధించదగిన ప్రయోజనం","Marginal tax rate entered":"మార్జినల్ పన్ను రేటు నమోదు చేయబడింది","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"ఈ ప్రయోజనంపై అంచనా వేయబడిన వ్యక్తిగత పన్ను","Own-car annual cost entered":"సొంత కారు వార్షిక ధర నమోదు చేయబడింది","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"సొంత కారు ధర మైనస్ అంచనా వేసిన కంపెనీ-కారు వ్యక్తిగత పన్ను","Months included":"నెలలు చేర్చబడ్డాయి","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"1 జనవరిలో 3 సంవత్సరాలకు పైగా పాత తగ్గింపు వర్తించబడింది","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"డాక్యుమెంట్ చేయబడిన పని-మైలేజ్ తగ్గింపు వర్తించబడింది","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"మైలేజ్ తగ్గింపుకు లాగ్‌బుక్ అవసరం మరియు 40,000 కంటే ఎక్కువ పని కిమీ.","Tax year":"పన్ను సంవత్సరం","Official rate checked":"అధికారిక ధర తనిఖీ చేయబడింది","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 కంపెనీ-కార్ ధరలు","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · కంపెనీ కారు యొక్క ప్రైవేట్ ఉపయోగం","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"సందర్భం మాత్రమే: సొంత-కారు వార్షిక వ్యయం మరియు కంపెనీ-కారు ప్రయోజనంపై అంచనా వేసిన వ్యక్తిగత పన్ను వేర్వేరు చర్యలు; ఇది మొత్తం-ఖర్చు పోలిక కాదు.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"ప్రయోజనం పన్ను పరిధిలోకి వచ్చే ఆదాయం, పన్ను బిల్లు కాదు. పూర్తి ఆదాయ-పన్ను, యజమాని-ఖర్చు, రీయింబర్స్‌మెంట్ లేదా ఫైనాన్సింగ్ గణన చేర్చబడలేదు.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో స్థానికంగా రన్ అవుతుంది; ఇన్‌పుట్ గణాంకాలు సర్వర్‌కు పంపబడవు."},"th":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"เครื่องคำนวณภาษีรถยนต์ของบริษัทนอร์เวย์","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"เครื่องคำนวณภาษีรถยนต์ของบริษัทนอร์เวย์ 2026 — ประมาณการผลประโยชน์ที่ต้องเสียภาษี","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"ประมาณการสิทธิประโยชน์ทางภาษีของ 2026 ของนอร์เวย์สำหรับการใช้งานส่วนบุคคลของรถยนต์นั่งส่วนบุคคลมาตรฐานของบริษัท ป้อนราคาปลีก ส่วนลดที่เข้าเกณฑ์ เดือน และประมาณการภาษีส่วนเพิ่มของคุณ","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"ประมาณการผลประโยชน์เงินเดือนที่ต้องเสียภาษีของนอร์เวย์จากการใช้รถยนต์นั่งส่วนบุคคลมาตรฐานของบริษัทเป็นการส่วนตัว จากนั้นประมาณภาษีส่วนบุคคลด้วยอัตราส่วนเพิ่มที่คุณป้อน","What does this estimate?":"ค่าประมาณนี้คืออะไร?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"สำหรับกฎมาตรฐาน 2026 ของนอร์เวย์ สิทธิประโยชน์จะขึ้นอยู่กับราคาปลีกของรถใหม่ ไม่ใช่ราคาซื้อ เครื่องคำนวณจะใช้เกณฑ์และอัตราที่เผยแพร่ อายุที่มีสิทธิ์หรือการลดระยะทางการทำงานที่บันทึกไว้ และจำนวนเดือนที่มี","How the estimate works":"วิธีการทำงานของการประมาณการ","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"สิทธิประโยชน์มาตรฐาน 2026 คือ 30% ของราคาปลีกที่ลดราคาสูงสุด NOK 370,300 บวก 20% ของส่วนเกินใดๆ ฐานราคาปลีกปกติคือ 100%; จะเป็น 75% หากรถมีอายุเกินสามปีในวันที่ 1 มกราคม หรืองานเอกสารที่ขับขี่เกิน 40,000 กม. และ 56.25% เมื่อใช้ทั้งสองเงื่อนไข ป้อนทั้งเดือนสำหรับส่วนปี ภาษีส่วนบุคคลโดยประมาณคือผลประโยชน์ที่ต้องเสียภาษีคูณด้วยอัตราส่วนเพิ่มของคุณเอง นี่ไม่ใช่การคำนวณภาษีทั้งหมด","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"สิทธิประโยชน์ทางภาษีเท่ากับภาษีที่ฉันจ่ายหรือไม่","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"No. ผลประโยชน์จะถูกเพิ่มเข้าไปในเงินเดือนที่ต้องเสียภาษีตามกฎมาตรฐาน การประมาณการภาษีแยกต่างหากจะคูณด้วยอัตราส่วนเพิ่มที่คุณป้อน และไม่ได้คำนวณภาษีนอร์เวย์ทั้งหมดของคุณ","Which car price should I enter?":"ควรใส่ราคารถรุ่นไหน?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"ใช้ราคาปลีกเหมือนใหม่ รวมถึงอุปกรณ์ที่ติดตั้งจากโรงงานและตัวแทนจำหน่ายที่เกี่ยวข้องภายใต้กฎอย่างเป็นทางการ อย่าใช้มูลค่าตลาดปัจจุบันหรือราคาที่คุณจ่ายสำหรับรถยนต์มือสอง","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"ฉันจะใช้การลดระยะทางได้เมื่อใด","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"เฉพาะเมื่อมีการบันทึกการขับขี่เพื่อการทำงานด้วยบันทึกระยะทางที่กำหนดและเกิน 40,000 กม. ในปีนี้ 40,000 กม. ไม่เข้ารอบอย่างแน่นอน การขับรถส่วนตัวไม่ใช่ระยะทางการทำงาน","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"ครอบคลุมรถยนต์ทุกคันหรือรถบริษัทหรือไม่?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"No. ครอบคลุมกฎเกณฑ์มาตรฐานรถยนต์นั่งส่วนบุคคลของนอร์เวย์เท่านั้น ยานพาหนะพิเศษ รถตู้ประเภท 2 การยกเว้น และข้อยกเว้นส่วนบุคคลอยู่นอกเหนือการประมาณการนี้","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"การเปรียบเทียบรถของตัวเองเหมือนกันหรือไม่?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"No. โดยจะระบุค่าใช้จ่ายรถยนต์ส่วนตัวรายปีที่คุณป้อนไว้ถัดจากภาษีส่วนบุคคลโดยประมาณสำหรับผลประโยชน์รถยนต์ของบริษัท นั่นเป็นมาตรการที่แตกต่างกัน โดยไม่รวมค่าใช้จ่ายของนายจ้าง เงินชดเชย การเงิน ค่าเชื้อเพลิง การหักภาษี และมูลค่าเต็มของการใช้ส่วนตัว","Norway scope and data date":"ขอบเขตของนอร์เวย์และวันที่ข้อมูล","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"นี่คือการประมาณการการวางแผนเฉพาะนอร์เวย์โดยใช้อัตรารถยนต์บริษัทมาตรฐาน 2026 ของ Skatteetaten เลือกที่ 16 ตุลาคม 2026 กฎไม่ได้ขึ้นอยู่กับภาษาที่เลือกในหน้านี้ ไม่ใช่การคืนภาษีอย่างเป็นทางการ การคำนวณภาษีทั้งหมด หรือการตัดสินใจทางกฎหมาย ไม่รวมยานพาหนะพิเศษและข้อยกเว้น ราคาในบิลด์นี้คงที่และจะไม่รีเฟรชในเบื้องหลัง ตรวจสอบ Skatteetaten สำหรับปีปัจจุบันก่อนที่จะใช้ข้อมูลเหล่านั้น","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"การคำนวณทำงานในเบราว์เซอร์นี้ ตัวเลขที่คุณป้อนไม่ได้ถูกอัพโหลด","Estimate company-car benefit":"ประมาณการผลประโยชน์รถยนต์ของบริษัท","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ฟรี · รันในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"กฎมาตรฐาน 2026 ของนอร์เวย์สำหรับรถยนต์นั่งส่วนบุคคล หน้านี้ไม่ได้สรุปประเทศภาษีของคุณจากภาษาของคุณ","Car list price when new, NOK":"ราคาปลีกรถใหม่ NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"รถพร้อมใช้งานทั้งเดือน 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"รถมีอายุมากกว่า 3 ปีเมื่อ 1 มกราคม","Documented work driving during the year, km":"บันทึกงานขับรถระหว่างปี,กม","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"ฉันมีบันทึกระยะทางที่กำหนดสำหรับการขับรถทำงาน","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"อัตราภาษีส่วนเพิ่มโดยประมาณของคุณ %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"ค่าใช้จ่ายรายปีรถยนต์ของคุณเอง, NOK (ไม่บังคับ)","Calculate estimate":"คำนวณประมาณการ","Reset inputs":"รีเซ็ตอินพุต","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"ป้อนราคาปลีกเดิมและเดือนที่มี","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"ตรวจสอบราคาปลีก เดือน กิโลเมตร และเปอร์เซ็นต์ ป้อนค่าที่ไม่ใช่ค่าลบที่ถูกต้อง","2026 estimate":"ค่าประมาณ 2026","List price as new":"ปลีกราคาเหมือนใหม่","Taxable list-price base":"ฐานราคาปลีกที่ต้องเสียภาษี","Reduced list-price base":"ฐานราคาปลีกที่ลดลง","Average taxable benefit per month":"ผลประโยชน์ทางภาษีโดยเฉลี่ยต่อเดือน","Taxable benefit for entered months":"สิทธิประโยชน์ทางภาษีสำหรับเดือนที่ป้อน","Taxable benefit for a full year":"สิทธิประโยชน์ทางภาษีตลอดทั้งปี","Marginal tax rate entered":"ป้อนอัตราภาษีส่วนเพิ่มแล้ว","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"ภาษีส่วนบุคคลโดยประมาณสำหรับสิทธิประโยชน์นี้","Own-car annual cost entered":"ป้อนค่าใช้จ่ายรายปีของรถยนต์เอง","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"ต้นทุนรถยนต์หักภาษีส่วนบุคคลบริษัท-รถยนต์โดยประมาณ","Months included":"รวมเดือน","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"มีอายุมากกว่า 3 ปีเมื่อ 1 ใช้การลดในเดือนมกราคม","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"ใช้การลดระยะทางในการทำงานที่จัดทำเป็นเอกสาร","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"การลดระยะทางต้องใช้สมุดบันทึกและระยะทางการทำงานมากกว่า 40,000 กม.","Tax year":"ปีภาษี","Official rate checked":"ตรวจสอบอัตราอย่างเป็นทางการแล้ว","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 อัตรารถบริษัท","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · รถส่วนตัวของบริษัท","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"บริบทเท่านั้น: ค่าใช้จ่ายรายปีของรถยนต์ส่วนตัวและภาษีส่วนบุคคลโดยประมาณจากผลประโยชน์รถยนต์ของบริษัทเป็นมาตรการที่แตกต่างกัน นี่ไม่ใช่การเปรียบเทียบต้นทุนทั้งหมด","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"สิทธิประโยชน์คือรายได้ที่ต้องเสียภาษี ไม่ใช่ใบกำกับภาษี ไม่รวมการคำนวณภาษีเงินได้ทั้งหมด ต้นทุนนายจ้าง การคืนเงิน หรือการจัดหาเงินทุน","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"ทำงานภายในเบราว์เซอร์นี้ ตัวเลขอินพุตจะไม่ถูกส่งไปยังเซิร์ฟเวอร์"},"tl":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Calculator ng Buwis sa Sasakyan ng Kumpanya ng Norway 2026 — Tinantya ng Nabubuwisang Benepisyo","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Tantyahin ang 2026 na nabubuwisang benepisyo ng Norway para sa pribadong paggamit ng isang karaniwang pampasaherong sasakyan ng kumpanya. Ilagay ang presyo ng listahan, mga pagbawas sa kwalipikado, buwan at ang iyong marginal na pagtatantya sa buwis.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Tantyahin ang Norwegian taxable salary benefit mula sa pribadong paggamit ng karaniwang pampasaherong sasakyan ng kumpanya, pagkatapos ay tantyahin ang personal na buwis na may marginal rate na iyong ipinasok.","What does this estimate?":"Ano ang tinatantya nito?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Para sa mga pamantayang panuntunan ng 2026 ng Norway, ang benepisyo ay nakabatay sa listahan ng presyo ng kotse bilang bago, hindi sa presyo ng pagbili nito. Inilalapat ng calculator ang na-publish na threshold at mga rate, anumang karapat-dapat na edad o dokumentadong pagbawas sa work-mileage, at ang bilang ng mga buwang magagamit.","How the estimate works":"Paano gumagana ang pagtatantya","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Ang karaniwang benepisyo ng 2026 ay 30% ng pinababang presyo sa listahan hanggang sa NOK 370,300, kasama ang 20% ng anumang labis. Ang base ng listahan-presyo ay karaniwang 100%; ito ay 75% kung ang kotse ay higit sa tatlong taong gulang noong 1 Enero o ang dokumentadong pagmamaneho sa trabaho ay lumampas sa 40,000 km, at 56.25% kapag nalalapat ang parehong kundisyon. Ipasok ang buong buwan para sa isang bahaging taon. Ang tinantyang personal na buwis ay ang nabubuwisang benepisyo na pinarami ng iyong sariling marginal rate; hindi ito isang buong pagkalkula ng buwis.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Katumbas ba ng buwis na benepisyo ang binabayaran kong buwis?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Hindi. Ang benepisyo ay idinaragdag sa nabubuwisang suweldo sa ilalim ng mga karaniwang tuntunin. Ang hiwalay na pagtatantya ng buwis ay nagpaparami nito sa marginal rate na iyong ipinasok at hindi kinakalkula ang iyong buong Norwegian na buwis.","Which car price should I enter?":"Aling presyo ng kotse ang dapat kong ilagay?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Gamitin ang listahan ng presyo bilang bago, kabilang ang mga nauugnay na kagamitan na nilagyan ng pabrika at naka-install sa dealer sa ilalim ng mga opisyal na panuntunan. Huwag gamitin ang kasalukuyang halaga sa pamilihan o ang presyong binayaran mo para sa isang ginamit na kotse.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Kailan ko magagamit ang pagbabawas ng mileage?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Lamang kapag ang pagmamaneho sa trabaho ay naidokumento ng isang qualifying mileage log at lumampas sa 40,000 km sa taon. Eksaktong 40,000 km ay hindi kwalipikado. Ang personal na pagmamaneho ay hindi work mileage.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Sakop ba nito ang bawat kaso ng sasakyan o kumpanyang sasakyan?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Hindi. Sinasaklaw nito ang karaniwang mga panuntunan sa pampasaherong sasakyan sa Norway lamang. Ang mga espesyal na sasakyan, klase ng van na 2, mga exemption at indibidwal na mga pagbubukod ay wala sa pagtatantya na ito.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Ang paghahambing ba ng sariling sasakyan ay parang-para-para?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Hindi. Inilalagay nito ang iyong ipinasok na taunang gastos sa sariling sasakyan sa tabi ng tinantyang personal na buwis sa benepisyo ng kumpanya-sasakyan. Iyon ay iba't ibang mga panukala; hindi nito kasama ang mga gastos ng employer, reimbursement, financing, gasolina, mga bawas sa buwis at ang buong halaga ng pribadong paggamit.","Norway scope and data date":"Sakop ng Norway at petsa ng data","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Ito ay isang pagtatantya sa pagpaplano na tukoy sa Norway gamit ang 2026 standard na rate ng kumpanya-sasakyan ng Skatteetaten, na sinuri ang 16 Oktubre 2026. Ang mga patakaran ay hindi nakadepende sa wikang pinili sa pahinang ito. Ito ay hindi isang opisyal na pagbabalik ng buwis, buong pagkalkula ng buwis o legal na desisyon. Ang mga espesyal na sasakyan at pagbubukod ay hindi kasama. Ang mga rate ay static sa build na ito at hindi nagre-refresh sa background; suriin ang Skatteetaten para sa kasalukuyang taon bago umasa sa kanila.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Ang mga kalkulasyon ay tumatakbo sa browser na ito. Ang mga numerong ipinasok mo ay hindi na-upload.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Tantyahin ang benepisyo ng kumpanya-sasakyan","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"LIBRE · TATAKBO SA IYONG BROWSER","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Norwegian 2026 karaniwang mga panuntunan para sa mga pampasaherong sasakyan. Ang pahinang ito ay hindi naghihinuha ng iyong buwis na bansa mula sa iyong wika.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Presyo ng listahan ng kotse kapag bago, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Buong buwan na available ang kotse, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"Ang kotse ay higit sa 3 taong gulang noong 1 Enero","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Documented work driving sa buong taon, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Mayroon akong qualifying mileage log para sa trabahong pagmamaneho","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Ang iyong tinantyang marginal tax rate, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Taunang gastos ng iyong sariling sasakyan, NOK (opsyonal)","Calculate estimate":"Kalkulahin ang pagtatantya","Reset inputs":"I-reset ang mga input","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Ilagay ang orihinal na presyo ng listahan at ang mga buwang available.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Suriin ang listahan ng presyo, buwan, kilometro at porsyento; maglagay ng mga wastong hindi negatibong halaga.","2026 estimate":"2026 pagtatantya","List price as new":"Ilista ang presyo bilang bago","Taxable list-price base":"Batay ng listahan ng presyo na nabubuwisan","Reduced list-price base":"Pinababang base sa listahan ng presyo","Average taxable benefit per month":"Average na nabubuwisang benepisyo bawat buwan","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Nabubuwisan na benepisyo para sa mga ipinasok na buwan","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Nabubuwisan na benepisyo para sa isang buong taon","Marginal tax rate entered":"Marginal na rate ng buwis ang ipinasok","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Tinantyang personal na buwis sa benepisyong ito","Own-car annual cost entered":"Inilagay ang taunang gastos ng sariling sasakyan","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Halaga ng sariling sasakyan na binawasan ng tinantyang personal na buwis ng kumpanya-kotse","Months included":"Kasama ang mga buwan","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Higit sa 3 taong gulang sa 1 Enero inilapat ang pagbawas","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Inilapat ang dokumentadong pagbawas sa work-mileage","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Ang pagbawas ng mileage ay nangangailangan ng logbook at higit sa 40,000 km ng trabaho.","Tax year":"Taon ng buwis","Official rate checked":"Nasuri ang opisyal na rate","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 na mga rate ng kumpanya sa kotse","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · pribadong paggamit ng kotse ng kumpanya","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Konteksto lamang: ang taunang gastos ng sariling sasakyan at tinantyang personal na buwis sa benepisyo ng kumpanya-sasakyan ay magkaibang mga panukala; hindi ito isang paghahambing ng kabuuang halaga.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Ang benepisyo ay nabubuwisang kita, hindi ang bayarin sa buwis. Walang buong pagkalkula ng buwis sa kita, gastos ng employer, reimbursement o financing.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Lokal na tumatakbo sa browser na ito; ang mga numero ng input ay hindi ipinadala sa isang server."},"tr":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Norveç Şirket Araç Vergisi Hesaplayıcı","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Norveç Şirket Araç Vergisi Hesaplayıcı 2026 — Vergiye Tabi Fayda Tahmini","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Standart bir şirket binek otomobilinin özel kullanımı için Norveç'in 2026 vergiye tabi avantajını tahmin edin. Liste fiyatını, geçerli indirimleri, ayları ve marjinal vergi tahmininizi girin.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Standart bir şirket binek arabasının özel kullanımından elde edilen Norveç vergiye tabi maaş faydasını tahmin edin, ardından kişisel vergiyi girdiğiniz marjinal oran ile tahmin edin.","What does this estimate?":"Bu ne tahmin ediyor?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Norveç'in 2026 standart kurallarına göre avantaj, aracın satın alma fiyatına değil, yeni olarak liste fiyatına dayanmaktadır. Hesaplayıcı, yayınlanan eşiği ve oranları, uygun yaşı veya belgelenen iş-kilometre indirimini ve mevcut ay sayısını uygular.","How the estimate works":"Tahmin nasıl çalışır?","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026 standart avantajı, NOK 370,300'e kadar indirimli liste fiyatının %30'i artı her türlü fazlalığın %20'idir. Liste fiyatı tabanı normalde %100'tir; arabanın 1 Ocak tarihinde üç yaşından büyük olması veya belgelenen iş sürüşünün 40,000 km'yi aşması durumunda %75 ve her iki koşul geçerli olduğunda %56.25'tir. Yarım yıl için tam ayları girin. Tahmini kişisel vergi, vergiye tabi faydanın kendi marjinal oranınızla çarpımıdır; bu tam bir vergi hesaplaması değildir.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Vergiye tabi fayda ödediğim vergiye eşit mi?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Hayır. Fayda, standart kurallar uyarınca vergiye tabi maaşa eklenir. Ayrı vergi tahmini, bunu girdiğiniz marjinal oranla çarpar ve Norveç verginizin tamamını hesaplamaz.","Which car price should I enter?":"Hangi araba fiyatını girmeliyim?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Resmi kurallara göre fabrikada takılan ve bayide takılan ilgili ekipmanlar dahil olmak üzere liste fiyatını yeni olarak kullanın. Güncel piyasa değerini veya kullanılmış bir araba için ödediğiniz fiyatı kullanmayın.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Kilometre indiriminden ne zaman yararlanabilirim?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Yalnızca işte sürüş, uygun bir kilometre günlüğü ile belgelendiğinde ve yıl içinde 40,000 km'yi aştığında. Tam olarak 40,000 km uygun değildir. Kişisel sürüş iş kilometresi değildir.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Bu her aracı veya şirket arabası kasasını kapsıyor mu?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Hayır. Yalnızca standart Norveç binek otomobili kurallarını kapsar. Özel araçlar, 2 sınıfı kamyonetler, muafiyetler ve bireysel istisnalar bu tahminin dışındadır.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Kendi arabanızla karşılaştırma benzer mi?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Hayır. Girdiğiniz yıllık kendi araba maliyetinizi, şirket arabası avantajına ilişkin tahmini kişisel verginin yanına yerleştirir. Bunlar farklı önlemlerdir; işveren maliyetlerini, geri ödemeleri, finansmanı, yakıtı, vergi kesintilerini ve özel kullanımın tam değerini içermez.","Norway scope and data date":"Norveç kapsamı ve veri tarihi","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Bu, Skatteetaten'in 2026 standart şirket arabası ücretlerini kullanan Norveç'e özgü bir planlama tahminidir; 16 Ekim 2026 olarak kontrol edilmiştir. Kurallar bu sayfada seçilen dile bağlı değildir. Resmi bir vergi beyannamesi, tam vergi hesaplaması veya hukuki bir karar değildir. Özel araçlar ve istisnalar hariçtir. Bu yapıda ücretler statiktir ve arka planda yenilenmez; Onlara güvenmeden önce cari yıl için Skatteetaten'i kontrol edin.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Hesaplamalar bu tarayıcıda yürütülür. Girdiğiniz rakamlar yüklenmemektedir.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Şirket-araba faydasını tahmin edin","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ÜCRETSİZ · TARAYICINIZDA ÇALIŞIR","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Norveç 2026 binek araçlara yönelik standart kurallar. Bu sayfa, dilinizden verginin ödendiği ülke sonucunu çıkarmaz.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Araç yeniyken liste fiyatı, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Araba tüm aylar boyunca mevcuttu, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"Araba, 1 Ocak tarihinde 3 yaşından daha eskiydi","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Yıl boyunca belgelenmiş çalışma sürüşü, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"İş sürüşü için uygun bir kilometre günlüğüm var","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Tahmini marjinal vergi oranınız, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Kendi aracınızın yıllık maliyeti, NOK (isteğe bağlı)","Calculate estimate":"Tahmini hesapla","Reset inputs":"Girişleri sıfırla","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Orijinal liste fiyatını ve mevcut ayları girin.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Liste fiyatını, ayları, kilometreyi ve yüzdeyi kontrol edin; negatif olmayan geçerli değerleri girin.","2026 estimate":"2026 tahmini","List price as new":"Yeni olarak liste fiyatı","Taxable list-price base":"Vergiye tabi liste fiyatı tabanı","Reduced list-price base":"İndirimli liste fiyatı tabanı","Average taxable benefit per month":"Aylık ortalama vergiye tabi fayda","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Girilen aylar için vergiye tabi fayda","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Tam yıl için vergiye tabi fayda","Marginal tax rate entered":"Marjinal vergi oranı girildi","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Bu avantaja ilişkin tahmini kişisel vergi","Own-car annual cost entered":"Kendi aracının yıllık maliyeti girildi","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Kendi aracının maliyeti eksi tahmini şirket arabası kişisel vergisi","Months included":"Aylar dahil","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"1 Ocak indirimine göre 3 yıldan daha eski","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Belgelenmiş iş-kilometre azaltımı uygulandı","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Kilometreyi azaltmak için bir kayıt defteri ve 40,000'ten fazla çalışma km'si gerekir.","Tax year":"Vergi yılı","Official rate checked":"Resmi oran kontrol edildi","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 şirket arabası ücretleri","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · şirket arabasının özel kullanımı","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Yalnızca bağlam: kendi arabasının yıllık maliyeti ve şirket arabası avantajına ilişkin tahmini kişisel vergi farklı ölçümlerdir; bu bir toplam maliyet karşılaştırması değildir.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Fayda, vergi faturası değil, vergiye tabi gelirdir. Tam gelir vergisi, işveren maliyeti, geri ödeme veya finansman hesaplaması dahil değildir.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Bu tarayıcıda yerel olarak çalışır; Girilen rakamlar bir sunucuya gönderilmez."},"uk":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Калькулятор податку на автомобіль норвезької компанії","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Калькулятор податку на автомобіль норвезької компанії 2026 — оцінка оподатковуваної вигоди","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Оцініть оподатковувану вигоду Норвегії 2026 для приватного використання стандартного службового легкового автомобіля. Введіть роздрібну ціну, кваліфіковані знижки, місяці та оцінку граничного податку.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Оцініть норвезьку оподатковувану вигоду із заробітної плати від приватного використання стандартного службового легкового автомобіля, а потім розрахуйте особистий податок із введеною вами граничною ставкою.","What does this estimate?":"Яка ця оцінка?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"За стандартними правилами Норвегії 2026 перевага базується на роздрібній ціні автомобіля як нового, а не на ціні його придбання. Калькулятор застосовує опублікований поріг і ставки, будь-який придатний вік або документально підтверджене зменшення робочого пробігу, а також кількість доступних місяців.","How the estimate works":"Як працює кошторис","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Стандартна перевага 2026 становить 30% від зниженої прейскурантної ціни до норвезьких крон 370,300 плюс 20% від будь-якого надлишку. База прейскурантної ціни зазвичай становить 100%; він становить 75%, якщо станом на 1 січня машині було більше трьох років або задокументована кількість проїздів перевищує 40,000 км, і 56.25%, якщо застосовуються обидві умови. Введіть цілі місяці для неповного року. Приблизний податок з фізичних осіб – це оподатковувана вигода, помножена на вашу власну граничну ставку; це не повний розрахунок податку.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Чи оподатковувана вигода дорівнює податку, який я сплачую?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"№ Пільга додається до оподатковуваної заробітної плати за стандартними правилами. Розрахунок окремого податку множиться на граничну ставку, яку ви вводите, і не розраховує ваш повний норвезький податок.","Which car price should I enter?":"Ціну якого автомобіля я маю ввести?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Використовуйте прейскурантну ціну як нову, включаючи відповідне заводське та дилерське обладнання відповідно до офіційних правил. Не використовуйте поточну ринкову вартість або ціну, яку ви заплатили за вживаний автомобіль.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Коли я можу скористатися скороченням пробігу?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Лише коли робоче водіння задокументовано кваліфікаційним журналом пробігу та перевищує 40,000 км на рік. Точно 40,000 км не відповідає вимогам. Особисте водіння - це не робочий пробіг.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Чи стосується це кожного транспортного засобу чи службового автомобіля?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"№ Він охоплює лише стандартні норвезькі правила легкових автомобілів. Спеціальні транспортні засоби, фургони класу 2, винятки та окремі винятки не входять у цю оцінку.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"Чи є порівняння власного автомобіля?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"№ Він розміщує вашу введену річну вартість власного автомобіля поруч із приблизним особистим податком на пільгу на службовий автомобіль. Це різні заходи; він не включає витрати роботодавця, відшкодування, фінансування, паливо, податкові відрахування та повну вартість приватного використання.","Norway scope and data date":"Сфера дії Норвегії та дата даних","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Це розрахунок планування для Норвегії з використанням стандартних ставок Skatteetaten 2026 за службовий автомобіль, перевірено 16 жовтень 2026. Правила не залежать від мови, вибраної на цій сторінці. Це не офіційна податкова декларація, повний податковий розрахунок або юридичне рішення. Спеціальні транспортні засоби та винятки виключені. У цій збірці тарифи статичні й не оновлюються у фоновому режимі; перевірте Skatteetaten за поточний рік, перш ніж покладатися на них.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Обчислення виконуються в цьому браузері. Введені цифри не завантажуються.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Оцінка вигоди службового автомобіля","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕЗКОШТОВНО · ЗАПУСКАЄТЬСЯ У ВАШОМУ БРАУЗЕРІ","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Норвезькі стандартні правила 2026 для легкових автомобілів. Ця сторінка не визначає країну оподаткування з вашої мови.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Прейскурантна ціна на новий автомобіль, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Автомобіль був у наявності, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"Січень 1 автомобілю було понад 3 років","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Документована робота водіння протягом року, км","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"У мене є кваліфікований журнал пробігу для роботи водіння","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Ваша орієнтовна гранична податкова ставка, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Річна вартість власного автомобіля, норвезькі крон (необов’язково)","Calculate estimate":"Розрахувати кошторис","Reset inputs":"Скидання входів","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Введіть оригінальну прейскурантну ціну та доступні місяці.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Перевірте прейскурантну ціну, місяці, кілометри та відсоток; введіть дійсні невід’ємні значення.","2026 estimate":"2026 оцінка","List price as new":"Прейскурант як новий","Taxable list-price base":"Оподатковувана прейскурантна база","Reduced list-price base":"Знижена прейскурантна база","Average taxable benefit per month":"Середня оподатковувана виплата за місяць","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Оподатковувана пільга за введені місяці","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Оподатковувана вигода за повний рік","Marginal tax rate entered":"Введено граничну ставку податку","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Розрахунковий податок на цю допомогу","Own-car annual cost entered":"Введено річну вартість власного автомобіля","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Вартість власного автомобіля мінус орієнтовний податок на особистий автомобіль компанії","Months included":"Місяці включені","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"Понад 3 років на 1 застосовано січневе зниження","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Застосовано документально підтверджене скорочення пробігу роботи","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Зменшення пробігу вимагає бортового журналу та понад 40,000 робочих кілометрів.","Tax year":"Податковий р","Official rate checked":"Офіційний курс перевірено","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 тарифи на службовий автомобіль","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · приватне використання службового автомобіля","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Лише контекст: річна вартість власного автомобіля та приблизний податок на особистий податок на службовий автомобіль є різними показниками; це не порівняння загальної вартості.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Пільгою є оподатковуваний дохід, а не податкова накладна. Не включено повний податок на прибуток, витрати роботодавця, відшкодування чи фінансування.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Запускається локально в цьому браузері; введені дані не надсилаються на сервер."},"ur":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"ناروے کمپنی کار ٹیکس کیلکولیٹر","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"ناروے کمپنی کار ٹیکس کیلکولیٹر 2026 - قابل ٹیکس فائدہ کا تخمینہ","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"معیاری کمپنی کی مسافر کار کے نجی استعمال کے لیے ناروے کے 2026 کے قابل ٹیکس فائدہ کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔ فہرست کی قیمت، قابلیت میں کمی، مہینے اور اپنے معمولی ٹیکس کا تخمینہ درج کریں۔","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"معیاری کمپنی کی مسافر کار کے نجی استعمال سے نارویجن ٹیکس قابل تنخواہ کے فوائد کا تخمینہ لگائیں، پھر اپنی داخل کردہ معمولی شرح کے ساتھ ذاتی ٹیکس کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔","What does this estimate?":"اس کا اندازہ کیا ہے؟","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"ناروے کے 2026 کے معیاری اصولوں کے لیے، فائدہ کار کی نئی قیمت پر مبنی ہے، نہ کہ اس کی خریداری کی قیمت۔ کیلکولیٹر شائع شدہ حد اور شرح، کسی بھی اہل عمر یا دستاویزی کام کے مائلیج میں کمی، اور دستیاب مہینوں کی تعداد کا اطلاق کرتا ہے۔","How the estimate works":"تخمینہ کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026 کا معیاری فائدہ NOK 370,300 تک کم کردہ فہرست قیمت کا 30% ہے، اس کے علاوہ کسی بھی اضافی کا 20% ہے۔ فہرست کی قیمت کی بنیاد عام طور پر 100% ہوتی ہے۔ یہ 75% ہے اگر کار 1 جنوری کو تین سال سے زیادہ پرانی ہو یا دستاویزی کام کی ڈرائیونگ 40,000 کلومیٹر سے زیادہ ہو، اور 56.25% جب دونوں شرائط لاگو ہوں۔ ایک پارٹ سال کے لیے پورے مہینے درج کریں۔ تخمینہ شدہ ذاتی ٹیکس قابل ٹیکس فائدہ ہے جسے آپ کی اپنی معمولی شرح سے ضرب دیا جاتا ہے۔ یہ ٹیکس کا مکمل حساب کتاب نہیں ہے۔","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"کیا قابل ٹیکس فائدہ میرے ادا کردہ ٹیکس کے برابر ہے؟","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"نہیں، فائدہ معیاری قواعد کے تحت قابل ٹیکس تنخواہ میں شامل کیا جاتا ہے۔ علیحدہ ٹیکس کا تخمینہ اسے آپ کے داخل کردہ معمولی شرح سے ضرب دیتا ہے اور آپ کے پورے نارویجن ٹیکس کا حساب نہیں لگاتا ہے۔","Which car price should I enter?":"مجھے کس کار کی قیمت درج کرنی چاہیے؟","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"فہرست کی قیمت کو نئے کے طور پر استعمال کریں، بشمول متعلقہ فیکٹری میں لگے ہوئے اور ڈیلر کے نصب کردہ آلات سرکاری قواعد کے تحت۔ موجودہ مارکیٹ ویلیو یا استعمال شدہ کار کے لیے آپ نے جو قیمت ادا کی ہے اسے استعمال نہ کریں۔","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"میں مائلیج میں کمی کب استعمال کر سکتا ہوں؟","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"صرف اس صورت میں جب کام کی ڈرائیونگ کوالیفائنگ مائلیج لاگ سے دستاویزی شکل دی جائے اور سال میں 40,000 کلومیٹر سے زیادہ ہو۔ بالکل 40,000 کلومیٹر قابل نہیں ہے۔ ذاتی ڈرائیونگ کام کی مائلیج نہیں ہے۔","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"کیا یہ ہر گاڑی یا کمپنی کار کیس کا احاطہ کرتا ہے؟","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"نہیں، یہ صرف نارویجن مسافر کار کے معیاری قوانین کا احاطہ کرتا ہے۔ خصوصی گاڑیاں، وین کلاس 2، استثنیٰ اور انفرادی استثناء اس تخمینہ سے باہر ہیں۔","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"کیا اپنی گاڑی کا موازنہ ایک جیسا ہے؟","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"نہیں، یہ کمپنی-کار بینیفٹ پر آپ کی درج کردہ سالانہ ذاتی گاڑی کی لاگت کو تخمینہ شدہ ذاتی ٹیکس کے آگے رکھتا ہے۔ وہ مختلف اقدامات ہیں؛ اس میں آجر کے اخراجات، معاوضے، فنانسنگ، ایندھن، ٹیکس کٹوتیوں اور نجی استعمال کی مکمل قیمت شامل نہیں ہے۔","Norway scope and data date":"ناروے کا دائرہ کار اور ڈیٹا کی تاریخ","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"یہ Skatteetateten کے 2026 کے معیاری کمپنی-کار کے نرخوں کا استعمال کرتے ہوئے ناروے کے لیے مخصوص منصوبہ بندی کا تخمینہ ہے، 16 اکتوبر 2026 کو چیک کیا گیا۔ قواعد اس صفحہ پر منتخب کردہ زبان پر منحصر نہیں ہیں۔ یہ سرکاری ٹیکس ریٹرن، مکمل ٹیکس حساب یا قانونی فیصلہ نہیں ہے۔ خصوصی گاڑیاں اور مستثنیات کو خارج کر دیا گیا ہے۔ اس تعمیر میں قیمتیں مستحکم ہیں اور پس منظر میں تازہ نہیں ہوتی ہیں۔ ان پر انحصار کرنے سے پہلے موجودہ سال کے لیے Skatteetateten کو چیک کریں۔","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"حسابات اس براؤزر میں چلتے ہیں۔ آپ کے درج کردہ اعداد و شمار اپ لوڈ نہیں کیے گئے ہیں۔","Estimate company-car benefit":"کمپنی کار کے فائدے کا اندازہ لگائیں۔","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"مفت · آپ کے براؤزر میں چلتا ہے۔","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"مسافر کاروں کے لیے نارویجن 2026 کے معیاری اصول۔ یہ صفحہ آپ کی زبان سے آپ کے ٹیکس ملک کا اندازہ نہیں لگاتا۔","Car list price when new, NOK":"کار کی فہرست قیمت جب نئی، NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"کار پورے مہینے دستیاب تھی، 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"کار 1 جنوری کو 3 سال سے زیادہ پرانی تھی","Documented work driving during the year, km":"سال کے دوران ڈرائیونگ کا دستاویزی کام، کلومیٹر","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"میرے پاس کام کی ڈرائیونگ کے لیے کوالیفائنگ مائلیج لاگ ہے","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"آپ کی تخمینی حد تک ٹیکس کی شرح، %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"آپ کی اپنی گاڑی کی سالانہ قیمت، NOK (اختیاری)","Calculate estimate":"تخمینہ کا حساب لگائیں۔","Reset inputs":"ری سیٹ ان پٹس","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"اصل فہرست قیمت اور دستیاب مہینے درج کریں۔","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"فہرست قیمت، مہینے، کلومیٹر اور فیصد چیک کریں۔ درست غیر منفی اقدار درج کریں۔","2026 estimate":"2026 تخمینہ","List price as new":"نئی کے طور پر قیمت درج کریں۔","Taxable list-price base":"قابل ٹیکس فہرست قیمت کی بنیاد","Reduced list-price base":"فہرست کی قیمت میں کمی کی بنیاد","Average taxable benefit per month":"ہر ماہ اوسط قابل ٹیکس فائدہ","Taxable benefit for entered months":"داخل کردہ مہینوں کے لیے قابل ٹیکس فائدہ","Taxable benefit for a full year":"پورے سال کے لیے قابل ٹیکس فائدہ","Marginal tax rate entered":"معمولی ٹیکس کی شرح درج کی گئی۔","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"اس فائدہ پر تخمینہ ذاتی ٹیکس","Own-car annual cost entered":"اپنی گاڑی کی سالانہ لاگت درج کی گئی۔","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"اپنی کار کی لاگت مائنس تخمینہ شدہ کمپنی کار ذاتی ٹیکس","Months included":"مہینے شامل ہیں۔","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"1 جنوری کو 3 سال سے زیادہ عمر کی کمی لاگو ہوئی۔","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"دستاویز شدہ ورک مائلیج میں کمی لاگو","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"مائلیج میں کمی کے لیے لاگ بک اور 40,000 ورک کلومیٹر سے زیادہ کی ضرورت ہے۔","Tax year":"ٹیکس سال","Official rate checked":"آفیشل ریٹ چیک کیا گیا۔","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 کمپنی-کار کے نرخ","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · کمپنی کی کار کا نجی استعمال","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"صرف سیاق و سباق: اپنی گاڑی کی سالانہ قیمت اور کمپنی-کار کے فائدے پر تخمینہ ذاتی ٹیکس مختلف اقدامات ہیں۔ یہ کل لاگت کا موازنہ نہیں ہے۔","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"فائدہ قابل ٹیکس آمدنی ہے، ٹیکس بل نہیں۔ کوئی مکمل انکم ٹیکس، آجر کی لاگت، ری ایمبرسمنٹ یا فنانسنگ کا حساب شامل نہیں ہے۔","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"اس براؤزر میں مقامی طور پر چلتا ہے۔ ان پٹ کے اعداد و شمار سرور کو نہیں بھیجے جاتے ہیں۔"},"vi":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"Máy tính thuế ô tô của công ty Na Uy","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"Máy tính thuế ô tô của công ty Na Uy 2026 — Ước tính lợi ích chịu thuế","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"Ước tính lợi ích chịu thuế 2026 của Na Uy đối với việc sử dụng xe khách tiêu chuẩn của công ty cho mục đích cá nhân. Nhập giá niêm yết, mức giảm đủ điều kiện, tháng và ước tính thuế cận biên của bạn.","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"Ước tính mức lương chịu thuế của Na Uy từ việc sử dụng xe chở khách tiêu chuẩn của công ty cho mục đích cá nhân, sau đó ước tính thuế cá nhân với tỷ lệ cận biên mà bạn nhập.","What does this estimate?":"Ước tính này là gì?","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"Đối với các quy tắc tiêu chuẩn 2026 của Na Uy, lợi ích được tính dựa trên giá niêm yết của xe như mới chứ không phải giá mua. Công cụ tính toán áp dụng ngưỡng và tỷ lệ đã công bố, mọi độ tuổi đủ điều kiện hoặc mức giảm quãng đường làm việc được ghi lại và số tháng khả dụng.","How the estimate works":"Cách hoạt động của ước tính","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"Lợi ích tiêu chuẩn 2026 là 30% của giá niêm yết đã giảm lên đến NOK 370,300, cộng với 20% của bất kỳ khoản vượt quá nào. Cơ sở giá niêm yết thường là 100%; đó là 75% nếu xe đã hơn ba tuổi vào tháng 1 1 hoặc được ghi nhận là đã lái xe vượt quá 40,000 km và 56.25% khi áp dụng cả hai điều kiện. Nhập cả tháng cho một phần năm. Thuế cá nhân ước tính là lợi ích chịu thuế nhân với tỷ lệ cận biên của chính bạn; đây không phải là cách tính thuế đầy đủ.","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"Lợi ích chịu thuế có bằng số thuế tôi phải trả không?","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"Không. Lợi ích này được cộng vào tiền lương chịu thuế theo các quy định tiêu chuẩn. Ước tính thuế riêng biệt nhân nó với tỷ lệ cận biên bạn nhập và không tính toàn bộ thuế Na Uy của bạn.","Which car price should I enter?":"Tôi nên nhập giá xe nào?","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"Sử dụng giá niêm yết như mới, bao gồm các thiết bị do nhà máy lắp đặt và đại lý lắp đặt có liên quan theo các quy định chính thức. Không sử dụng giá trị thị trường hiện tại hoặc mức giá bạn đã trả cho một chiếc ô tô đã qua sử dụng.","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"Khi nào tôi có thể sử dụng tính năng giảm quãng đường?","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"Chỉ khi việc lái xe đi làm được ghi lại bằng nhật ký quãng đường đủ điều kiện và vượt quá 40,000 km trong năm. Chính xác 40,000 km không đủ điều kiện. Lái xe cá nhân không phải là quãng đường đi làm.","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"Điều này có áp dụng cho mọi loại xe hoặc thùng xe của công ty không?","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"Không. Nó chỉ bao gồm các quy tắc xe khách tiêu chuẩn của Na Uy. Các loại xe đặc biệt, xe tải loại 2, các miễn trừ và ngoại lệ cá nhân nằm ngoài ước tính này.","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"So sánh xe của chính mình có giống nhau không?","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"Không. Nó đặt chi phí ô tô riêng hàng năm mà bạn đã nhập bên cạnh thuế cá nhân ước tính đối với lợi ích ô tô của công ty. Đó là những biện pháp khác nhau; nó không bao gồm chi phí sử dụng lao động, các khoản hoàn trả, tài chính, nhiên liệu, các khoản khấu trừ thuế và toàn bộ giá trị sử dụng cá nhân.","Norway scope and data date":"Phạm vi và ngày dữ liệu của Na Uy","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"Đây là ước tính quy hoạch dành riêng cho Na Uy sử dụng giá xe ô tô tiêu chuẩn 2026 của Skatteetaten, đã kiểm tra 16 tháng 10 2026. Các quy tắc không phụ thuộc vào ngôn ngữ được chọn trên trang này. Đó không phải là tờ khai thuế chính thức, tính thuế đầy đủ hay quyết định pháp lý. Xe đặc biệt và ngoại lệ được loại trừ. Giá là tĩnh trong bản dựng này và không làm mới ở chế độ nền; kiểm tra Skatteetaten cho năm hiện tại trước khi dựa vào chúng.","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"Tính toán chạy trong trình duyệt này. Các số liệu bạn nhập không được tải lên.","Estimate company-car benefit":"Ước tính lợi ích xe công ty","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"MIỄN PHÍ · CHẠY TRÊN TRÌNH DUYỆT CỦA BẠN","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"Quy tắc tiêu chuẩn 2026 của Na Uy dành cho ô tô chở khách. Trang này không suy ra quốc gia tính thuế từ ngôn ngữ của bạn.","Car list price when new, NOK":"Giá niêm yết xe khi mới, NOK","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"Có xe cả tháng trời, 1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"Chiếc xe đã hơn 3 tuổi vào ngày 1 tháng 1","Documented work driving during the year, km":"Có giấy tờ lái xe đi công tác trong năm, km","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"Tôi có nhật ký quãng đường đủ tiêu chuẩn để lái xe đi làm","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"Mức thuế suất cận biên ước tính của bạn, %","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"Chi phí hàng năm cho ô tô của chính bạn, NOK (tùy chọn)","Calculate estimate":"Tính toán ước tính","Reset inputs":"Đặt lại đầu vào","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"Nhập giá niêm yết ban đầu và số tháng có sẵn.","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"Kiểm tra giá niêm yết, tháng, km và tỷ lệ phần trăm; nhập các giá trị không âm hợp lệ.\nƯớc tính","2026 estimate":"2026","List price as new":"Giá niêm yết như mới","Taxable list-price base":"Cơ sở giá niêm yết chịu thuế","Reduced list-price base":"Cơ sở giá niêm yết giảm","Average taxable benefit per month":"Lợi ích chịu thuế trung bình mỗi tháng","Taxable benefit for entered months":"Lợi ích chịu thuế cho các tháng đã nhập","Taxable benefit for a full year":"Lợi ích chịu thuế trong cả năm","Marginal tax rate entered":"Đã nhập thuế suất cận biên","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"Thuế cá nhân ước tính đối với phúc lợi này","Own-car annual cost entered":"Đã nhập chi phí hàng năm cho ô tô riêng","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"Chi phí mua ô tô riêng trừ thuế cá nhân ước tính cho ô tô của công ty","Months included":"Bao gồm tháng","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"3 tuổi trên 1 Đã áp dụng mức giảm tháng 1","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"Đã áp dụng giảm số giờ làm việc được ghi lại","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"Giảm số km cần có nhật ký và hơn 40,000 km làm việc.","Tax year":"Năm tính thuế","Official rate checked":"Đã kiểm tra tỷ giá chính thức","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 giá xe công ty","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · sử dụng xe riêng của công ty","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"Chỉ bối cảnh: chi phí hàng năm cho ô tô riêng và thuế cá nhân ước tính đối với lợi ích ô tô của công ty là những thước đo khác nhau; đây không phải là so sánh tổng chi phí.","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"Lợi ích là thu nhập chịu thuế, không phải hóa đơn thuế. Không bao gồm đầy đủ thuế thu nhập, chi phí sử dụng lao động, khoản hoàn trả hoặc tính toán tài chính.","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"Chạy cục bộ trong trình duyệt này; số liệu đầu vào không được gửi đến máy chủ."},"zh":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"挪威公司汽车税计算器","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"挪威公司汽车税计算器 2026 — 应税福利估算","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"估计挪威私人使用标准公司客车的 2026 应税福利。输入标价、合格折扣、月份和边际税估算。","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"估计私人使用标准公司客车带来的挪威应税工资福利，然后用您输入的边际税率估计个人税。","What does this estimate?":"这个估计是多少？","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"对于挪威的2026标准规则，好处是基于汽车的新车标价，而不是其购买价格。计算器应用已发布的阈值和费率、任何符合条件的年龄或记录的工作里程减少量以及可用月数。","How the estimate works":"估算如何进行","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026 标准权益是折扣标价的 30%，最高可达 370,300 挪威克朗，加上任何超出部分的 20%。标价基础通常为 100%；如果车辆在 1 1 月使用超过三年，或者有记录的工作驾驶超过 40,000 公里，则为 75%；如果这两个条件都适用，则为 56.25%。输入部分年份的整月。估计个人税是应税福利乘以您自己的边际税率；这不是完整的税收计算。","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"应税福利是否等于我缴纳的税款？","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"编号根据标准规则，该福利将添加到应税工资中。单独的税收估算将其乘以您输入的边际税率，并且不会计算您的全额挪威税。","Which car price should I enter?":"我应该输入哪个汽车价格？","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"使用新的标价，包括根据官方规则提供的相关工厂安装和经销商安装的设备。不要使用当前的市场价值或您购买二手车的价格。","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"什么时候可以使用里程减少？","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"仅当工作驾驶由合格里程日志记录且年内超过 40,000 公里时。确切地说，40,000 公里不符合条件。个人驾驶不是工作里程。","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"这是否涵盖所有车辆或公司汽车案例？","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"编号它仅涵盖标准的挪威乘用车规则。特种车辆、2 级货车、豁免和个别例外不在此估计范围内。","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"自家车对比是否同类？","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"编号它将您输入的每年自有汽车成本与公司汽车福利的估计个人税放在一起。这些是不同的措施；它不包括雇主费用、报销、融资、燃料、税收减免和私人使用的全部价值。","Norway scope and data date":"挪威范围和数据日期","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"这是使用 Skatteetaten 的 2026 标准公司汽车费率进行的挪威特定规划估算，已检查 16 10 月 2026。这些规则不取决于此页面上选择的语言。它不是正式的纳税申报表、完整的税收计算或法律决定。特殊车辆和例外情况除外。此版本中的费率是静态的，不会在后台刷新；在依赖它们之前，请检查当年的 Skatteetaten。","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"计算在此浏览器中运行。您输入的数字不会上传。","Estimate company-car benefit":"估计公司汽车效益","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"免费 · 在您的浏览器中运行","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"挪威2026乘用车标准规则。此页面不会根据您的语言推断您的纳税国家/地区。","Car list price when new, NOK":"新车标价，挪威克朗","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"整车可用，1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"该车于 1 1 月已超过 3 岁","Documented work driving during the year, km":"年内记录的工作驾驶，公里","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"我有工作驾驶的合格里程记录","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"您估计的边际税率，%","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"您自己的汽车每年费用，挪威克朗（可选）","Calculate estimate":"计算估算","Reset inputs":"复位输入","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"输入原始标价和可用月份。","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"查看标价、月份、公里数和百分比；输入有效的非负值。","2026 estimate":"2026 估计","List price as new":"标价如新","Taxable list-price base":"应税标价基础","Reduced list-price base":"降低的标价基础","Average taxable benefit per month":"每月平均应税福利","Taxable benefit for entered months":"输入月份的应税福利","Taxable benefit for a full year":"全年应税福利","Marginal tax rate entered":"已输入边际税率","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"此福利的预计个人税","Own-car annual cost entered":"已输入自有汽车年度成本","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"自有汽车成本减去估计的公司汽车个人税","Months included":"包含月份","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"3 岁以上，已应用 1 1 月折扣","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"已记录的工作里程减少已应用","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"减少里程需要日志和超过 40,000 的工作公里数。","Tax year":"纳税年度","Official rate checked":"已检查官方汇率","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 公司汽车费率","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · 公司汽车的私人使用","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"仅上下文：自有汽车的年度成本和公司汽车福利的估计个人税是不同的衡量标准；这不是总成本比较。","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"好处是应税收入，而不是税单。不包括全部所得税、雇主成本、报销或融资计算。","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"在此浏览器中本地运行；输入数字不会发送到服务器。"},"zh_tw":{"Norway Company Car Tax Calculator":"挪威公司汽車稅計算器","Norway Company Car Tax Calculator 2026 — Taxable Benefit Estimate":"挪威公司汽車稅計算器 2026 — 應稅福利估算","Estimate Norway’s 2026 taxable benefit for private use of a standard company passenger car. Enter list price, qualifying reductions, months and your marginal tax estimate.":"估計挪威私人使用標準公司客車的 2026 應稅福利。輸入標價、合格折扣、月份和邊際稅估算。","Estimate the Norwegian taxable salary benefit from private use of a standard company passenger car, then estimate personal tax with a marginal rate you enter.":"估計私人使用標準公司客車帶來的挪威應稅薪資福利，然後用您輸入的邊際稅率估計個人稅。","What does this estimate?":"這個估計是多少？","For Norway’s 2026 standard rules, the benefit is based on the car’s list price as new, not its purchase price. The calculator applies the published threshold and rates, any eligible age or documented work-mileage reduction, and the number of months available.":"對於挪威的2026標準規則，好處是基於汽車的新車標價，而不是其購買價格。計算器應用已發布的閾值和費率、任何符合條件的年齡或記錄的工作里程減少量以及可用月數。","How the estimate works":"估算如何進行","The 2026 standard benefit is 30% of the reduced list price up to NOK 370,300, plus 20% of any excess. The list-price base is normally 100%; it is 75% if the car was more than three years old on 1 January or documented work driving exceeded 40,000 km, and 56.25% when both conditions apply. Enter whole months for a part-year. Estimated personal tax is the taxable benefit multiplied by your own marginal rate; this is not a full tax calculation.":"2026 標準權益是折扣標價的 30%，最高可達 370,300 挪威克朗，加上任何超出部分的 20%。標價基礎通常為 100%；如果車輛在 1 1 月使用超過三年，或者有記錄的工作駕駛超過 40,000 公里，則為 75%；如果這兩個條件都適用，則為 56.25%。輸入部分年份的整月。估計個人稅是應稅福利乘以您自己的邊際稅率；這不是完整的稅務計算。","Does the taxable benefit equal the tax I pay?":"應稅福利是否等於我所繳納的稅金？","No. The benefit is added to taxable salary under the standard rules. The separate tax estimate multiplies it by the marginal rate you enter and does not calculate your full Norwegian tax.":"編號根據標準規則，該福利將添加到應稅工資中。單獨的稅收估算將其乘以您輸入的邊際稅率，並且不會計算您的全額挪威稅。","Which car price should I enter?":"我該輸入哪個汽車價格？","Use the list price as new, including relevant factory-fitted and dealer-installed equipment under the official rules. Do not use the current market value or the price you paid for a used car.":"使用新的標價，包括根據官方規則提供的相關工廠安裝和經銷商安裝的設備。不要使用當前的市場價值或您購買二手車的價格。","When can I use the mileage reduction?":"何時可以使用里程減少？","Only when work driving is documented by a qualifying mileage log and exceeds 40,000 km in the year. Exactly 40,000 km does not qualify. Personal driving is not work mileage.":"僅當工作駕駛由合格里程日誌記錄且年內超過 40,000 公里時。確切地說，40,000 公里不符合條件。個人駕駛不是工作里程。","Does this cover every vehicle or company-car case?":"這是否涵蓋所有車輛或公司汽車案例？","No. It covers the standard Norwegian passenger-car rules only. Special vehicles, vans class 2, exemptions and individual exceptions are outside this estimate.":"編號它只涵蓋標準的挪威乘用車規則。特種車輛、2 級貨車、豁免和個別例外不在此估計範圍內。","Is the own-car comparison like-for-like?":"自家車對比是否同類？","No. It places your entered annual own-car cost next to estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit. Those are different measures; it excludes employer costs, reimbursements, financing, fuel, tax deductions and the full value of private use.":"編號它將您輸入的每年自有汽車成本與公司汽車福利的估計個人稅放在一起。這些是不同的措施；它不包括雇主費用、報銷、融資、燃料、稅收減免和私人使用的全部價值。","Norway scope and data date":"挪威範圍與資料日期","This is a Norway-specific planning estimate using Skatteetaten’s 2026 standard company-car rates, checked 16 October 2026. The rules do not depend on the language selected on this page. It is not an official tax return, full tax calculation or legal decision. Special vehicles and exceptions are excluded. Rates are static in this build and do not refresh in the background; check Skatteetaten for the current year before relying on them.":"這是使用 Skatteetaten 的 2026 標準公司汽車費率進行的挪威特定規劃估算，已檢查 16 10 月 2026。這些規則不取決於此頁面上選擇的語言。它不是正式的報稅表、完整的稅務計算或法律決定。特殊車輛及例外情況除外。此版本中的費率是靜態的，不會在背景刷新；在依賴它們之前，請檢查當年的 Skatteetaten。","Calculations run in this browser. The figures you enter are not uploaded.":"計算在此瀏覽器中運作。您輸入的數字不會上傳。","Estimate company-car benefit":"估價公司汽車效益","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"免費 · 在您的瀏覽器中執行","Norwegian 2026 standard rules for passenger cars. This page does not infer your tax country from your language.":"挪威2026乘用車標準規則。此頁面不會根據您的語言推斷您的納稅國家/地區。","Car list price when new, NOK":"新車標價，挪威克朗","Whole months the car was available, 1–12":"整車可用，1–12","The car was more than 3 years old on 1 January":"該車於 1 1 月已超過 3 歲","Documented work driving during the year, km":"年內記錄的工作駕駛，公里","I have a qualifying mileage log for the work driving":"我有工作駕駛的合格里程紀錄","Your estimated marginal tax rate, %":"您估計的邊際稅率，%","Your own-car annual cost, NOK (optional)":"您自己的汽車每年費用，挪威克朗（可選）","Calculate estimate":"計算估算","Reset inputs":"重設輸入","Enter the original list price and the months available.":"輸入原始標價和可用月份。","Check the list price, months, kilometres and percentage; enter valid non-negative values.":"查看標價、月份、公里數和百分比；輸入有效的非負值。","2026 estimate":"2026 估計","List price as new":"標價如新","Taxable list-price base":"稅標價基礎","Reduced list-price base":"降低的標價基礎","Average taxable benefit per month":"每月平均課稅福利","Taxable benefit for entered months":"輸入月份的應稅福利","Taxable benefit for a full year":"全年應稅福利","Marginal tax rate entered":"已輸入邊際稅率","Estimated personal tax on this benefit":"此福利的預計個人稅","Own-car annual cost entered":"已輸入自有汽車年度成本","Own-car cost minus estimated company-car personal tax":"自有汽車成本減去估計的公司汽車個人稅","Months included":"包含月份","Over 3 years old on 1 January reduction applied":"3 歲以上，已應用 1 1 月折扣","Documented work-mileage reduction applied":"已記錄的工作里程減少已應用","Mileage reduction requires a logbook and more than 40,000 work km.":"減少里程需要記錄和超過 40,000 的工作公里數。","Tax year":"課稅年度","Official rate checked":"已檢查官方匯率","Skatteetaten · 2026 company-car rates":"Skatteetaten · 2026 公司汽車費率","Skatteetaten · private use of a company car":"Skatteetaten · 公司汽車的私人使用","Context only: own-car annual cost and estimated personal tax on a company-car benefit are different measures; this is not a total-cost comparison.":"僅上下文：自有汽車的年度成本和公司汽車福利的估計個人稅是不同的衡量標準；這不是總成本比較。","The benefit is taxable income, not the tax bill. No full income-tax, employer-cost, reimbursement or financing calculation is included.":"好處是應稅收入，而不是稅單。不包括全部所得稅、雇主成本、報銷或融資計算。","Runs locally in this browser; input figures are not sent to a server.":"在此瀏覽器中本機運作；輸入數字不會傳送到伺服器。"}});
